<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Namgumgu Namun Ige Hal</para>
  <para style="toc1">Namgumgu Namun Ige Hal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Namgumgu</para>
  <para style="toc3">NAM</para>
  <para style="mt">Namgumgu Namun Ige Hal</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivētleg ige tin̄qoy so vasemlō Noyoy Ēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teofilas, lōbōk namuk mey am̄ag en, no mayap gatay tawye haphap del a Tigsas magaleg geh tō, wa mavatvatgo tō, leqtēqtēg <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mēdēn̄ a lōqōn̄ mey Ḡod melep kal kē alge. Am̄ag den Tigsas mēvēy kal alge en, kē metyak ige hal nonon, tō mavasemlō nahap a kēy so galeg heylō naman ne Vu Yon̄. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Lēkle yon̄ memeh nonon en, kē makalō woet me hiy ige hal. Tō kē maklō kē van hiy kēy bōqōn̄ son̄wul vet (40). Tō kē mavasemlō galsi so kē mēh lokse lemtehal m̄adeg. Tō kē mohohole gatay namtehal a Ḡod so nimyanag goy ige nonon.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag kēy gengen tiwag en, tō Tigsas mohohole maymay van hiy ige hal so, “Nitog vanvan veteg Jerusalem, ba dēyē veg nahap a Imam mino melgēg, wa mey a kimi moyon̄teg tō den no. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Veg Jon mavasugyon̄ kimi mi nēbē, ba et misin te Ḡod tavasugyon̄ kimi mi Nuvu Yon̄.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Mahē kēy mahag tiwag en, tō kēy vēhge van Tigsas wo, “?Welan, qiyig gōh nēk so van me namyanag liwo lengon ige Tisrael ēnōk?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ba Tigsas meplu van hiy kēy so, “Nōqōn̄ ne haphap geh nen, Imam mahgen movonyak, ba et namunmi te so kimi so ēglal. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ba Nuvu Yon̄ tēhēw kimi wa telep naman van hiy kimi. Tō kimi so vasemlō no van hiy ige n̄a Jerusalem, wa vel vōnō Judea, Samaria, wa tō vel mayam del.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Tigsas nihole bah, tō kēy etet leptō van hiy kē wah, Ḡod nilep kal kē alge, tō namlēg vitwag nigaygoy kē, tō kēy et etsas lok site kē.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Kēy etet lapgetō hag alge en, tō kēy so et van qelekē net vōyō tig tiwag tō mi kēy. Kōyō mehey qēt namalsam qagqag, tō kōyō vap van hiy kēy so, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />“!Kimi Takalili! ?Kimi tig sey tō gōh, tō etet ketket hag alge en bahap? Ḡod mal lep kal Tigsas den kimi n̄a lōtōk alge. Ba kē mahgen tavan lokse me lemtehal a qele kē mōm̄ōl kal tō aē en.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige hal metyak net vitwag so nileh natnon Judas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Bahnentō, ige hal nen hatig den nuwutwut nan, a kēy ōl so Nuwutwut Ne Olif, tō van lokse Jerusalem. Nuwutwut nan kē sisqet ēwē napnō. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Tō kēy van dēn̄ me lēm̄ a kēy motog tō aē am̄ag. Nēm̄ nan nehey vag yō, ba nidin nan alge. Tō kēy yōstiwag lidin nan. Nahan ige nan wa Pita, Jon, Jemes, Andrō, Filip, Tomas, Batholomiw, Mathiw, tiwag mi Jemes a ēntēn Alfeus ōk, tō Simon a Silot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navavap gōh ‘silot’ en, nēdēmdēm nan so ikē liviwti et vitwag a kēy nemyōs so suwyeg yak ige Torom den lepnō non ige Juw.</char></note>, bahnentō Judas a ēntēn Jemes. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Ige gōh tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn, tō Mere a tita non Tigsas tiwag mi ige yathēthēn Tigsas, vaga kēy qultiwag batatay.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Qōn̄ vitwag, ige mey nēdēmtig Tigsas van tiwag me. Kēy tege m̄eldēl vag tiwag son̄wul yō (120). Tō Pita nihatig hag tō nihohole van hiy kēy. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16-17" />Tō Pita wo, “Yathithik wa ige tētētek, me am̄ag Nuvu Yon̄ mohole heylō Mayanag Devēt veg Judas. Nayapyap Yon̄ mavasemlō so ikē vitwag den gēn, tō kē temgumgu tiwag mi gēn, ba ikē nen a titig helem̄ag me ige so tēy Tigsas en. Ba natawye vavap del a Layapyap Yon̄ so nak tig, tō mal aktig qēt.”<verse eid="ACT 1:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Ba Judas en, kē melep nayseyse bahap mey nehet a kē mak tō. Tō kē melep nēvētan aē. Nēvētan nen, kē misisgoy lok aē, tō mēqēswoy natqan a nētna nonon makakalō. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Tō ige sil del Tejerusalem moyon̄teg noyoy nan, tō kēy mōl nahe mahē nen so, “Akeldama” a lagatgat nonoy, kēy ōl so, “Natno day.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Tō Pita hohole laptō. Kē wo, “Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap lōbōk Sam so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Itōk so nēm̄ nonon nitaq mamah qeleanen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">tō net tit tog vēhte aē.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 69:25</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">“Wa tō,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Itōk so net vitwag nileh natno mugumgu nonon.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 109:8</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />“Tō veg bege gōh en, itōk so net vitwag niqultiwag mi kemem tō so vasemlō so Welan Tigsas mahatig lok tō den namatmat. Ba itōk so gēn etyak net vitwag mey a mavan tiwag tō mi kemem lēvētmahē del a Tigsas mavan kēlkēl tiwag tō mi kemem, meqtēg mahē a Jon mavasugyon̄ kē, tō mēdēn̄ lōqōn̄ a Ḡod melep kal kē alge.”<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Tō kēy m̄ōk kal nahe et vōyō. Net totogyeg nahan Jōsēp, a tekel han Basabas si so Justus. Tō net vōyō negi, nahan Matias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24-25" />Tō kēy tatay so, “Welan, nēk nēglal nēdēmdēm non ige del. Tō nēk nēglal so ihē itōk so tēygoy namgumgu non ige hal, a Judas mukēg veteg tō, tō mavan nitiy vōnō nonon. Bastō, vasemlō me hiy kemem ihēte den yoge gōh a nēk mal etyak tēymat.”<verse eid="ACT 1:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Tō kēy suwsuwyeg nevet susu so etyak vitwag den yoge vōyō anen, tō nahan Matias makalō me. Tō kēy m̄ōk kal Matias, tō vatah kē tiwag mi ige hal son̄wul nanm̄e vitwag.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Nuvu Yon̄ nihēw me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Nōqōn̄ Pentekos<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pentekos en, nōqōn̄ liwo vitwag non ige Juw. Lōqōn̄ nan kēy vēwē Ḡod veg begengen a kē nileplep van hiy kēy. Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so ige Juw del so van tiwag me n̄a Jerusalem bōqōn̄ nan tō so lep van nolol nonoy. Exodus 23:16, 34:22, Leviticus 23:15-21, Deuteronomy 16:9-12</char></note> mavan me en, tō ige del mey a nēdēmtig Tigsas en, kēy nahag tiwag mahē vitwag. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Kēy haghag leptō wah, kēy yon̄teg qelekē naln̄e len̄ liwo nivan ganwon me, tō nēm̄ nan niōyheg mi naln̄e valiqōqō. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Tō kēy met nahapqiyig qeleso nagayme ep mavan me, tō nep nen nivēl woywoy, ba niyow hag velvel apwoy del. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Tō kēy del mōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, wa tō qētēg hohole mi nagatgat tegtegha. Veg Nuvu Yon̄ nileplep van naman hiy kēy aē.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ba lōqōn̄ liwo nan, ige Juw m̄adeg vanvan me den napnō tegtegha so vatēp Jerusalem. Kēy mavan me den vel vōnō lelo mayam, wa kēy nēdēmap galsi Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Kēy moyon̄teg naln̄e valiqōqō gōh tō kēy van tiwag so et. Tō kēy mamamakē veg kēy yon̄yon̄teg vēglal nohohole geh gōh mi nagatgat nonoy togolgol.<verse eid="ACT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kēy mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn, tō kēy hohole wo, “!Atmi yon̄teg tow! ?Wō ige gōh ige Takalili ēwē? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />?Qeleave tō vivitwag den gēn moyon̄teg vēglal nagatgat togolgol nonon? Veg igēn del gōh mavan me den napnō tegtegha. <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wa yatkelgi mavan me den Patia, Midia, Elam, Mesopotamia, Judea, Kapadosia, Pontus, Esia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Frigia kōyō Pamfilia, Itsip tiwag mi yatkel vōnō n̄a Libia a sisqet Sayrine. Wa tō ige Torom geh gōh <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(yatkel Juw tiwag mi ige mey a motog lolqōn̄ tō am̄ag), wa ige Tikrit, tiwag mi ige Tarabia. !Ba kēy hohole mi nitiy gatgat togolgol nongēn bahaphap lililwo a Ḡod magaleg geh tō.”<verse eid="ACT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kēy mamakē aē, wa kēy et ēglal galsi te aē. Tō kēy vēy vēvēhiy lokse kēy, “?Wō qeleave qelegōh yēhē?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ba yatkel et boyboyheg kēy, ba vavap so, “Ige gōh min meh nawaen.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nihole van hiy ige sil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ba Pita nihatig hag tiwag mi ige hal son̄wul nanm̄e vitwag en, tō nihole liwo van hiy ige sil so, “!Yēhē bulbulsal! Kimi ige Juw, tiwag mi ige Tejerusalem del en, atmi yon̄teg galsi me hiy no. Ba nok vasemlō galsi van hiy kimi nam̄e dēmdēm ne age agōh. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Ō-ō-ō, ige gōh et toron̄ te qele a kimi vap en, veg nalo levevet ēwē a lemtap. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Nage a kimi met gōh en, ikē qele a net belgēlgēg Joel mayap vasem tō, so<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Ḡod vap so ‘Babah ne qōn̄ en, no tōlōwyeg galsi Nuvu mino apwon ige del,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Ige nētnētm̄ey tam̄an wa ige nētnētm̄ey lōqōvēn nonmi en, kēy tohohole lēgēlgēg.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Tō ige lōmlōmgep nonmi tet nahap a Ḡod taklō van hiy kēy.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Tō ige tamatmayge nonmi toqoyqoy noqoyqoy den namyeyen talge.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Lōqōn̄ nen no tōlōwyeg tēqēl me Nuvu mino apwon ige mugumgu mino, ige tam̄an tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">tō kēy tohole lēgēlgēg.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Lōtōk alge no tagaleg naphah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">tō lemyam antan kē kimi tetsas nēvēglal nam̄adeg.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Tō naday tolon̄ wa nep taga tiwag mi nahō a nemtēmtēl.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Am̄ag den nōqōn̄ non Welan en, nalo temlēglēg, wa nōwōl tavan me nilawlaw qeleso naday.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">Nōqōn̄ non Welan tavan me, ikē nōqōn̄ liwo wa ikē nēlēn̄as.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Tō ige del mey a kēy ōlōl van lahan Welan en, Welan tavaēh kēy.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Joel 2:28-32</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“!Yēhē Tisrael, yon̄teg galsi nohohole mino! Tigsas Tanasaret en, Ḡod mavasemlō galsi so ikē hēyhēywē. Veg kimi nēglal vatag naphah, nēvēglal, wa namgumgu lililwo a Ḡod mak heylō kē lengomi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ḡod mōm̄ōk kē lemnemi qele a kē mēdēmdēm vasig tō aē am̄ag. Tō kimi mukēg kē van lemnen ige gengenyeg a et Juw te tō so wuh mat kē apwo wolwol. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ba Ḡod me lepyak nememeh ne matmat den kē, wa mak ēh lok kē den namte. Veg namte tit tēygoy vēhte kē. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Veg am̄ag Mayanag Devēt mohole gatay Welan so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Vaga nok etet so Welan nitig helem̄ag no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Veg kē tiwag mi no en, tō no tit mētēgteg vēhte.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Veg bege gōh en natqek nimlaklak wa naplek niōlōl mi namlaklak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Nok dēmdēyē so nēk tavaēh no, nataqn̄ēk tō m̄ōkheg vēh veg bēdēmdēm nan.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Veg nēk tit ukēg veteg te no leqyan̄,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">wa nēk tit ukēg veteg vēhte Net Yon̄ nōnōm so niqōn.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Nēk mal vasemlō me namtehal ne ēh hiy no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">tō van lengē en nēk tōyheg no mi namlaklak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 16:8-11</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Eh yathithik, nok so vasemlō temunmi van so tamayge Devēt mamat en, tō kēy metvig kē, tō nōqyōn entō tiwag mi gēn qiyig agōh. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ba Devēt en, ikē net lēgēlgēg, tō kē nēglal navatvat non Ḡod. Veg Ḡod melgēg tō so nim̄ōk bōbō nonon so nihag leleh letno mayanag non Devēt. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Kē met nahap a so tavan me en, tō kē mavaplō so Kraēs tahatig lok, aso Ḡod tit ukēg veteg vēhte kē Amnō<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navap Amnō en, lagatgat Tikrik en kēy ōl so ‘Hades’ si so ‘Sheol.’ Mahē net nimat en, natalan nivan Amnō. Tō yatkel talege nivan lemyeyen talge hiy Ḡod, wa yatkelgi nihag dēyē nōqōn̄ bēvēvēg.</char></note>, wa nataqn̄ēn tit saq vēhte.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />“Tigsas gōh en, Ḡod mak ēh lok kē den namatmat. Kemem met mi namtamem, tō kemem vasemlō van hiy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Tō Ḡod melep kal kē, tō m̄ōk kē van lemtō nonon. Tō Ḡod melep van Nuvu Yon̄ nonon hiy kē, qele a kē mal vatvat vatag. Tō Tigsas mōlōwyeg me Nuvu Yon̄ nonon, tō kimi met, wa moyon̄teg ēgēn.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />“Wa tō, Devēt et vēykal te lemyeyen talge, ba kē mohole gatay bōbō nonon lokse, tō mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Welan mavap hiy Welan mino, so ‘Nēk haghiy letno liwo a lemtō mino,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />ba nēk dēyē gaydēn̄ a nok tēvēvēg ige tavale nōnōm, tō m̄ōk tēqēl kēy how labalbe yēn̄ē tō vayvay apwoy.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 110:1</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Sōwlē, yēhē ige Tisrael del, nok hole maymay hiy kimi so Tigsas, a kimi mowos kal kē lowolwol en, Ḡod mōm̄ōk kal kē so ikē Welan wa Kraēs.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige m̄adeg dēmtig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ige sil moyon̄teg qelegōh en, tō nohohole nan meyey lepyay. Tō kēy mohole hiy Pita tiwag mi ige hal yatkelgi, wo, “?Yathithik, wō kemem tak qeleave?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Tō Pita meplu, so “Atmi dēm leh, ba van me vasugyon̄ lahan Tigsas Kraēs, tō so kē nidēmveteg negengenyeg nonmi. Tō kē tohog van Nuvu Yon̄ hiy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ḡod mavatvat tō aē, hiy kimi, tiwag mi ige yantintimi, tiwag mi ige mey a yeh ōk. Navatvat gōh hiy ige del mey a Welan Ḡod nongēn niōlōl kēy.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Tō Pita mavap vētday kēy mi nohohole tegtegha se, tō vēhge maymay kēy so, “!Atmi van yak den ige het qiyig kē, veg nēvēvēg tiple qal kimi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ige mey moyon̄teg noyoy gōh wa mēdēmtig en, kēy mavasugyon̄. Lōqōn̄ nen, ige a muqul tiwag mi ige non Tigsas en, kēy teyvag tēl (3,000).<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēh non ige mey a nēdēmtig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Tō kēy tēy maymay navatvatne non ige hal, tō kēy tatay vaga, hayhay tiwag vaga, wa gengen yon̄ vaga. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Tō Ḡod mak woqse vahah wa nēvēglal heylō ige hal, tō ige del mihiyey aē. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vaga kēy hay tiwag, tō kēy gasēg nahaphap del tiwag. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Tō kēy n̄eyeg nēvētan nonoy tiwag mi yatkel haphap se, tō so biyin̄ ige vivitwag bemyōs nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Kēy qultiwag galsi. Vel qōn̄ kēy hay tiwag Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod. Tō kēy gengen tiwag velvel ēm̄. Kēy gengen mi namlaklak, wa kēy dēm bēbēw kēy. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Tō kēy ōl liwo Ḡod. Tō ige sil memlaklak hiy kēy. Tō vel qōn̄ Welan nilep van niviwti et se hiy ige a kē so nivaēh kēy.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Pita mak wē net vitwag a neqyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag en, Pita kōyō Jon mavan me Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol a lelo vētēl a lemyēpyep, togolgol lelo a kēy tatay aē en. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ba net vitwag gōh, kē mowot me neqyus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navap neqyus en, nēdēmdēm nan so kē et vanvan te, ba nihag ēwē mahē vitwag.</char></note>. Vel qōn̄ del kēy lep kē me lemtegeay ne Ēm̄ Bolol. (Namtegeay nan a kēy ōlōl so “Newenwen.”) Tō kē nivēvēhge nēsēm den ige sil mey a kēy vanvan basay kē so hayveg kal Lēm̄ Yon̄ alge.<verse eid="ACT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Kē nihaghag en, ba met Pita kōyō Jon van me so hayveg hay Lēm̄ Bolol. Tō kē nivēhge van hiy kōyō nēsēm. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Ba Pita kōyō met tenenen van hiy kē, tō vap so, “Et me hiy kamyō.”<verse eid="ACT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kē met van hiy kōyō, a kē dēm van so kē telep te hap den kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Tō Pita mavap so, “Nēsēm liwo wa nēsēm su tateh mi no, ba nahap a aē mi no en, nok lep van hiy nēk. !Lahan Tigsas Kraēs Tanasaret, nēk hatig ba vanvan!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Pita nitēy namnen mey namtō, tō niyap kal kē. Tō vag tiwag ēwē nayn̄on niwē. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Tō kē niyow ketket, nivanvan. Tō kē nihayveg tiwag mi kōyō lelo Ēm̄ Bolol. Tō kē nivanvan kēlkēl, niyowyow, wa niōl liwo nahan Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Ige sil metsas so kē mavanvan kēlkēl tō mōl liwo Ḡod en, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />tō kēy mamakē aē veg kēy nēglal so kē net bēvēhge sēm Lemtegeay Wenwen. Tō ige sil mam̄alyow a nēkēkēn bahap a mak wē kē.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nihohole van hiy ige sil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Net a meqyōs tō en, kē mēsēl goy Pita kōyō Jon. Tō ige sil mam̄alyow aē, wa ige sil se mosotaq veg kē. Tō kēy meplaplag me mahē nan, a Lamalmali Ēm̄ non Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Pita met van hiy kēy en, tō kē wo, “Yēhē ige Tisrael, bahap tō kimi mamakē aē? ?Bahap tō kimi etet me hiy kamyō? ?Kimi dēm so net gōh mavanvan kēlkēl en, so veg kamyō netnenen? Kamyō et ak wē te kē mi naman non mamyō. Tateh. <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Ḡod non Abraham, Isak, Jakop, wa Ḡod non ige yatqōtqōngēn en, kē mak naphah gōh tō so niōl liwo net mugumgu nonon. Nok hole veg Tigsas, mey a kimi mitiayak kē, tō m̄ōk kē van lemnen Paelat so wuh mat kē. Paelat nemyōs so ukēg taywah kē en, ba kimi mēlēn̄lēn̄teg kē. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Kimi mēlēn̄lēn̄teg Tigsas mey noyon̄ wa netnenen, tō kimi mēvēhge Paelat so ukēg taywah net wuhbel van hiy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Tō kimi muwuh mat nōtōti ēh, ba Ḡod melep kal lok kē den namatmat. Kemem met tō kē mi namtamem, a kē mahatig lokse den namatmat. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Heylō nēdēmtig lahan Tigsas en, net gōh, a kimi net vēglal, kē namaymay. Nahan Tigsas, wa nēdēmtig a nivan me heylō kē en, kē mavaēh net gōh lengomi.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Yēhē yathithik, nahap mey nehet a kimi magaleg en, no nēglal so kimi mak veg kimi et ēglal te aē, wa ige lililwo nonmi se. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ba igōhkē namtehal a Ḡod maktig nahap a ige lēgēlgēg melgēg tō, a kēy vap so Kraēs nonon toyon̄ memeh. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Tō togtōkē, atmi wulyis nēdēmdēm nonmi, ba van me hiy Ḡod tō so kē nak wenwen kimi den nubug naganmi. Wa tō so Ḡod telep me navawē nonon hiy kimi, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />wa tō so kē tēvētleg me Kraēs. Veg Ḡod mōm̄ōk Tigsas so ikē Kraēs, tō kē so nimyanag goy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Tigsas totog hag lōtōk alge en gaydēn̄ a Ḡod tak wē lokse nahaphap del. Mey nen nahap a kē mavatvat tō am̄ag heylō ige lēgēlgēg yon̄ nonon. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Veg Mosis mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 3:22">Welan Ḡod nonmi telep kal net lēgēlgēg vitwag qele ino. Ikē net vitwag den kimi. Tō kimi so yon̄teg kē bahaphap del a kē nihole van hiy kimi.<verse eid="ACT 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Veg net mey a et yon̄teg te kē en, Ḡod totot yak kē den ige sil tō kē tamatlat.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 18:15, 18-19</char></note><verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />“Hēywē, togtōkē nahaphap del mey a ige et lēgēlgēg mohole gatay tō am̄ag en, nahaphap nan niakaktig lengōngēn. Qētēg mi Samuel gaydēn̄ ige et lēgēlgēg a mavan me atgiy, kēy mohole gatay qiyig agōh. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Tō kimi ige nētnētm̄ey non ige lēgēlgēg, tō kimi tadam tatag navatvat a Ḡod mavatvat tō hiy kēy am̄ag. Ḡod mavatvat van hiy Abraham so, ‘Heylō yantēnti, no tavawē ige sil del telemyam.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 22:18, Genesis 26:4</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Tatag van lemtehal nan en, kē melep kal net mugumgu nonon. Tō kē mēvētleg me hiy kimi am̄ag so nivawē kimi. Navawē nan en, kē niwulyis kimi den namtevumi mey nehet.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pita kōyō Jon nitig lengo Kansel Sanhedrin bēvēvēg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Mahē Pita kōyō Jon hole laptō hiy ige sil wah, ige lililwo van me hiy kōyō. Kēy ige pris, tiwag mi ige bēlēltegoy Tiy Ēm̄ Bolol, wa ige Sadusi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ige Sadusi en, ikēy napati vitwag non ige Juw. Kēy et m̄adeg te qeleso Nafarisi, ba ige et lililwo m̄adeg en, kēy ige Sadusi. Vaga kēy vagal mi ige Farisi. Ige Sadusi nēdēmtig so mahē net so nimat en, kē tit hatig lokse vēhte. Tō kēy dēmtig so tateh in̄sel, wa tateh vu geh lemyam.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Kēy mololgagay veg ige hal motoytoy gatay Tigsas hiy ige sil. Veg kōyō motoytoy so mahē Tigsas mamat wa mēh lokse en, kē mak namtehal hiy ige sil so tētēy vēh nēh lap. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Tō kēy mētēy kōyō. Ba veg sisqet mahē niqōn̄ en, kēy mōm̄ōk bat kōyō lēm̄ yētyēt mēdēn̄ taval meyen. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ba nam̄adeg den ige sil mey moyon̄teg noyoy, kēy mēdēmtig, tō qul tiwag ige non Tigsas. Bastō ige non Tigsas en, kēy van me teyvag tēvēlēm (5,000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Taval meyen nan hag, ige lililwo Tejerusalem mahay tiwag bōyōstiwag nonoy. Ikēy ige mayanag, ige tamatmayge bitigtig helem̄ag, wa ige vatvatgo ne Le. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Tō Anas se, a kē nam̄agoy ige pris, tiwag mi Kayafas, Jon, wa Aleksanda, tiwag mi yatkel et se den niginwotwot non ige pris. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kēy del mōyōstiwag so vēvēg Pita kōyō Jon. Tō kēy mēvētgiy kōyō van lēvētnay ba vēvēhiy kōyō, wo “?Lahan maymay wa lahan hē kōmyō magaleg qelenen?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Pita nōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, ba mavap van hiy kēy so, “!Yēhē ige mayanag wa ige lililwo! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Sowo kimi helet etgal kamyō so qeleave tō kamyō mak namgumgu mey nēwē van hiy net quyus gōh, wa tō so qeleave nayn̄on mēwē lokse, itōk. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Atmi del yon̄teg galsi, wa ige del Tisrael se. Net gōh, kē nitig lengomi tō kē mēwē heylō lahan Tigsas Kraēs Tanasaret, mey a kimi mowos lowolwol, ba Ḡod mavaēh lok kē den namatmat. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Tigsas en, ikē</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘nahan̄ vet mey a kimi bētēytēy ēm̄ mepsipteg tō en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">tō kē may van me nam̄e han̄.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 118:22</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />“Kē mahgen tavaēh vēh net, veg tateh hah tegha se a Ḡod melep van so vaēh net aē.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Kēy met van so Pita kōyō Jon et hiyey te, tō kēy met vēglal so kōyō et sukul galsi te, tō kēy mamakē bololmeyen nōyō. Tō kēy met vēglal so kōyō motog tiwag tō mi Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kēy nemyōs so et hethet kōyō, ba kēy met vēglal net a mēwē lokse nitig tiwag mi kōyō en, tō tateh hap se so kēy so vap.<verse eid="ACT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Tō kēy m̄ōk lō kōyō den nōyōstiwag, tō kēy vonopnog veg kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Kēy vēy vēvēhiy lokse kēy wo, “?Gēn tak qeleave hiy yoge gōh? Veg nisil del Tejerusalem mal ēglal so kōyō mak naphah mey nitiy wē, tō gēn tit lēn̄lēn̄teg vēhte. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ba noyoy gōh tiple ga vētmahē del. Itōk so gēn gatgoy kōyō so nitog hohole nowmat se lahah agōh.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Tō ige lililwo ōlōl kōyō tō mōlgontegoy kōyō so nitog hohole gatay lokse wa nitog vatvatgo lahan Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ba Pita kōyō Jon meplu goy kēy so, “?Kimi dēmdēm van qeleave, itōk so kamyō yon̄teg kimi si so yon̄teg Ḡod? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />!Kamyō tit tēygoy vēhte nahap mey a kamyō met wa moyon̄teg tō!”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21-22" />Tō kēy soksok lēlēge namtehal a so tēvēvēg vēh kōyō aē, veg ige sil ōliwo Ḡod bephah nan. Veg net a Ḡod mavaēh kē en, nēte nonon mal lege son̄wul vet. Bastō kēy mēvēgsoy kōyō, tō ukēg kōyō.<verse eid="ACT 4:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natatay non ige mey a nēdēmtig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Mahē ige m̄agoy ige pris tiwag mi ige lililwo mukēg taywah Pita kōyō Jon en, tō kōyō van lok hiy ige nonoyō. Tō kōyō vasemlō nohohole del nonoy.<verse eid="ACT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ige nonoyō moyon̄teg en, tō kēy mahay tiwag me tō kēy ōlōl van hiy Ḡod, so “Welan, nēk mitin̄ tō nōtōq, nēvētan, nanaw, wa nahaphap del van aē en. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Nēk mohole tō heylō leplan Devēt, net mugumgu nōnōm wa bōbō nongēn. Nēk melep me nohohole gōh heylō Nuvu Yon̄, so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘?Bahap tō ige lolqōn̄ lolgagay hiy Ḡod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">tō ige sil vonopnog yeghuquy ēwē?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Ige mayanag telemyam tēymat so vagal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">tō ige lililwo mahay tiwag me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">so tavale mi Welan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">wa mi Kraēs nonon.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 2:1-2</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Hēywē, Herod tiwag mi Pontus Paelat mahag tiwag mi ige mey et Juw te, wa tiwag mi ige sil Tisrael. Tō lelqelqevōnō gōh en, kēy mepnog so tavale mi net mugumgu yon̄ nōnōm, Tigsas, a nēk matan̄ōp tō kē, so ikē Kraēs. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ba nahap a nēk mēdēm vasig tō mi navak nōnōm en, kēy malaylay.<verse eid="ACT 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />“Togtōkē, nēk et galsi van hiy ige lililwo a kēy tig het tō kemem gōh. !Ḡod, vaphiy maymay kemem ige mugumgu nōnōm so tig netnet bavaplō nohohole nōnōm! <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Hog kal namne so vaēh ige gom ba ak nēvēglal wa naphah lahan net mugumgu nōnōm Tigsas, a noyon̄.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bahnentō, kēy matatay bah nen, tō nēm̄ a kēy hag tō aē en miyiyeg. Tō kēy ōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, tō kēy vasemlō nohohole non Ḡod mi navaksay.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Notogtog non ige a nēdēmtig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Tō ige a nēdēmtig en, kēy memwugoy lēdēmdēm wa lelo taqay del. Tō vitwag et vap te so nonon mahgen, ba kēy magasēg kēy bahaphap del nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Tō nohohole non ige hal naman nan aē. Tō kēy mavasemlō galsi so Tigsas mahatig lok me den namatmat. Tō nasgōp del notog tiwag mi kēy. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Alon mi kēy tateh et mey a kēy nemyōs namyimyin̄. Veg ige mey a lēvētan tiwag mi nēm̄ nonoy aē en, kēy men̄yeg. Tō kēy melep nēsēm nan <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />tō van tēy me hiy ige hal, so biyin̄ kēy aē. Tō ige hal magasēg nēsēm nan hiy ige a nemyōs namyimyin̄.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Net vitwag aē mi kēy, ikē Jōsēp, ba ige hal mōl tō so Banabas, ba nēdēmdēm nan alon so “net bavasōsōp.” Kē niginwotwot non ige Livay, tō napnō nonon Sayprus. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Tō kē men̄yeg tekel vētan nonon. Tō kē melep me nēsēm nan, tō nilep van lengon ige hal mi nēdēmap.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias kōyō Saphira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Net vitwag, nahan Ananias, tiwag mi ēgnōn, nahan Saphira, kōyō men̄yeg natkel vētan noyō. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ba kē mohog ēwē van natkel sēm hiy ige hal, tō magalgal so nēsēm del bēvētan anen. Ba kē mōlōn̄veg bat natkel sēm so nonon. Tō ēgnōn nēglal galsi aē, veg kōyō mepnopnog tō so ak qeleanen.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Bahnentō, Pita mavap van hiy kē wo, “?Ananias, bahap tō nēk mukēg Satan so nitig helem̄ag nēdēmdēm nōnōm? !Nēk magalgal Nuvu Yon̄ anen! Veg nēk mētēy lōn̄veg natkel sēm ne vētan en so nōnōm mahge. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Am̄ag a nēk et n̄eyeg qete en, nēvētan nan nōnōm. Tō nēk men̄yeg en, tō nēk so tēygoy qēt, veg nēsēm nan en nōnōm. ?Nēk magalgal qele gōh bahap? !Nēk et galgal te net, nēk galgal Ḡod anen!”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananias moyon̄teg van nohohole gōh en, tō vag tiwag ēwē kē nisisgoy tō nimat. Tō ige del a moyon̄teg noyoy gōh en, kēy memtēgteg qēt aē. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Tō yatkel lōmlōmgep hayveg hay me, tō m̄on kē, tō hah lō kē, tō tivig kē.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Et misin hōn te a lōqōn̄ anen, ēgnōn nihayveg me, ba kē et ēglal qete aso Ananias mal mat en. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Tō Pita nivēhge van hiy kē wo, “Saphira, vasem galsi tow so nēsēm ne vētan a kōmyō men̄yeg tō en vēvēh. ?Bah a kōmyō melep me en siso natkelgi nan lapgetō?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Ba Saphira so, “Nēsēm nan bah anen.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Tō Pita wo, “?Bahap tō kōmyō natm̄an nōnōm magalgal Nuvu Yon̄? !Et van kē! Ige a metvig tō natm̄an nōnōm en tig sey tō lemte ēm̄ agōh. !Kēy so hah lō se nēk!”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Vag tiwag ēwē anen nalqōvēn nen nisisgoy hōw a leyn̄on ige hal en tō nimat. Ige lōmlōmgep nen hayveg me en, tō et van qelekē so kē mal mat. Tō kēy hah lō se kē, ba tivig kē a laqaqayan natm̄an nonon. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Tō namtēgteg liwo maqal ige tēlēm̄ yon̄, tiwag mi ige sil del a moyon̄teg van qele agōh.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naphah tiwag mi nage bamamakē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Tō Nuvu Yon̄ mak nēvēglal wa naphah m̄adeg heylō namnen ige hal lengon ige sil. Ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ qultiwag galsi, tō vaga kēy yōstiwag a Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol, a Lamalmali Ēm̄ non Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ige tegha nēdēmap ige tēlēm̄ yon̄, ba et yōstiwag te mi kēy, veg namtēgteg aē mi kēy. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Tō Nuvu Yon̄ nituan se net m̄adeg hiy kēy a nēdēmtig Welan, ige tam̄an wa ige lōqōvēn. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Bahnentō ige sil melep me ige gom lemtehal a Pita nivanvan aē. Kēy muwulhiy kēy how latamge wa leqe nonoy, tō so nēnēnēn Pita niqal yatkel et den kēy. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Tō ige sil m̄adeg mavan me den vel vōnō yatkelgi sisqet Jerusalem. Kēy mēvēl me ige mey nogom, wa ige mey a nuvu het maqal tō kēy. Tō kēy del mēwē lokse.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige lililwo m̄ōk ige hal lēm̄ yētyēt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Tō Nipris Liwo tiwag mi ige lēvēwti nonon, a nēvēwti nan a ige Sadusi en, kēy moyow hatig veg kēy meqneg ige hal. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Tō kēy mētēy kēy, tō mōm̄ōk kēy lēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Tō anqōn̄ nen, nin̄sel non Welan niwak namte-ēm̄ ne ēm̄ yētyēt tō nitig helem̄ag kēy, tō kēy kalō aslil. Tō kē nivap so, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Atmi van tig n̄a Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol, tō vasemlō hiy ige sil del noyoy ne eh lap.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bastō lemtap qōtō en, ige hal makalbat hay Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol tō kēy qētēg vatvatne, qele a nin̄sel mavap tō en. Ba taval Ēm̄ Yon̄ en, net m̄agoy ige pris tiwag mi ige lēvēwti nonoy en, kēy ōlōl tiwag kēy me nēvēwti mayanag, a kēy ōl so Sanhedrin. Lōyōstiwag gōh en, kēy mōlōl vel mayanag del, wa vel et lililwo del non ige Tisrael. Kēy mētēymat bah en, tō kēy ōlvayēg so lep lō me ige hal den lēm̄ yētyēt.<verse eid="ACT 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mahē ige yowyowveg nonoy van dēn̄ me lēm̄ yētyēt en, kēy et etsas te kēy. Tō kēy van lok tō vasemlō lok van hiy ige lililwo so, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Kemem mēdēn̄ lēm̄ yētyēt en, tō namte ēm̄ matabeg maymay, wa net bēlēltegoy tigtō aslil en, ba mahē kemem mawak namte ēm̄, tateh su et geh alon.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Kēy moyon̄teg noyoy nen, tō net m̄agoy ige bēlēltegoy ne Ēm̄ Yon̄, tiwag mi ige m̄agoy ige pris en, kēy mamakē aē wa kēy et ēglal te so kēy tak qeleave. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ba net vitwag mēdēn̄ kēy, ba vap van hiy kēy so, “!Atmi et! Ige a kimi mōm̄ōk tō kēy lēm̄ yētyēt en, kēy tigtō a lelo Tiy Ēm̄ Bolol, wa kēy vatvatgo ige sil.”<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Bahnentō net m̄agoy bēlēltegoy ne Ēm̄ Yon̄ tiwag mi ige nonon mavan ba melep kēy me. Ba net m̄agoy mavan yon̄yon̄ ēwē, veg kēy mētēgteg so ige sil tiple yim mat kēy mi nevet.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Kēy melep kēy me tō mēvētgiy kēy lengon ige Sanhedrin. Tō net m̄agoy ige pris mavap maymay hiy kēy so, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Kemem mal gatgoy maymay tō kimi so kimi nitog vatvatgo se lahan net anen. Ba nahap a kimi mavatvatgo tō mal lilip goy Jerusalem. Tō kimi nēqēt maymay so til kemem bamatmat nonon.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Tō Pita wa ige hal meplu goy so, “!Kemem yon̄teg vēlēs Ḡod ba et ige et te! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Ḡod non bōbō nongēn melep kal Tigsas den namatmat, kē a kimi mowos kal kē lowolwol so wuh kē. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Tō Ḡod melep kal kē tō m̄ōk veteg kē lemtō nonon. Tō Ḡod mōm̄ōk kē namyanag liwo wa kē ivaēh nongēn, tō so kē nimyin̄ ige Tisrael so kēy dēmleh, tō nidēmveteg nēmgōy. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Tō kemem vasemlō so nahaphap gōh hēywē. Wa vitwag se Nuvu Yon̄ nivasemlō nēhēyhēywē. Ḡod mal lep Nuvu Yon̄ van hiy ige et a kēy noyon̄teg kē.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ige lililwo moyon̄teg, tō moboel aē, tō kēy nemyōs so wuh mat kēy. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ba net Farisi vitwag, nahan Gamaliel, kē mitig hag lengoy bohohole. Ikē navatgo vitwag Bele, tō kēy del nēdēmap kē. Tō kē nivap van hiy kēy so lep lō qōtō ige hal tusu.<verse eid="ACT 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Tō kē mavap so, “Yēhē ige Tisrael, dēmdēm galgalsi bahaphap a kimi ak tō hiy kēy en. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Kimi dēmlok net Tadias, mey am̄ag. Kē mavan me net liwo vitwag. Kē mohole sotel kē so kē net liwo vitwag, tō kē mēvēl ige et nonon m̄eldēl vag vet (400). Ba ige Torom muwuh mat kē, tō ige et nonon mavan qeleqlen̄. Tō nahaphap del yeghuquy ēwē. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Lēklan me atgiy, mahē kēy leplep nahan ige sil en, Judas nage Takalili mavan me net liwo. Kē mōm̄ōk ige nonon so tavale tiwag mi nele. Tō ige Torom muwuh mat se kē, tō ige del a mēdēmtig kē meqleqlen̄ se.<verse eid="ACT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />“Tō nok so vap van hiy kimi so, vanyak den ige agōh. Ukēg tow kēy qelenen. So kēy wo mugumgu tō tatag nēdēmdēm non net ēwē, tō namgumgu namuy tit tig vēhte. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ba sowo kēy wo mugumgu tatag namyōs non Ḡod en, tō kimi tit higoy vēhte. !Tō kimi tepgapgal ēwē tiwag mi Ḡod mahgen!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Bahnentō ige lililwo nen mēwēhgoy kē. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Kēy mōlōl bat me ige hal, tō kēy melm̄eh kēy, ba mihigoy so kēy nitog hohole se lahan Tigsas. Tō kēy ukēg taywah kēy.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Mak tō, ige hal mavan yak den nōyōstiwag Sanhedrin mi namlaklak. Kēy nemlaklak veg Ḡod met van so kēy nesey so ige sil ak mamayge kēy, veg bahan Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Tō vel qōn̄, Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol wa vel ēm̄ del, kēy et ukēg te so vatvatne tasga wa vasemlō noyoy ēwē veg Kraēs Tigsas.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ etyak ige dikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mahē nen ige mey a tin̄tin̄qoy nohohole non Tigsas en, kēy mam̄adeg malig hag, tō nēdēmdēm bēvēlwoy maqal kēy gatay nagagasēg gengen. Kēy mavan me niviwti vōyō veg bagatgat. Ige Juw a mavan me lepnō tegha, a kēy hohole nagatgat Tikrik, kēy matwolwol ige Juw a nitiy et vōnō Tisrael, a kēy hohole nagatgat Tujuw. Ige tavalnogongēn matwolwol ige tēg vōnō veg ige nay nonoy. Veg ige tēg vōnō vanvan veheg kēy mahē kēy asēg negengen vel qōn̄.<verse eid="ACT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Bastō ige hal son̄wul nam̄e vōyō ōlōl tiwag me ige viwti del mey a nitin̄qoy, tō vap so, “Et wē te so kemem dēmveteg navatvatne ne hohole non Ḡod tō so van me net yowyowveg begengen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lagatgat Tikrik, a kēy hohole agōh en, navap “yowyowveg begengen,” navavap nan “dikon.” Navap “dikon” a gēn hohole qiyig gōh mavan me den navavap anen.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ba yathithik wa yatētētek, itōk so kimi etyak net buliviyō den kimi bemgumgu agōh, ige et mey a ige del ēglal so kēy nōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, wa kēy nēmnay. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Tō kemem tig maymay tasga latatay wa toytoylō nohohole non Ḡod.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Tō ige del nemlaklak bohohole nan, tō kēy metyak Steven a kē nēdēmtig wa nōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, tiwag mi Filip, Prokoras, Nikanor, Timon, Parmenas, wa Nikolas. Nikolas en, kē nage Tantiok, am̄ag kē notog lolqōn̄ ba mavan me motog hiy Juw. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Kēy mēvētgiy kēy how lengon ige hal. Tō ige hal matatay goy kēy, tō matan̄ namney apwoy wa mavawē kēy.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Noyoy non Ḡod maga tasga, mak tō ige tin̄qoy mam̄adeg a mam̄adeg n̄a Jerusalem. Wa tō ige pris m̄adeg mēdēmtig Tigsas.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dikon Steven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Tō Steven en, ikē nōyheg mi nasgōp wa naman non Ḡod. Tō kē mak nēvēglal wa naphah a nitiy wē lengon ige sil. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ba ige viwti vitwag mamatwolwol kē aē. Kēy ige Juw a nage Tasayrine, wa Taleksanria, wa den loprovēns Silisia wa Esia. Am̄ag kēy ige slev, tō kēy ōl nēm̄ tatay nonoy so, Nēm̄ Tatay non Ige a Notog Taywah. Kēy vēy vavaleh tiwag mi Steven <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />ba kē nilalaket goy kēy vaga, veg kē nēmnay wa nōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Bahnentō, kēy hatig hag tō wēl ēwē yatkel et so hole galgal lahan, a so, “Kemem moyon̄teg kē, kē mohole sapsapwōy Mosis tiwag mi Ḡod.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Tō nohohole gōh mak ige sil et malaklak te, tiwag mi ige m̄agoy ige Tisrael, wa tō ige vatvatgo ne Le. Tō kēy tēy kē, tō m̄ōk kē van lengon ige lililwo non ige Tisrael a lōyōstiwag non ige Sanhedrin. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Tō kēy melep yatkel et so vēgal Steven. Kēy magal so, “Steven nihole hethet tasga hiy Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol gōh wa tō Nele non Mosis. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kemem moyon̄teg kē mavap so Tigsas Tanasaret so niak hethet Nēm̄ Bolol gōh, tō kē so nileh Nele a Mosis melep tō me.”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Ba ige del a lelo yōstiwag en, namtay del van a lengon Steven en. Tō kēy met van nangon qele nango in̄sel.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Nohohole non dikon Steven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Tō net m̄agoy ige pris nivēhge Steven wo, “?Wō nage del gōh hēywē?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Tō Steven meplu so, “!Ige yathithik tiwag mi ige imam mino, yon̄teg me hiy no! Mahē bōbō nongēn Abraham motog tō Mesopotamia, tō kē et van qete hiy Haran en, Ḡod a nēlēn̄as maklō kē mahgen van hiy kē. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Tō Ḡod mavap van hiy kē so, ‘Ukēg veteg napnō nōnōm wa ige nōnōm, tō van me a lepnō mey a no qoyo vasem van hiy nēk.’<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />“Bastō Abraham mukēg veteg lepnō nan, a kēy ōl se so Kaldea, tō mavan motog Haran. Mahē imam nonon mamat bah en, kē mavan me hiy lepnō Kanan a kimi tog tō aē qiyig agōh. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ba Ḡod et lep te vētan hōn te van hiy kē. Ḡod et su togyak te vētan te van hiy kē, ba Ḡod mavatvat so kē telep van nēvētan gōh van hiy kē tiwag mi ige ginwotwot nonon. Ba mahē nen Abraham tateh ēntēn qete.<verse eid="ACT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />“Ḡod mohole van hiy kē bēdēmdēm gēn, ‘Ige ginwotwot nōnōm mey a vanvan lap tō me en, kēy tavan me ige et halvan a lepnō mey a et nonoy te. Tō ige telepnō nen tak so kēy ige slev. Tō kēy tak memeh ige nōnōm bēte m̄eldēl vag vet (400). <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ba no tēvēvēg kēy aē.’ Tō Ḡod mavap so, ‘Tō me atgiy, ige nōnōm qoyo van yak den napnō nan, tō van me mahē gōh so ōliwo no.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 15:13</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Tō Ḡod mavatvat van hiy Abraham so kē Ḡod nonon, tō Abraham movonm̄ēt so kē so nitep vēglal ige ginwotwot nonon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 17</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:8">“Tō Abraham ēntēn Isak, tō kē metep vēglal kē lēkle qōn̄ levetēl. Tō Isak ēntēn Jakop, tō Jakop yantēntēn ige tam̄an son̄wul nam̄e vōyō, a ikēy ige yatqōtqōngēn.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Ba ige yatqōtqōngēn mamatwolwol ēthēy a Jōsēp, tō kēy men̄yeg kē so kē nivan me neslev n̄a Itsip. Ba Ḡod notog tiwag mi kē, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />tō mavaēh kē den nahaphap het del a maqal kē. Tō Ḡod melep nasgōp wa nēmnay van hiy kē lengon Fero, a nēqēt mayanag non ige Titsip. Bastō Fero mōm̄ōk Jōsēp so kē nimyanag liwo goy Itsip, wa natawye yōnyōntey non Fero.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />“Tō lēklan me atgiy, namay liwo maqal Itsip wa Kanan. Kēy memgamgaysēn qēt, tō ige yatqōtqōngēn en, kēy et etsas te gengen hōn te. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Jakop moyon̄teg so negengen aē Itsip, tō kē nivētleg ige yatqōtqōngēn so van totogyeg. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ba mahē kēy mavan vagyō en, Jōsēp maklō kē van hiy kēy. Tō Fero moyon̄teg so Jōsēp en, ige nonon togolgol mavan me. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Tō Jōsēp mēvētleg nahal hiy imam nonon a Jakop so van me Itsip, tiwag mi ige nonon del. Ba kēy del son̄wul liviyō nanm̄e tēvēlēm (75).<verse eid="ACT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />“Bastō Jakop mavan me Itsip, tiwag mi ige nētnētm̄ey nonon, a kēy yatqōtqōngēn. Tō kēy del mamat qēt mahē anen. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Tō me atgiy, kēy qoyo van tēy nataqn̄ēn ige gōh n̄a Kanan, so tivig nataqn̄ey leqyan̄ non bōbō Abraham. Naqyan̄ nan tekel vētan n̄a Sekem, mey a Abraham mēwēl yak tō den ige ginwotwot non Hamor mi nēsēm.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Tō mahē monognog me so Ḡod niaktig navatvat a kē melep tō van hiy Abraham. Ige non Abraham mavan me nam̄adeg a nam̄adeg. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Tō namyanag gayaq niqtēg tig helem̄ag napnō Itsip, ba net nan et ēglal hōn te Jōsēp. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Namyanag gōh, kē nōqōvē, kē nigalgal ige nongēn, wa niak memeh ige yatqōtqōngēn. Wa kē mak qelegōh so kēy ukēg veteg nowmat ige nētnētm̄ey susu aslil, tō so kēy matmat.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />“Wa mavan tenenen me vētmahē a Mosis mowot en. Kē nētnētm̄ey vitwag mey a nōwōswōs wa newenwen lēs. Tō kēy metgoy kē bōwōl vētēl lēm̄ non imam nonon. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Mahē kēy melep lō kē en, tō nam̄alm̄al non Fero melep yak kē, tō matatagoy kē qeleso ēntēn tenenen. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Tō kē milwo hag mi nololmeyen del non ige Titsip. Tō kē mavan me nam̄e et bohohole wa bemgumgu.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Vētmahē nēte son̄wul vet (40) tenenen nonon Mosis en, nēdēmdēm vitwag mavan me hiy kē so nivatēp lokse ige yathēthēn a ige Tisrael. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Tō Mosis metsas net Titsip nilm̄elm̄eh net Tisrael vitwag. Ba kē mētēy namnen net Tisrael nan, tō memyin̄ kē, tō nivalehyam wa muwuh mat net Titsip nan.<verse eid="ACT 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />“Tō Mosis mēdēmdēm so ige nonon ēwē so et vēglal so Ḡod so nivaēh kēy heylō kē. Ba kēy et m̄ōleg te so Ḡod mōm̄ōk Mosis so niukēg taywah kēy den ige Titsip. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Taval meyen nan hag en, Mosis et van qelekē yoge Tisrael vēytitit tō anen. Tō kē nihole muhuy kōyō van so, ‘!Ey, ithi mōyō! Wo bahap tō kōmyō aksok tō qelegōh?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Ba net a kē mak qōqōvē tō ēplōn en, kē nitēm yak Mosis, tō nivap wo, ‘?Qeleave? ?Ihē mōm̄ōk liwo tō nēk so nimyanag goy kemem tō so vēvēg kemem? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />?Wō nēk so wuh se no, qele nēk muwuh tō net Titsip anoy ōk?’<verse eid="ACT 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />“Mahē Mosis moyon̄teg van en, kē mavan qelen̄ den Itsip, tō motog a lepnō Midian qeleso net halvan. Tō yoge nētnētmēy tam̄an vōyō nonon mowot van anen.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Lēkle ēte son̄wul vet, Mosis mavan n̄a lepnō vadalm̄eg a sisqet nuwutwut liwo Sinai. Tō Nin̄sel non Ḡod nikalō me hiy kē qeleso nep a nilawlaw hiy nēqētēnge su. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mosis met wa kē mamamakē aē. Kē mavan sisqet me so niet galsi en, tō kē niyon̄teg naln̄an Ḡod vap so, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ino Ḡod non yatqōtqō, Ḡod non Abraham, Isak, wa Jakop.’ Mosis mihiyey aē, wa kē memtēgteg so niet.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 3:6</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />“Tō Welan mavap van hiy kē so, ‘Lepyak nowoheyhey ne yēn̄ē, veg vētmahē a nēk tig tō aē en noyon̄. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />No mal etsas nememeh a hiy ige mino n̄a Itsip. Tō no mal yon̄teg naln̄e ten̄ten̄ nonoy. Tō no mēhēw tēqēl me so vaēh kēy. Sōwlē, nok vētleg lokse nēk n̄a Itsip.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 3:5, 7-8, 10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Mosis gōh a kēy mēlēn̄lēn̄teg tō kē, so ‘?Ihē mōm̄ōk liwo tō nēk so nimyanag goy kemem tō so vēvēg kemem?’ Heylō nin̄sel a maklō tō van hiy kē a lēqētēnge en, Ḡod mahgen mēvētleg Mosis so nimyanag wa vaēh kēy. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Net gōh mitig helem̄ag kēy den Itsip. Tō kē mak nēvēglal wa naphah m̄adeg n̄a Itsip, Lenaw Lawlaw, wa lepnō vadalm̄eg bēte son̄wul vet.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Wa tō Mosis gōh a mavap tō van hiy ige Tisrael aso, ‘Ḡod tetyak net vitwag den ige nōnōm so van me net lēgēlgēg a qele ino.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Tō Mosis gōh motog tiwag mi kēy lepnō vadalm̄eg, tiwag mi nin̄sel a mohole tō van hiy kē luwutwut Sinai, wa tiwag mi ige yatqōtqōngēn. Ḡod melep van hiy kē nohohole bēh, so nilep me hiy gēn.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Ba ige yatqōtqōngēn et yon̄teg te kē. Kēy mitiayak kē, wa kēy mēdēm lok Itsip. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Kēy mavap van hiy Aron so, ‘Tin̄ ige ḡod nongēn a so kēy tig helem̄ag gēn. Veg Mosis, net a mitig helem̄ag gen den Itsip en, gēn et ēglal te so nahap mak kē.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Nok hole gatay mahē kēy mitin̄yak ḡod galgal qeleso ninti bōlōk. Tō kēy melep van nolol hiy ḡod galgal nan, tō kēy mak negengen liwo aē, so dēmap nage a kēy mak tō mi namney.<verse eid="ACT 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />“Ba Ḡod mitig kēlē kēy. Tō Ḡod mukēg kēy so kēy mogmogo goy nuvu ne vit, ne wōl, wa ne lo, qeleaso net lēgēlgēg vitwag mayap tō aē, so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">?Kimi Tisrael, lēte son̄wul vet (40) a kimi mavanvan walēg lepnō vadalm̄eg en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">kimi melep kal tō nolol me hiy no? Tateh.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Kimi vanvan tēy natvēlgapye non ḡod galgal a Molek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">wa nototgal vet non ḡod nonmi a Refan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">mey a kimi mak tō so mogmogo goy kē.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">!Veg bēdēmdēm nen no tōsōyteg yak kimi n̄a tekel vōnō Babilon!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Amos 5:25-27</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“?Ba qeleave natvēlgapye non Ḡod? Ige yatqōtqōngēn migilgeg kal natvēlgapye nan tatag qele Ḡod mavasemlō tō van hiy Mosis. Tō kēy mavan tēy walēg a lepnō vadalm̄eg. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Nēm̄ nen en, kēy melep tabay van hiy yatqōtqōngēn leln̄an Josua. Tō ige nen mavan tēy heylō natvēlgapye nan lepnō Kanan. Mahē nen a kēy meskalgoy tō nēvētan gōh den ige benoyvōnō a Ḡod mōvōyyak tō kēy den. Tō natvēlgapye nan, kē totog dēn̄ lōqōn̄ non mayanag Devēt, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />a kē mak Ḡod memlaklak. Devēt nemyōs so tēy kal nitiy ēm̄ hiy Ḡod non Jakop, tō kē mēvēhge Ḡod aē. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ba Solomon ēwē a tak vēh, tō migilgeg kal.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Ba Ḡod a neketket yeh en, kē et togtog te lelo ēm̄ a net ēwē mētēy tō mi namnen. Qele net lēgēlgēg mavap tō so,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Welan nivap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">‘Namyeyen alge, ikē natno haghag mino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">wa namyam gōh natno vayvaysig mino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">?Nahan ēm̄ kimi so tēy me hiy no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">?Tō nok so mitiy ave?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />!Vel haphap del no mal ak qēt mi namnēk!’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 66:1</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“!Kimi gōh niqtimi maymay! Nēdēmdēm nonmi qeleso ige lolqōn̄, wa nēdēln̄ami et wak te. !Vaga kimi tigoy Nuvu Yon̄ qeleso ige yatqōtqōmi! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />?Wō net lēgēlgēg aē a ige yatqōtqōmi et ak tōqtōqyeg te kē? Kēy muwuh matmat ige mey a melgēlgēg tō so Welan so nivan me, ikē mey a nitiy tenenen. !Tō qiyig gōh kimi men̄yeg wa muwuh mat kē! <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Kimi mak qelegōh, kimi a mētēygoy tō Nele mey a ige in̄sel mavasemlō tō, ba kimi et yon̄teg te.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige lililwo Tujuw muwuh mat Steven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ige lililwo Tisrael moyon̄teg en, tō kēy lolgagay lelo taqay, tō kēy n̄itn̄it nēlwoy van hiy kē. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ba Steven, mōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄, tō niet ketket hag alge tō metsas nēlēn̄as non Ḡod, wa metsas Tigsas tigtō a lemtō non Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Tō amtan wo, “!Ey, et hag en! Nōtōq mawak wa Ēntēn Net tigtō a lemtō non Ḡod!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ba ige lililwo ōlōl a nilwo, wa tan̄goy nēdēln̄ay. Tō kēy miyiyak van hiy kē, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />tēy maymay kē, tō yap lō kē den namtegeay ne vōnō. (Tō ige a mēvēgal tō Steven en, kēy mēvēl veteg neleleh taslil nonoy van hiy nōlōmgep vitwag, nahan Sol.) Tō kēy qētēg yimyim Steven so wuh mat kē.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Kēy yimyim Steven nen, ba kē nitatay wo, “!Welan Tigsas, lep vasgēt natalek!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kē moyowtaq hōw tō niōlōl so, “Welan, nitog m̄ōkm̄ōk nubug gōh van hiy kēy.” Steven mohole bah qelegōh en, tō nim̄ōkheg m̄ēt.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1-3" />Tō yatkel et mey a nēdēmap Ḡod en metvig nataqn̄ēn Steven, tō kēy mololwon hiy kē a nēkēkēn. Ba Sol mēvēwē ige a muwuh mat Steven.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1-3">Sol niakak tēktēk ige dēmtig</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1-3">Nōqōn̄ tenenen a Steven mamat aē en, kēy qētēg ak tōqtōqyeg yeh ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Jerusalem. Tō Sol mavan velvel ēm̄ so nitēy ige tam̄an tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn lēm̄ yētyēt. Tō ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ miyiy seleslen̄ mavan soloteg vel mahē a Judea wa Samaria. Ba ige hal ēwē a mahag lap Jerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 8:1-3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dikon Filip nitoytoy n̄a Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ba ige a mavan soloteg tō vel mahē en, kēy mavasemlō noyoy ēwē.<verse eid="ACT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Ba Filip mahayveg me lelo vōnō Samaria, tō niqtēg toytoy noyoy ēwē veg Kraēs. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Mahē Filip nitoytoy en, ige sil mahaldin̄qoy galsi veg kēy metet naphah a kē magaleg en. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Filip mōvōyyakyak nuvu het m̄adeg a maqal ige et. Ba ige vu het magayka maymay tō nivan yak den kēy. Tō ige m̄adeg mey a nososol tiwag mi ige a nayn̄oy namat en, kēy mēwē lokse. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Tō ige telepnō nen memlaklak aē a nēkēkēn.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ba lepnō nen net vitwag aē nahan Simon. Kē net sēsēil vitwag, tō ige del Tasamaria mamakē hiy kē aē. Kē mohole lem̄ag kē mahgen, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />tō ige lililwo tiwag mi ige sil mahaldin̄qoy goy kē. Tō kēy mavap so net gōh naman non Ḡod aē mi kē, tō kēy mōl kē so, “Naman Liwo Telen̄len̄.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikē qele Iqet a net bagaleg vahah.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Tō kēy mahaldin̄qoy goy kē veg kē net tēytēybē a naman aē mi kē a malwowyak te tō me.<verse eid="ACT 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ba mahē Filip motoytoy noyoy ēwē en, ige sil mēdēmtig. Tō ige tam̄an tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn mavasugyon̄ qēt. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Ba Simon mahgen mēdēmtig, tō kē mavasugyon̄ se. Vaga kē nivanvan tiwag mi Filip, tō kē nietet naphah wa nēvēglal a nitiy wē a Filip nigagaleg, tō kē nimamakē aē.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Mahē ige hal n̄a Jerusalem mēglal so ige Tasamaria moyon̄teg nohohole non Ḡod en, tō kēy mēvētleg Pita kōyō Jon hiy kēy. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Mahē Pita kōyō Jon mēdēn̄ me Samaria en, tō kōyō tatay so ige dēmtig del a Samaria en so ōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Veg Nuvu Yon̄ et hēw qete hiy kēy, ba kēy mavasugyon̄ lahan Welan Tigsas ēwē. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Bastō Pita kōyō Jon mōm̄ōk namneyō apwoy, tō kēy melep Nuvu Yon̄.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simon met van so Nuvu Yon̄ mēhēw ige et mey a yoge hal matan̄ namneyō apwoy. Tō Simon nihog nēsēm van hiy kōyō, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />tō mavap so, “No nemyōs naman nan. Lep te mino me tō so no wo matan̄ namnēk apwon ige et en, tō kēy tētēy se vēh Nuvu Yon̄.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ba Pita meplu goy kē so, “?Nēk dēmdēm so nēk tēwēl vēh naman non Ḡod mi nēsēm? Tateh. Nēk qoyo mat tēytēy nēsēm anen. !Naman nan en natapēva non Ḡod! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Tateh nōnōm hap geh me agōh so biyin̄, veg nalo teqe et tenenen te lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Leh namtevu mey nehet, ba tatay van hiy Welan, so kē nidēmveteg nēmgu bēdēmdēm het a lelo teqe en. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Veg nok et van so nēk mōyheg mi naqneqneg, tō nubug mēyēt nēk.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Tō Simon meplu wo, “!Tatay maymay hiy Welan veg no, so nahap gōh tit qal te no!”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Pita kōyō Jon mavasemlō nohohole non Welan hiy ige Tasamaria, wa mohole gatay nahap a kōyō met kē magaleg tō. Kōyō mavasemlō bah, tō kōyō hatig tō m̄ōl. Mahē kōyō m̄ōlm̄ōl me Jerusalem en, kōyō mavan walēg napnō m̄adeg n̄a Samaria botoytoy noyoy ēwē.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip nihohole tiwag mi net telepnō Itiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Tō nin̄sel non Welan nihole van hiy Filip so, “Hatig, ba van tenenen hag lemtehal hiy Jerusalem, namtehal a nivan heylō van lepnō vadalm̄eg tō hēw tēqēl how Ḡaza.”<verse eid="ACT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Tō Filip nivan ēgēn. Kē nivanvan me lemtehal nen tō nietsas net vitwag nage telepnō Itiopia. Net nan, kēy mowot kē.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nohohole a ‘kēy mowot kē’ en, namanig nan kēy mowot kē qele ige Tom̄otlap wotwot noqo si nōbōlōk.</char></note> Tō kē noyowyowveg non nēqēt mayanag non ige Itiopia. Namyanag lōqōvēn nan nahan Kandase, tō net Titiopia nan nietetgoy nēsēm del nonon. Net Titiopia nan mavan tō Jerusalem batatay, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />tō nim̄ōlm̄ōl lok me. Kē nahag lakat nonon a nohos niyapyap kē. Tō kē niptaptah nōbōk namun net lēgēlgēg Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Bastō, Nuvu Yon̄ mohole van hiy Filip so, “Van sisqet van nakat anen.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filip mavan sisqet van en, tō kē niyon̄teg so net nan niptaptah nohohole non net lēgēlgēg Isaya, tō kē nivēhge van wo, “?Wō nēk nōm̄ōleg hiy nahap a nēk vatah tō en?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ba kē meplu lok van hiy Filip wo, “?No tōm̄ōleg qeleave veg tateh et nivatne no aē?” Tō kē niōlōl kal hag Filip so nihag tiwag mi kē lakat.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Natvēl yapyap a kē meptah en qelegēn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Mahē kēy muwuh mat kē en, kē et vagalgoy te</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">qele ninti sipsip a kēy so wuh mat kē.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Tō qeleaso ninti sipsip nitig yoyon̄ mahē a kēy bal nēlēn en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">kē et wak te naplan.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kēy mak mamayge nataqn̄ēn, tō kēy mēvēgal kē tō mēvēvēg kē.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Mahē nēh nonon meqlen̄ den namyam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">tateh ēntēn qete, tō tateh ginwotwot nonon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 53:7, 8</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Tō net nan mēvēhge Filip wo, “Mi nēdēmap en, nok vēhge nēk. ?Net lēgēlgēg nihole gatay ihē, ikē mahgen siso net tegha?”<verse eid="ACT 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Tō Filip meqtēg mi natvēl yapyap nan, tō mavasemlō noyoy ēwē veg Tigsas van hiy kē. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Tō kōyō damdam tēqēl lapgetō yow namtehal wah, van sas nēbē a sisqet namtehal. Tō net nan nivap van hiy Filip wo, “!Et van en! !Nēbē agōh! ?Nahap nigatgoy no so no tit vasugyon̄ vēhte?”<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Tō Filip meplu goy kē van so, “Nēk wo nēdēmtig hēywē Tigsas en, nēk tavasugyon̄ vēh.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">Tō net nan meplu so, “No nēdēmtig so Tigsas Kraēs, ikē Ēntēn Ḡod.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yatkel bōk Baebol tam̄ag, a kēy mayapwoy lagatgat Tikrik en, nayte 37 tateh.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Tō net nan mōlvayēg so higoy how nakat. Tō kōyō mēhēw tēqēl how lēbē. Tō Filip nivasugyon̄ kē. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nuvu non Welan nilep yak Filip tō nivantēy qelen̄ kē. Tō net Titiopia et etsas lok te kē. Ba kē mōm̄ōl tasga mi nam̄sēksēk.<verse eid="ACT 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ba Filip et van qele kē, kē tigtō lepnō tegha, nahe vōnō nan Asotus. Tō kē nivanvan walēg lelqelqevōnō del tō nitoytoy noyoy ēwē, tō mavan dēn̄ n̄a lepnō liwo Sisaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod meleh Sol mavan me net non Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Van lelo vōnō Jerusalem en, Sol vēgsoy lapgetō so niwuh matmat ige tin̄qoy non Tigsas. Lōqōn̄ vitwag Sol mavan hiy Nipris Liwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Kē nemyōs so nivan n̄a lepnō Damaskus, so nisoksok ige a damdam Namtehal Ne Ēh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navavap Namtehal Ne Ēh, nahan ige Krēstēn. Nahan gōh nivan den nohohole non Tigsas a kē mavap so, “Ino namtehal, wa nēhēyhēywē, wa nēh.” Jon 14:6</char></note> Kē so nivēl m̄ōlm̄ōl lokse ige Krēstēn nan, tō so van tēy kēy lēm̄ yētyēt a Jerusalem. Bastō kē nivēhge Nipris Liwo so niyap neletes hiy ige ēm̄ yon̄ Tujuw a Damaskus so biyin̄ kē. Tō Nipris Liwo memgugoy kē.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Bahnentō, Sol nihatig tō so nivan Damaskus ēgēn. Kē nivanvan sisqet me napnō nan wah, nihin̄yeg liwo nivan me hag lōtōk en, tō nihin̄yeg walēg goy kē. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Sol nisisgoy hōw lēvētan en, tō niyon̄teg nohohole nivan me hiy kē wo, “!Sol, Sol! ?Nēk ak tōqtōqyeg tō no gōh bahap?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ba Sol meplu wo, “?Inēk ihē, Welan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Tō nohohole nivan lok me hiy kē wo, “Ino Tigsas, a nēk ak memeh tō no anen. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Hatig ba van tenenen a lepnō, ba dēyē net vitwag tavasemlō van hiy nēk nahap a nēk so galeg.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Ige mey a mavan tiwag tō me mi kē en tig tō nen et hohole geh te. Kēy moyon̄teg naln̄e hohole, ba et etsas te et te. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sol nihatig den nēvētan en, tō so nivalwey namtan, ba kē et etet te. Bastō kēy mētēy namnen, tō tigtēylō kē hay lepnō Damaskus. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Tō kē et etet te, et gengen te, wa et in te nēbē bōqōn̄ vētēl.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Nitin̄qoy vitwag non Kraēs aē a Damaskus en, nahan Ananias. Tō Welan mohole van hiy kē loqoyqoy so, “!Ananias!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Tō kē meplu so, “!O-oh Welan, ino agōh!”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Tō Welan nivap so, “Van a lēm̄ non Judas, a lemtehal a kēy ōl nahan so ‘Netnenen.’ Ba vēhge net vitwag nahan Sol, a nage Tatarsus. !Ey, kē nitatay! <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Wa kē metsas loqoyqoy so net vitwag nahan Ananias mavan me hiy kē, tō nim̄ōk namnen apwon, tō so kē nietet lokse.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Tō Ananias meplu so, “Welan, woqse et mal kaka vatag me hiy no veg net nan, wa veg bahaphap mey nehet a kē mak tō hiy ige yon̄ nōnōm n̄a Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Tō kē mavan me mahē gōh lahan ige pris lililwo tō so tēy ige del mey a ōlōl van lehe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ba Welan nihole lok van hiy kē so, “!Van! Veg no mal etyak net nan so nivasemlō nahek hiy ige lolqōn̄, tiwag mi ige mayanag lililwo nonoy, wa ige Tisrael se. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Tō no mahgēk tavasemlō van hiy kē noyon̄ memeh a kē tavan tēy heylō lehek.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Tō Ananias nivan, nihayveg hay lēm̄ nan, tō nim̄ōk namnen apwon Sol. Tō kē vap so, “Ithik Sol, Welan Tigsas mēvētleg no, ikē a maklō kē van hiy nēk a lemtehal. Kē mēvētleg no tō so nēk tetet lokse vēh, wa tōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄.”<verse eid="ACT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Vag tiwag ēwē tō nage vitwag qeleso nēvēyn̄ih nisisgoy yak den namtan Sol. !Tō Sol nietet lokse! Tō kē nihatig tō kēy vasugyon̄ kē. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Kē musu gengen bah nen en, tō nēhyēn nimaymay lokse.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sol nitoytoy lepnō Damaskus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Kē motog natkelgi tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy a Damaskus. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Tō vag tiwag ēwē kē niqtēg toytoy so Tigsas ikē Ēntēn Ḡod a lēm̄ tatay non ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Ige a moyon̄teg van notoytoy non Sol en, kēy mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn. Tō kēy wo, “Net gōh a makak tōqtōqyeg tō ige dēmtig a lelo vōnō Jerusalem en. !Vaga kē nemyōs so niwuh matmat ige mey a ōlōl nahan Tigsas! Tō kē mavan me gōh so nitēy lokse kēy, tō so van tēy kēy hiy ige pris lililwo bēvēvēg.”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Tō notoytoy non Pol mavan maymay malig se hag, mak tō so ige Juw et hole gatay site kē aē, veg kē mohole m̄ōleg galsi so Tigsas ikē Kraēs.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol meplag qelen̄ den Damaskus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Lēkle qōn̄ m̄adeg en, tō ige Juw mahay tiwag me tō vonopnog so wuh mat Sol. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ba kē moyon̄teg noyoy nan. Negeay liwo a nevet navan walēg goy napnō nan, tō kēy ēlēltegoy namtegeay ne vōnō vel meyen wa vel anqōn̄, so wuh kē. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Bastō anqōn̄ ige tin̄qoy nonon melep kal kē hag legeay, tō mōm̄ōk kē letbey liwo, tō voyoy tēqēl kē how lēvētan.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol lelo vōnō Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Tō Sol mavan lok me Jerusalem, ba makak etgal so nivan tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy, ba kēy del memtēgteg qēt kē. Veg kēy et dēmtig te kē, aso kē nitin̄qoy non Tigsas en. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ba Banabas memyin̄ kē, tō nilep kē me hiy ige hal. Tō Banabas mavasemlō van hiy kēy qeleave tō Sol metsas Welan a lemtehal, tō atgiy kē motoytoy maymay lahan Tigsas n̄a Damaskus.<verse eid="ACT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Bastō Sol mēvēl tiwag me ige dēmtig a lelo vōnō Jerusalem, tō nitoytoy maymay hiy ige sil bohohole non Welan. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Vaga, kē nihole maymay, wa nivēyvavaleh tiwag mi ige Juw a kēy hohole mi nagatgat Tikrik. Tō kēy helhel etgal so wuh kē. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ige yathēthēn moyon̄teg en, tō kēy lepyak kē, tō van tēy kē n̄a lepnō Sisaria. Tō kēy mēvētleg m̄ōl lok kē lepnō Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Tō mahē nen ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ Judea, Kalili, wa Samaria en, kēy motog mi natm̄at wa tateh mētēgteg. Tō Nuvu Yon̄ mak maymay kēy, tō mavasusup kēy. Ige dēmtig mam̄adeg malig se hag, tō kēy nēdēmap galsi Welan.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nivan walēg yatkel vōnō Judea wa Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Pita mavanvan walēg lepnō susu non ige Juw wa ige Tasamaria. Tō kē nivan vatēp ige yon̄ non Ḡod a lepnō Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Mahē gōh kē metsas net vitwag nahan Ayneas. Ayneas gōh, tekel taqn̄ēn namat, tō kē men letno tamge nonon bēte levetēl. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Tō Pita nivap van hiy kē so, “Ayneas, Tigsas Kraēs nivaēh nēk. Hatig ba lokveg natamge nōnōm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:34">Tō vag tiwag ēwē Ayneas niyow hatig. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Tō ige sil del n̄a Lida metsas so Ayneas mēwē lok, tō kēy muwulyis van hiy Welan. Wa tō ige a loprovēns Saron se.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabita mahatig lokse den namatmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ba hay lepnō Jopa en, nitin̄qoy vitwag aē a nalqōvēn. Nahan Tabita, ba kēy ōlōl kē so Dokas lagatgat Tikrik. Vaga kē nōyheg mi namgumgu mey nēwē wa nimyin̄ tasga ige m̄asay. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Lamahē nen nogom maqal kē, tō kē mamat. Kēy musuwsuw nataqn̄ēn, wa melveteg kē hag lelo din vitwag a lēm̄ alge.<verse eid="ACT 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Ba Lida sisqet Jopa, tō ige tin̄qoy moyon̄teg so Pita a Lida. Bastō kēy mēvētleg yoge vōyō so vangoy kē. Tō kōyō mavap van hiy Pita so, “!Van ēgē me hiy kemem!”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Tō Pita mahatig, madam kōyō, mēdēn̄ me vētmahē nen. Tō kēy van tēy kē lidin nan. Tō ige lōqōvēn nay mitig walēg Dokas wa ten̄ten̄. Tō kēy mavasem van hiy Pita nahap a kē mususuy geh tō, mahē a kē laptō tiwag mi kēy.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Tō Pita mōvōylōlō kēy, tō kē nivatiqaw, wa nitatay. Tō kē met van hiy nataqn̄ēn tō nivap so, “!Tabita, hatig!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:40">Tō Dokas mavalwey namtan, metsas Pita, tō nihag ketket. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Tō Pita nitēy namnen wa lep hatig kē. Tō Pita niōlōl tiwag me ige yon̄ wa ige nay, tō vasem van hiy kēy so Dokas mēh lok.<verse eid="ACT 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Tō noyoy ne age gōh maga vel mahē del Jopa, tō woqse et mēdēmtig Welan. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Me atgiy en, Pita motog nusuvay misin n̄a Jopa, lēm̄ nonon net vitwag nahan Simon. Kē net batagtaghiy nipni bōlōk.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Pita kōyō Konelias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Net vitwag togtō Sisaria en, nahan Konelias, ikē nage Torom. Kē nilwo goy ige vagapgal m̄eldēl vag tiwag (100), ige gōh kēy ōlōl kēy so ige viwti Titali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kē et Juw te, ba vaga kē ōl liwo Ḡod. Kē net vitwag a nileplep namlan hiy ige sil, tō kē net batatay vaga. Tō kē tiwag mi ige nonon nēdēmap galsi Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Lemyēpyep vitwag, sisqet tege a lelo vētēl, kē metsas nage vitwag a loqoyqoy. Kē met galsi so nin̄sel non Ḡod mavan me hiy kē, tō mavap so, “!Konelias!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kē mam̄alyow aē, ba kē met lap van aē, tō kē wo, “?Qeleave, welan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Tō nin̄sel wo, “Natatay nōnōm wa nohoghog nōnōm van hiy ige m̄asay en, Ḡod net vēglal. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Bastō, vētleg net a Jopa so lep me net vitwag nahan Simon, a tekel han Pita. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Kē notogtog lēm̄ non Simon, a net batagtaghiy nipni bōlōk. Kē notogtog sisqet ale.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Nin̄sel mohohole bah van hiy kē en, tō kē niqlen̄ lok den kē. Tō Konelias niōlōl me net slev nonon vōyō tiwag mi noyowyowveg vitwag. Noyowyowveg nan ikē net bepgapgal, wa vaga kē nōlōl liwo Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Konelias mohole m̄ōleg bah van hiy kēytēl bahap a kē met tō en, tō nivētleg kēytēl Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Taval meyen nan hag a lēlwomyen en, kēytēl vanvan me sisqet Jopa. Ba Pita meyem kal apwo ēm̄ alge a letno hag m̄ōkheg so nitatay. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ba namaygay mak Pita tō kē so nigengen. Kēy teyteymat lapgetō negengen nagan wah, tō kē met nage vitwag a qeleso kē niqoyqoy. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kē met nōtōq mawak, tō nage vitwag mēhēw me, qeleso namalmal liwo a net nētēy naqan̄qan̄yan vēvet tō nipyoy tēqēl how antan. Ba woqse haphap nōy alon. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Kē nōy mi nahaphap mey nem̄ey wa nahaphap mey a et m̄ey te, qeleso nōbōlōk, noqo, nututu, nēqētqoqo, nam̄at tegtegha, wa nemen tegtegha. Yatkel haphap a ige Juw tegen vēh, wa yatkel haphap a kēy tit gengen vēhte veg Bele nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Tō naln̄e hohole mavan me hiy Pita so, “Hatig, Pita, wuh tegōm hap ba gen.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ba Pita meplu goy kē van so, “Nitog, Welan. Veg no tit gen vēhte negengen mey et yon̄ te wa et wenwen te.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ba nohohole mavan lok me hiy kē so, “Nahaphap mey a Ḡod mak wenwen tō en, nēk nitog vavap so et wenwen te.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Kē mak qele gōh vagtēl, tō namalmal nen nivēykal lokse hag lōtōk.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Pita dēmdēm soksok namanig ne qoyqoy gōh en wah, tō ige yowyowveg non Konelias mosoksok nēm̄ non Simon, tō kēytēl dēn̄ me namtegeay nan. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Tō kēytēl ōlōl van tō vēhge so, “?Wō net a nahan Simon Pita, kē aē megōh?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Pita nidēmdēm sosok lapgetō nōm̄ōleg ne qoyqoy wah, tō Nuvu Yon̄ nivap van hiy kē wo, “Simon, tēlge vētēl soksok nēk. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Hatig ba hēw tēqēl how hiy kēytēl. Dam kēytēl, nitog dēmdēm vōvōyō veg no mahgēk mēvētleg kēytēl me.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Tō Pita nihēw tēqēl hōw hiy kēytēl, tō nivap van hiy kēytēl wo, “?Ino agōh a kēmtēl soksok no en. Kimi nemyōs no bahap qiyig vitwag?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ba kēytēl meplu van hiy Pita wo, “Konelias mēvētleg kamtēl me. Kē net liwo non ige bepgapgal, wa kē net tenenen vitwag a kē ōl liwo Ḡod vaga, wa ige Juw del nēdēmap kē. Tō nin̄sel yon̄ mavap van hiy kē so niōlōl nēk so van me lēm̄ nonon, so yon̄teg nohohole nōnōm.”<verse eid="ACT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Tō Pita melep vasgēt kēytēl me lēm̄ so tog tiwag mi kē. Ba taval meyen nan hag kē mavan tiwag mi kēytēl. Ba yatkelgi mey a nēdēmtig a tog tō Jopa en matatag se kēy. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Taval meyen lokse hag kēy mēdēn̄ me Sisaria. Ba Konelias may ōlōl tiwag mi ige nonon, wa ige yaplōplōn, tō kēy dēyē leptō kē anen. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pita nihayveg me lēm̄ en, tō Konelias melep vasgēt kē, tō mavatiqaw goy kē so mogmogo goy kē. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ba Pita nilep kal lok kē, ba nivap so, “!Tig ketket! Ino net ēwē qele inēk en.”<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Pita kōyō Konelias qētēg kaka tō kaka bat hay lelo ēm̄. Tō Pita so et van qelekē woqse sil taq tō lelo ēm̄ en. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Tō Pita nihole van hiy kēy so, “Kimi del nēglal galsi so nele nonmem nigatgoy net Tujuw so tit van sisqet vēhte me net telepnō tegha, wa tit vatēp vēhte kē. Ba Ḡod mal vasem me hiy no so no tit ōl hethet vēhte net vitwag so ikē et yon̄ te wa et wenwen te lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Bastō nok et valeh te mahē a kimi mōlōl no. ?Ba kimi tavap vēh me so kimi mōlōl no me bahap?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Tō Konelias meplu so, “Nōqōn̄ mal vēvet goy, wun se qele agōh a lelo vētēl en, nok tatay lēm̄ mino. Nok so et ganwon van qelekē net vitwag tig tō a lengēk en, kē nehey goy kē mi namalsam a nihin̄hin̄. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Kē mavap me hiy no wo, ‘!Konelias! Ḡod mal yon̄teg natatay nōnōm, wa kē mal etsas nohoghog namu van hiy ige m̄asay. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Bastō nēk vētleg te et nivan n̄a Jopa, vēhge net vitwag nahan Simon Pita, ba kē nivan me hiy nēk. Net nan notogtog lēm̄ non Simon, a net batagtaghiy nipni bōlōk. Kē notogtog sisqet nanaw.’<verse eid="ACT 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />“Bastō no mēvētleg togotgo hōw hiy nēk en, ba itōk a nēk mavan me. Tō kemem del mahay tiwag me lengon Ḡod so yon̄teg navavap del a Welan mōm̄ōk nēk so vasemlō me hiy kemem.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nivasemlō noyoy ēwē lēm̄ non Konelias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Tō Pita niqtēg nohohole nonon wo, “No mēglal galsi so lengon Ḡod en, igēn del haytēyēh. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ḡod telep vasgēt ihēte a nimogmogo goy kē, wa niak nage mey netnenen van lengon, et ēwē te so kē nage Tisrael si so nage telepnō tegha. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Kimi nēglal vatag so Ḡod mēvētleg me nahal hiy ige Tisrael. Nahal nan, noyoy ēwē so natm̄at mavan heylō me Tigsas Kraēs, a ikē Welan non ige del. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Tō kimi nēglal aē nahap a maqal n̄a Judea. Nage nan meqtēg Kalili, mahē Jon motoytoy so ige sil so dēm leh wa vasugyon̄. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Tō Ḡod metyak Tigsas Tanasaret, tō melep van Nuvu Yon̄ wa naman hiy kē. Tō Tigsas mavan walēg wa magaleg namgumgu mey nēwē, wa kē mak wē lokse ige del mey a natmat mēhēw kēy, veg Ḡod tiwag mi kē.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Tō kemem met mi namtamem nahaphap del a kē mak tō Jerusalem, wa lelo vōnō non Ige Juw. Ige Juw muwuh kē ba mowos kal kē lowolwol. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ba lōqōn̄ vētēl negi Ḡod melep kal lokse kē den namatmat, tō maklō kē van hiy ige et. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ige del et etet te kē, ba ige mey a Ḡod metyak kēy so vasemlō noyoy veg kē. Ige nan kemem gōh a megengen wa minin tiwag mi kē mahē a kē mahatig lokse den namatmat. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kē mōlvayēg kemem so toytoy noyoy ēwē hiy ige sil. Tō kemem vasemlō so ikē net a Ḡod mōm̄ōk tō kē so nivēvēg ige del, ige mey nēh tiwag mi ige mey namat. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Tō ige lēgēlgēg del mavasemlō so ige del a nēdēmtig kē en, Ḡod tēdēmveteg negengenyeg nonoy heylō nahan.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuvu Yon̄ nihēw me hiy ige mey a et Juw te</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Mahē Pita hohole lapgetō nage geh gōh en, tō Nuvu Yon̄ nihēw me apwon ige a yon̄yon̄teg tō kē en. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Ige dēmtig a madam tō me Pita en, ikēy nage Tujuw, tō kēy mamakē aē veg aso Ḡod melep van nasgōp ne Vu Yon̄ hiy ige mey a et Juw te. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Veg kēy met vēglal so Nuvu Yon̄ mōyheg ige tog lolqōn̄ gōh, tō ige tog lolqōn̄ hohole mi nagatgat tegtegha wa ōlōl liwo Ḡod.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Bahnentō, Pita wo, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“?Ihē mihigoy so tit vasugyon̄ te ige gōh mi nēbē? !Tateh! !Veg kēy mal lep Nuvu Yon̄ qele igēn!”<verse eid="ACT 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Tō Pita mōlvayēg so vasugyon̄ kēy lahan Tigsas Kraēs. Tō kēy mēvēhge Pita so tog tekelgi qōtō tiwag mi kēy.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pita mavasemlō noyoy hiy ige tēlēm̄ yon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Ige hal tiwag mi ige et dēmtig vel mahē del n̄a Judea moyon̄teg noyoy so ige mey et Juw te en, ikēy se mēdēmtig temuy nohohole non Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Yatkel Juw a nēdēmtig Tigsas en, kēy dēmdēm maymay so itōk so tep vēglal ige mey et Juw te so kēy wo dēmtig Tigsas. Mahē Pita mēdēn̄ me Jerusalem nen, ige gōh men̄en̄e hiy kē aē. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Kēy wo, “Bahap tō nēk mavan hay lēm̄ non ige a et tep vēglal te kēy ōk, tō megengen tiwag mi kēy?”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Tō Pita nivasemlō van hiy kēy vel haphap a meqtēg yak tō me, tō mēdēn̄ a lōlsēn. <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Kē wo, “Mahē no motog tō Jopa en, nok tatay nen wah, no met nage qeleso no qoyqoy ēwē. Nage nan namalmal liwo, kē mēhēw tēqēl togolgol me qeleso net nētēy naqan̄qan̄yan vēvet tō nipyoy tēqēl how del alge. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />No met hay lelo malmal en woqse haphap tuytuy del en, qeleso noqo, notok, nubus, nam̄at wa yatkelgi se, wa tiwag mi nahaphap bōg del wa nemen del, a geh alon en. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Tō naln̄e hohole mavan me hiy no so, ‘Hatig, Pita, wuh tegōm haphap geh nen ba gen.’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />“Ba no wo, ‘!Nitog, Welan! No tit gen vēhte nage geh nen, veg kēy et wenwen te lengē wa nehet so gen.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Tō no moyon̄teg lokse nohohole me den alge, a mavap so, ‘Nahaphap mey a Ḡod mak wenwen tō en, nēk nitog vavap so et wenwen te.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Nage geh gōh mavan me vagtēl, tō nibah, wa tō namalmal tiwag mi vel haphap del alon en nivēykal lok alge.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />“Togolgol lamahē nen, net vētēl mēdēn̄ me lēm̄ a no motogtog tō aē en. Net Tisisaria vitwag mēvētleg kēytēl me so lep no. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ba Nuvu Yon̄ mavap me hiy no so, ‘Nēk nitog hiyey so dam kēytēl.’ Tō ige yathēthēngēn bul levete dam no van dēn̄ me Sisaria. Tō kemem qēt hay lēm̄ nonon net nan. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Tō kē nivasemlō me hiy kemem so kē met nin̄sel vitwag mavan me hiy kē, nitig a lelo ēm̄ nonon, ba mavap van hiy kē so, ‘Nēk vētleg noyoy n̄a Jopa hiy net vitwag nahan Simon Pita. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Kē so nivasem van noyoy hiy nēk mey a tavaēh vēh nēk tiwag mi ige del nōnōm.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Nok qētēg hohole nen wah, Nuvu Yon̄ nihēw me hiy kēy qele a mēhēw tō me hiy kemem am̄ag. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Tō nok dēmlok nohohole nonon Welan a so, ‘Jon mavasugyon̄ kimi mi nēbē, ba Ḡod tavasugyon̄ kimi mi Nuvu Yon̄.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Am̄ag, mahē a gēn mēdēmtig Welan Tigsas Kraēs en, Ḡod melep me Nuvu Yon̄ qeleso natapēva. !Ba Ḡod melep Nuvu Yon̄ van hiy kēy se! Bastō, ino et haytēyēh te so tigoy Ḡod.”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Tō ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ moyon̄teg bah nohohole gōh en, tō kēy et hohole hethet site hiy Pita ēgēn. Tō kēy lep kal nahan Ḡod, ba vap wo, “Nage gōh nēdēmdēm nan so Ḡod mitig helem̄ag ige mey a et Juw site, so wulyis nēdēmdēm nonoy so tēy nēh lap.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noyoy ēwē nivan dēn̄ Antiok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Mahē ige lililwo Tujuw muwuh Steven wa makak tōqtōqyeg ige dēmtig a Jerusalem en, ige dēmtig m̄adeg mavan seleslen̄. Yatkel et den kēy mavan a yeh tewiwi, tō mēdēn̄dēn̄ geh Fonisia, Sayprus, tiwag mi Antiok. Tō kēy vavasemlō Noyoy Ēwē van hiy ige yatkelgi, ba a ige Juw vēlēs. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ba yatkelgi den kēy, a nage Tasayprus wa Tasayrine en, kēy mavan dēn̄ Antiok, tō kēy qētēg hohole hiy ige Tikrik, tō vasemlō noyoy ēwē veg Welan Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Namnen Welan apwoy, mak tō woqse et mēdēmtig. Tō kēy meleh namtevōy, tō mavan me ige non Welan.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Noyoy nan makalō, mēdēn̄ ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Jerusalem en, tō kēy vētleg Banabas mavan Antiok. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Banabas mēdēn̄ me Antiok en, tō kē met vēglal so nasgōp non Ḡod mi kēy, tō kē memlaklak aē. Tō kē nihole biyin̄ kēy so tig netnet lēdēmtig nonoy van hiy Welan. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banabas en, kē nam̄e et vitwag, kē nōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄ wa nēdēmtig nonon namaymay. Tō kē mewseg woqse et se me hiy Welan.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Bahnentō Banabas nivan tasga Tarsus so nisok Sol. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Mahē a kē metsas Sol en, tō kē nivantēy lok kē me Antiok. Kōyō motog bēte wonwon vitwag, tō kōyō muqul tiwag mi nēm̄ yon̄ nan, wa vatvatgo woqse et. Tō ige tog lolqōn̄ a Antiok melep van nahay hiy ige dēmtig, tō kēy ōl totogyeg naha ‘Krēstēn’ van hiy kēy.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nahah ‘Kristen’ en, namanig nan so ‘Kraēs su.’</char></note><verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Tō tege lamahē nen, ige et lēgēlgēg vivitwag mahatig den Jerusalem tō van tēqēl me Antiok. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Vitwag den kēy nahan Agabus. Kē nihatig tō nihohole nahap a Nuvu Yon̄ mavasemlō van hiy kē. Tō kē mavasemlō so namay liwo taqal namyam del. (Me atgiy en, namay nan mavan me lamahē a Kladius nēqēt mayanag goy ige Torom.)<verse eid="ACT 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Tō ige tin̄qoy mēdēmdēm so biyin̄ ige yathēthēy a togtō a Judea. Ba kēy movonm̄ēt so net vivitwag nilep van nēsēm haytēyēh a so kē telep vēh. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Tō kēy mak tatag. Tō kēy vēlsey tiwag nēsēm, tō hog van lemnen Banabas kōyō Sol, tō kōyō van tēy tō hog van lemnen ige lililwo ne ēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Judea.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Herod niak tōqtōqyeg nēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Jerusalem wa Judea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Lēvētmahē nen Nēqēt Mayanag Herod niqtēg ak memeh ige tēlēm̄ yon̄. Tō kē mōm̄ōk yatkel et lēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kē mētēy Jemes, a ikē nitin̄qoy vitwag a ēthēn Jon. Tō Herod mōlvayēg ige nonon so kēy totm̄ēt yak nēqtēn Jemes mi nagasel bepgal. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Herod met van so ige lililwo Tujuw nemlaklak bemtehal nen, tō kē nemyōs so nitēy se Pita. Herod mak meygōh lamahē a kēy hay tiwag me Begengen Yowlege, nōqōn̄ liwo begengen bērēyt a nis tateh alon. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Tō kēy mētēy Pita van lēm̄ yētyēt, tō m̄ōk kē lemnen ige bepgapgal so etgoy kē. Ige bepgapgal nen, kēy niviwti vēvet a ige bulvet liviwti vitwag. Ba Herod nidēmdēm so nivēvēg Pita lengon ige sil lēkle Gengen Yowlege.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Bastō Pita notog lēm̄ yētyēt, ba ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ tatay maymay hiy Ḡod veg kē.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nikalō den nēm̄ yētyēt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Am̄ag den Herod so nilep lō Pita en, anqōn̄ nen Pita lēm̄ yētyēt. Kē memtiy lēvētnan yoge bepgapgal vōyō, tō nējēn mēlēgteg tiwag kēytēl. Tō yoge bepgapgal vōyō se tig tō mete ēm̄ en. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />!Ey, et van nen, nin̄sel non Welan mavan ganwon me, tō namyeyen mihin̄yeg lelo ēm̄ yētyēt! Tō nin̄sel nen niwohqal naqaqayan Pita so niak matyak kē. Tō nin̄sel vap van hiy kē wo, “!Hatig ēgē!” Tō nējēn nisisgoy yak den namnen Pita.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Tō nin̄sel nivap van hiy Pita so, “Leleh ba hey nasandol nōnōm.” Tō Pita mak tatag qeleanen. Tō nin̄sel wo, “Hey nōkōt nōnōm, ba tatag no.”<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Tō Pita nikalō tatag nin̄sel nan, ba kē nidēmdēm so kē niqoyqoy ēwē. Ba kē et ēglal te so hēyhēywē a so kē makalō en. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Tō kōyō mavan heylō me, mavan vēyvēy net betetgoy mey am̄ag, wa net betetgoy mey vōyō negi, dēn̄ me namtegeay a natle bakakalō yow lelo vōnō. Tō namtegeay nen mawak mahgen, tō kōyō kalō. Kōyō vanvan me lemtehal vitwag en, tō nin̄sel niqlen̄ ganwon den kē.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Tō Pita nidēmsas lok van, tō kē wo, “Togtōkē no niglal hēywē so Welan mēvētleg me nin̄sel nonon. Kē mavaēh no den namnen Herod wa natawye dēmdēm del mey a ige Juw mēdēmvasig tō aē.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Pita met vēglal so nage geh nen et qoyqoy te, tō kē nivan n̄a lēm̄ non Mere a tita non Jon Mak. Ige dēmtig m̄adeg mahay tiwag van nen batatay. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Tō Pita nidin̄din̄ a lemte ēm̄ aslil. Tō nam̄alm̄al yowyowveg vitwag a nahan Roda nivan me so niet tow so ihē. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Tō kē niyon̄teg vēglal naln̄an Pita. Ba kē nemlaklak aē a nēkēkēn, ak tō nalon mōqōn̄ so niwak namte ēm̄. Kē meplag lokse van hiy ige sil en, tō nivap van hiy kēy wo, “!Pita tig tō yow lemte ēm̄ kē!”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ba kēy meplu wo, “Nēk so qaqa.” Ba kē nimaymay aso hēywē en. Ba ige sil en vap van hiy kē so, “Ba wun nin̄sel non Pita ēwē.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ba Pita midin̄ tasga namte ēm̄ qeleanen. Kēy so wak yow namte ēm̄ qelekē Pita, tō kēy mamamakē aē a nilwo. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ba Pita nivēglal van hiy kēy mi namnen so kēy tog yon̄. Tō kē nikaka van hiy kēy qeleave tō Welan melep lō kē den nēm̄ yētyēt. Tō kē nivap van hiy kēy wo, “Vasem van hiy Jemes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jemes goh en, kē netegha den Jemes a ēthēn Jon mey a mal mat. Jemes meygōh ēthēn Tigsas, kē mitig helem̄ag tō nēm̄ yon̄ non ige Krēstēn n̄a Jerusalem.</char></note> tiwag mi ige dēmtig yatkelgi bēdēmdēm agōh.” Tō Pita nihatig tō nivan lepnō tegha.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Taval meyen nan hag nen, ige bepgapgal moyowlin̄lin̄ aē, tō kēy dēmdēm sosok so nahap mak hiy Pita qelegōh. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herod mosok Pita vel mahē del ba et etsas hōn te kē. Tō kē mēvēhge van ige a metetgoy tō Pita so kē meqlen̄ qeleave. Tō kē mēvēvēg kēy so wuh mat kēy.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 12:19">Namatmat non Herod Akripa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Me atgiy, Herod nihatig den Judea tō nivan tog n̄a Sisaria. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Herod mololgagay ige Tataya tiwag mi Saydon a nēkēkēn, ba ige lililwo lepnō vōyō nen mēdēmdēm so van so et kē. Kēy so ak natm̄at tiwag mi Herod veg ige gōh wēlwēl negengen nagay vēlēs a lepnō nonon. Tō kēy mewseg me net vitwag nahan Blastus so nimyin̄ kēy. Blastus en, kē net ēlēltegoy nēm̄ non Herod. Tō Blastus mōlōl nōyōstiwag vitwag.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Tō Mayanag met yak nōqōn̄ vitwag, lōqōn̄ togolgol nen en, tō kē nihey nam̄e malmal nonon ige mayanag, tō nihag hiy van letno haghag nonon, tō niqtēg hohole van hiy ige sil. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Tō ige del nen ōlōl wo, “!Igōhkē naln̄an ḡod, et naln̄e et te!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Tō vag tiwag ēwē nin̄sel non Welan niwohqal kē veg kē et dēmap te Ḡod. Tō nōl mētēhiy nataqn̄ēn, tō kē nimat.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Tō Noyoy Ēwē veg Ḡod maga vel mahē, tō ige sil m̄adeg mēdēmtig.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Tō Banabas kōyō Sol mavatēp Jerusalem so hog van nēsēm bemyimyin̄ begengen nagay.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Acts 11:27-30</char></note> Mahē kōyō mōm̄ōk veteg bah en, tō kōyō melep Jon a nahan itan Mak en, tō kēytēl m̄ōl lok Antiok.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod metyak Banabas kōyō Sol so van tēy namyeyen hiy ige lolqōn̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Van lēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Antiok en, ige lēgēlgēg aē, tiwag mi ige vatvatgo. Ige nan wa Banabas, Sol, Simeon a kēy ōl kē so Womlēglēg, Lusius Tasayrine, wa Manaen a kōyō Herod milwo tiwag tō. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Mahē kēy taqlun̄ goy Welan wa gaygaymamah en, Nuvu Yon̄ mavap so, “Atmi etyak me hiy no Banabas tiwag mi Sol bemgumgu a no telep van hiy kōyō.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Bastō kēy gaygaymamah wa tatay en, tō kēy tan̄ namney apwon Banabas kōyō Sol, tō vētleg lō kōyō.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabas kōyō Sol nivan Sayprus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Mahē Nuvu Yon̄ mēvētleg lō Banabas kōyō Sol, tō kōyō van tēqēl yow Selusia, tō yem labaklap, tō gam hiy napnō Sayprus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Tō Jon Mak madam kōyō bemyimyin̄. Kēytēl mēdēn̄ me Sayprus, n̄a lepnō Salamis. Tō kōyō mavasemlō nohohole non Ḡod lēm̄ tatay non ige Juw.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Tō kēytēl mavan walēg velvel vōnō del nan, tō mēdēn̄ me napnō Pafos. Tō kēytēl metsas net sēsēil vitwag, nahan Ba-Tigsas. Kē nage Tujuw, wa kē net lēgēlgēg galgal. Lagatgat Tikrik kēy ōl kē so “Elimas a net hewhew.” <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Kē tiwag mi mayanag liwo Tasayprus. Mayanag nan nahan Segius Polus, wa navaksan aē. Kē mōlōl Banabas kōyō Sol so nivan me veg kē nemyōs so niyon̄teg noyoy ēwē non Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ba net hewhew nan nitig tavale mi kōyō, veg kē nemyōs so niwseg yak mayanag den nēdēmtig.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ba Sol, a nahan itan Pol, mōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄. Tō kē met tenenen van hiy Elimas, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ba mavap so, “!Namtevu nitiy het wa nēk nōyheg mi nitiy galgal! !Inēk ēntēn Nuvu Het, inēk natvale goy nahaphap del mey a nēwē en! Inēk mihigoy namtehal tenenen non Welan. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Togtōkē, Ḡod tatan̄qal nēk, tō nēk tamatbē natkelgi. Nēk tit etsas vēhte namyeyen ne lo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Vag tiwag ēwē namtan memyēpyēp qeleso namlēglēg magaygoy namtan, mak tō kē nivanvan leley, wa nisoksok net a so nitig helem̄ag kē. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mayanag Segius Polus mamamakē liwo aē bavatvatne veg Ḡod. Tō mahē a kē met van qelenen en, kē mēdēmtig noyoy ēwē.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol nivasemlō noyoy ēwē a lepnō Antiok a Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pol tiwag mi ige yaplōplōn van lok labaklap tō gam yak den Pafos, tō van me lepnō Pega a loprovēns Pamfilia. Ba Jon Mak nivan veteg kēy tō mōm̄ōl lok Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Tō Pol kēy nen mavan den Pega, tō van dēn̄ me lepnō Antiok a Pisidia. Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg vitwag, kēy mavan a lēm̄ tatay vitwag non ige Juw, tō hag sey hōw. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Mahē kēy meptah bah Nele non Mosis tiwag mi nayapyap namun ige lēgēlgēg en, ige lililwo ne ēm̄ tatay nan mēvēhge kōyō bohohole bemyimyin̄. Kēy wo, “Yohē yathithimem, sowo noyoy namun mōyō aē bohole vasōsōp ige sil, itōk so kōmyō hole.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pol nitig ketket hag tō nihog kal namnen ba nivap so, “!Kimi Tisrael tiwag mi ige tegtegha a mogmogo goy Ḡod en, atmi yon̄teg galsi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Ḡod non ige Tisrael metyak tō ige yatqōtqōngēn. Tō kē mak lēl kēy mahē kēy notog Itsip qeleso nahalvan. Tō kē mitig helem̄ag kēy so kalō den Itsip mi naman a namaymay. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Tō kē motog muhuy tiwag mi kēy bēte son̄wul vet (40) a lepnō vadalm̄eg. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Tō kē mōvōy ige ginwotwot liviyō den Kanan, a et Juw te. Ba tō nilep van napnō nan hiy ige nonon, a ige Tisrael. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ḡod mak nage gōh tege lelo ēte m̄eldēl vag vet son̄wul tēvēlēm (450).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Tō me atgiy en, Ḡod nim̄ōk kal ige lililwo nonoy, tō ige gōh metgoy ige Tisrael gōh, gaydēn̄ a Ḡod metyak Samuel so nivan me net lēgēlgēg. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Tō ige Tisrael mēvēhge van hiy Ḡod so kēy nemyōs nēqēt mayanag vitwag, tō Ḡod metyak Sol, a ēntēn Kis. Sol mavan heylō me den niginwotwot ne bum non Bensimen. Kē nēqēt mayanag bēte son̄wul vet (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Tō Ḡod nilepyak lok kē, ba nim̄ōk kal lokse Devēt, so nimyanag nonoy. Tō Ḡod mohole veg Devēt qelegēn: ‘No metyak Devēt a ēntēn Jēsē, ikē nam̄e et a no nemyōs kokoym̄eg. Kē teskalgoy nahaphap del a no nemyōs.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“Tō Ḡod mavatvat so kē tetyak net vitwag den niginwotwot ne bum non Devēt, tō net nan so nivaēh ige Tisrael. Net nan nahan Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Am̄ag den Tigsas nivan me en, Jon motoytoy van hiy ige Tisrael so kēy dēmleh den nimguy tō vasugyon̄. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Sisqet so notoytoy nonon nibah en, Jon nivap van hiy kēy wo, ‘?Kimi dēm so ino ihē? Ino et Kraēs te. Kē tavan me atgiy, tō no et haytēyēh te so tuwyak nagatli sandol nonon.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Yathithik, kimi ige bōbō non Abraham, tiwag mi kimi mey a nuqul tiwag so dēmap Ḡod. !Yon̄teg! Nohohole a Ḡod melep me bavavaēh ige sil en, kē mēvētleg me hiy gēn mahgengēn.<verse eid="ACT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />“Ba ige sil a tog tō Jerusalem tiwag mi ige lililwo nonoy en, kēy et et vēglal te so Tigsas ihē. Veg kēy et yon̄teg m̄ōleg te nayapyap a ige et lēgēlgēg mayap tō en, wa tō gēn vataptah vaga tō a Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg en. Kēy mēvēvēg kē, tō nage gōh maktig nohohole non ige et lēgēlgēg. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kēy et etsas te hap te mey nehet a so vēvēg kē aē, ba kēy mēvēhge Paelat so wuh mat kē. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Mahē kēy mak bah nahaphap del mey a Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap gatay tō kē en, tō kēy melep tēqēl nataqn̄ēn den nowolwol, tō m̄ōk kē leqyan̄ vet. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />!Ba Ḡod mak ēh lokse kē den namatmat! <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Atgiy, ige mey a madamdam tō Tigsas den Kalili van dēn̄ Jerusalem en, kēy metetsas lokse kē lōqōn̄ m̄adeg. Tō togtōkē en, ige gōh vavasemlō noyoy nonon van hiy ige sil.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />“Tō kemem vasem van hiy kimi noyoy ēwē veg nage a Ḡod mavatvat tō van hiy ige yatqōtqōngēn. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Ḡod mak navatvat nonon gōh makalō me hiy gēn a ige nētnētm̄ey nonon. Kē maktig navatvat nan mahē kē melep kal Tigsas den namatmat. Gēn vatah sas nage gōh Lasam natvēlgi vōyō a mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Inēk intik.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Qiyig gōh nok van me nitiy imam nōnōm.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 2:7</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />“Ḡod mavaplō tō so kē telep kal Tigsas den namatmat, ak tō so kē tit saq vēhte n̄ēh, mi nohohole gōh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘No telep van hiy nēk nitiy vawē yon̄ mey a no melep tō van hiy Devēt am̄ag.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 55:3</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />“Tō Nayapyap Yon̄ vitwag se so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">Nēk tit ukēg veteg vēhte Net Yon̄ nōnōm so niqōn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 16:10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />“Mahē Devēt nēh laptō en, kē maktig namyōs non Ḡod. Tō me atgiy en, kē nimat, tō kēy metvig kē tiwag mi ige yatqōtqōn. !Wa nataqn̄ēn masaq lelo qayan̄! <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ba Tigsas netegha. Ḡod mak ēh lok tō kē den namatmat en, nataqn̄ēn et saq te lelo qayan̄.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Bastō ige yathithik wa ige tētētek, itōk so kimi ēglal so Ḡod nivasemlō van hiy kimi so, heylō Tigsas en, kē tēdēmveteg nubug nonmi. Tō kē tatamgoy negengenyeg del mey a Nele non Mosis tit tamgoy vēhte. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Veg bege gōh en ige del a dēmtig wa mamatēg van hiy Tigsas en, kē tōm̄ōk togolgol kēy van hiy Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Atmi etgoy galsi, veg nahap a ige lēgēlgēg mohole gatay tō en, tiple qal kimi, a Ḡod mavap wo,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Yon̄teg. Kimi mey a mēyēyēheg tō kē en, kimi so et vēglal veyeh ēgēn. Veg kimi tam̄alyow aē, wa tō kimi tamat ganwon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Veg no tak nage vitwag a kimi tamamakē aē a kimi notog ēh lapgetō agōh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Tō net wo nivasem van hiy kimi en, ba kimi tit dēmtig vēhte aso tusu.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Habakuk 1:5</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige del memlaklak boyoy ēwē non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Mahē Pol kōyō Banabas so kalō den nēm̄ tatay en, tō ige sil vēhge lokse kōyō so kōyō tavan vēh lok me hiy kēy lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg itan. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Lēkle tatay en, kēy mēvēlvēlwoy, ba ige m̄adeg matatag Pol kōyō Banabas so hohole tiwag mi kōyō. Kēy ige Juw tiwag mi ige tegtegha a mogmogo goy Ḡod. Tō kōyō mohole biyin̄ kēy so tēy maymay nasgōp non Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Tō taval qōn̄ a Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg en, sisqet so ige del a lelo vōnō nen so van qēt me boyon̄yon̄teg noyoy ēwē non Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ige Juw met van a so nisil liwo mavan me en, tō kēy mamatwolwol Pol kōyō aē, tō qētēg hohole visipteg Pol, wa tō hohole hethet navatvatne non Pol.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ba Pol kōyō Banabas et mētēgteg hōn te, tō kōyō mavap so, “Ḡod mēvētleg totogyeg kamyō me so vasemlō nohohole nonon van hiy kimi ige Tisrael. Ba kimi et buste nohohole nan, wa kimi vavap so kimi et sey te so lep nēh lap. Bastō kamyō so ukēg veteg kimi tō toytoy hiy ige mey et Juw te. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Veg Welan mal vayēg kamyō qeleso:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ino mak tō nēk mavan me qele nuqul, a mihin̄yeg hiy ige a et Juw te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">tō so nēk telep van nēh lap hiy ige sil del telemyam.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 49:6</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ige mey a et ige Juw te moyon̄teg van nohohole gōh en, tō kēy memlaklak aē a nēkēkēn. Tō kēy mēdēmap nohohole non Welan. Wa ige del mey a Ḡod movonyak vatag so kēy telep nēh lap en, kēy mēdēmtig.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Bahnentō, noyoy ēwē non Welan nen maga qēt a lelqelqevōnō del en. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ba ige Juw mosoksok ige lililwo so galyak kēy den Pol kōyō Banabas. Yatkel lōqōvēn lililwo mey et Juw te en, kēy madam nōlōwlō non ige Juw. Ige Juw mavanvan hiy ige lōqōvēn gōh, wa hiy ige lililwo telepnō, tō mak so kēy met buste Pol kōyō. Mak tō so ige lililwo ak tōqtōqyeg yeh Pol kōyō Banabas, tō vōyyak kōyō den napnō nen. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Tō Pol kōyō Banabas mesyap veteg nēvētan ne vōnō den nayn̄oyō, so vasemlō so nēvēvēg non Ḡod apwoy. Tō kōyō van n̄a Ikonium. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ba ige tin̄qoy del memlaklak a nēkēkēn, wa mōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pol kōyō Banabas vatēp Ikonium</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Mahē Pol kōyō Banabas dēn̄ me lepnō Ikonium, kōyō mavan lēm̄ tatay non ige Juw qele kōyō galeg vaga en, tō kōyō toytoy van hiy ige sil, ba notoytoy mēwēwē bah. Tō mayap ige Juw tiwag mi ige m̄adeg Tikrik, tō kēy dēmtig Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ba ige Juw mey a et dēmtig te Tigsas en, kēy mavan velvel hiy ige mey a et Juw te so tig het ige a nēdēmtig. Mak tō ige sil dēmdēm hethet hiy ige yathēthēn aē. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Bastō, yoge hal nen motog lepnō nen nusu hoyo, tō kōyō et mētēgteg te, ba motoytoy lahan Welan. Kōyō mavatne gatay nasgōp non Welan. Tō Welan melep van naman nonon hiy kōyō so galeg naphah wa nēvēglal so vasemlō so nohohole nonon hēyhēywē. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Tō ige lelo vōnō nen motog vēlwoy, veg yatkelgi madam yoge hal, bastō yatkelgi madam ige Juw.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mak tō niviwti a et dēmtig te noyoy ēwē en, kēy muqultiwag so vēyle tiwag mi yoge hal. Niviwti nen, kēy ige Tujuw tiwag mi ige a et Juw te, wa tō ige lililwo nonoy. Kēy movonvon tiwag so yim mat kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ba yoge hal moyon̄teg noyoy gōh en, tō kōyō meplaplag qeleqlen̄ tō mavan lepnō tegha. Tō kōyō mavan loprovēns tegha, Likaonia. Tō kōyō mavatēp walēg napnō Listra tiwag mi Dēbē, wa tō mavan velvel lepnō geh nen. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Tō kōyō mavasemlō tasga noyoy ēwē lelo vōnō geh anen.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige sil a Listra en, kēy dēmdēm so Banabas kōyō Pol yoge ḡod nonoy tam̄ag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Van lepnō Listra en, net vitwag aē a mowot me naqyus. Lēh del nonon en, kē et vanvan hōn te. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Kē nihaghag ba niyon̄yon̄teg van nohohole non Pol. Tō Pol met togolgol van hiy kē, tō met vēglal so net gōh nēdēmtig, tō nēdēmtig nan tavaēh kē. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Tō Pol magayka a nilwo so, “Hatig, ba tig ketket!” Vag tiwag ēwē naqyus nen niyowhatig, tō nivanvan kēlkēl.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mahē a ige sil met van nahap a Pol mak en, tō kēy ōlōl lagatgat Tilikaonia so, “!Yoge ḡod mēhēw tēqēl me qele net ēgēn!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Tō ige sil nen qētēg ōl kōyō mi nahan ḡod tam̄ag nonoy. Banabas, kēy mōl kē so “Zeus,” wa mōl Pol so “Hermes.” Veg Pol, kē net bohohole noyō qeleso Hermes net bohohole non Zeus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zeus wa Hermes en, kōyō ḡod galgal nonon ige Tikrik. Zeus en, namyanag liwo non ige ḡod, wa Hermes noyowyowveg nonon.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nēm̄ yon̄ non Zeus sisqet napnō. Tō nipris lēm̄ yon̄ nen mētēymat so niak nolol vitwag van hiy yoge hal. Kē melep me yatkel bōlōk, tō niheygoy kēy mi nakaskas, tō melep me lemtegeay ne vōnō so wuhmat kēy. Veg nipris tiwag mi ige sil nemyōs so galeg nolol aē.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ba Banabas kōyō Pol moyon̄teg en, tō valaplag me hiy ige sil, mahayhay namalsam nōyō veg kōyō mololwon a nēkēkēn. Tō kōyō ōlōl van hiy kēy wo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“?Yēhē, bahap tō kimi so ak nage qelegōh? !Kamyō net woywoy ēwē qele kimi en! Kamyō vanvan tēy me noyoy ēwē hiy kimi gatay nitiy Ḡod. Veg ige ḡod tam̄ag, kēy yeghuquy ēwē. !Atmi van me hiy Ḡod mey a nēh, a kē mitin̄ nōtōq, nēvētan, nanaw, wa nahaphap del geh van alon en! <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Me am̄ag en, Ḡod mukēg ige telemyam so tatag vēlēs nēmētwōy. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ba kē mavasemlō kē van hiy kimi mi nahaphap mey nēwē. Kē mēvētleg me nasm̄al den alge, wa nemes gengen, so niōyheg nalo taqami, tō so niak nalo taqami nimlaklak.”<verse eid="ACT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Mi nohohole goh en, kōyō mihigoy ige sil so nitog olol mi nōbōlōk van hiy kōyō, ba et towoyig te so higoy kēy.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Mey atgiy, yatkel Juw mavan me den Antiok tiwag mi Ikonium, tō mēvēl ige sil. Tō kēy miyim Pol mi nevet, tō yap lō kē den napnō, wa seleslen̄ den kē. Veg kēy dēm so kē mal mat. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ba ige tin̄qoy telepnō nen mavan me mitig dēln̄et kē, tō kē nihatig lok. Tō kē nihayveg lokse hay lelo vōnō. Tō taval meyen nan, Pol kōyō Banabas hatig tō van n̄a Dēbē.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemtehal non Banabas kōyō Pol bōm̄ōlm̄ōl lok me en, kōyō mavan walēg lok mahē a kōyō mavan tō me aē am̄ag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pol kōyō Banabas motoytoy se van lepnō Dēbē en, tō mak ige m̄adeg mēdēmtig se. Tō Pol kōyō Banabas so m̄ōl lokse en, ba kōyō mavan tatag lokse namtehal a kōyō mavan lō tō me aē. Kōyō mavan heylō Listra, Ikoniam, tō van me Antiok. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Vel vōnō gōh en, kōyō mohole biyin̄ nēdēmdēm non ige tin̄qoy, wa mavap hiy maymay kēy so tig netnet lēdēmtig. Kōyō mavap van hiy kēy so, “Gēn tavan heylō nememeh m̄adeg bah en, tō gēn qoyo hayveg lemyeyen non Ḡod.”<verse eid="ACT 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Vel ēm̄ tatay en, kōyō metyak tēymat ige lililwo nan. Tō heylō latatay wa lagaygay mamah nonoy en, kōyō mōm̄ōk kēy lemnen Welan mey a kēy nēdēmtig kē. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Tō kōyō mavan heylō me Pisidia, tō mēhēw tēqēl me heylō loprovēns Pamfilia <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />tō dēn̄ lepnō Pega. Tō kōyō mavasemlō se Noyoy Ēwē van lepnō anen. Tō kōyō hēwtēqēl lepnō vitwag Atalia, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />tō madam nabaklap vitwag tō m̄ōl lok me Antiok. Mahē nan a kēy matatay tō van hiy Ḡod aē am̄ag, a so nimyin̄ kōyō bemgumgu a kōyō magaleg.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Kōyō dēn̄ me Antiok en, tō kōyō ōlōl tiwag me ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ so vasemlō nahap a Ḡod magaleg tō tiwag mi kōyō. Tō kōyō mavasemlō van aso qeleave Ḡod mawak namte-ēm̄ ne dēmtig hiy ige mey a et Juw te. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Tō kōyō motog tiwag van mi ige tin̄qoy telepnō nen suvay misin.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Nōyōstiwag liwo n̄a Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Bahnentō, yatkel et mavan me den Judea, tō mavan me Antiok. Tō kēy qētēg vatvatne ige a nēdēmtig so, “So net wo et tep vēglal te nēk tatag van nēvēnamem a Mosis mayap tō en, nēk tit tēy vēhte nēh lap.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ige Juw mey a hohole gatay neteptep vēglal en, kēy nemyōs so ige mey et Juw so tatag Nele del non Mosis.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Tō Pol kōyō Banabas mēvēy vavaleh tiwag mi ige nan. Bastō ige et tēlēm̄ yon̄ metyak yatkel et so vētleg kēy hiy ige hal wa ige lililwo n̄a Jerusalem, so vēhge kēy aē. Tō kēy metyak Pol kōyō Banabas, tiwag mi yatkel et se so van.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Nēm̄ yon̄ memyin̄ kēy bemtehal nonoy so van Jerusalem. Tō kēy mavan heylō napnō Fonisia tiwag mi Samaria, mohoyhoy so qeleave tō ige mey a et Juw te en, kēy mēdēm leh so tatag Ḡod. Mak tō ige dēmtig lelo vōnō nen memlaklak liwo aē.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Mahē kēy mēdēn̄ me Jerusalem en, ige hal tiwag mi ige lililwo, wa ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ del melep vasgēt kēy. Tō Pol kōyō Banabas wa yaplupluyō kaka van hiy kēy nahaphap a Ḡod mak tō heylō kēy. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Bahnentō, ige dēmtig yatkelgi a matatag tō ige Farisi en, kēy hatig tō vap van hiy kēy so, “Ige dēmtig mey a kēy et Juw te en, itōk so tep vēglal kēy. !Tō vatne galsi kēy so dam Nele non Mosis!”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Ige hal tiwag mi ige lililwo ne ēm̄ tatay mahag tiwag so etet heylō van bēdēmdēm nan en. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Tō kēy mēvēy vavaleh bēdēmdēm a nemsin. Tō Simon Pita nitig ketket hag tō nihole van hiy kēy wo, “Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek, kimi mal ēglal tō aē aso Ḡod metyak no den nēvēwti nongēn, so nok vasemlō noyoy ēwē van hiy ige mey a et Juw te. Ige gōh mētēy noyoy gōh, tō kēy mēdēmtig. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Tō Ḡod nēglal nēdēmdēm non net del. Tō kē melep van Nuvu Yon̄ hiy kēy, qele a kē melep me hiy gēn en. Veg bege gōh en, Ḡod mavasemlō so kē mal lep vasgēt kēy. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />!Ḡod et vēlwoy te kēy den gēn, veg kē mak wenwen nalo taqay mi nēdēmtig!<verse eid="ACT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />“?Bahap tō kimi mōm̄ōk nētētēy dēw van leqtēg benen ige tin̄qoy? ?Kimi so helhel etgal Ḡod? Nele non Mosis en, kē nētētēy mey a igēn ige Juw tiwag mi ige tamatmayge tit yuwu vēhte. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />!Ba gēn nēdēmtig so nasgōp non Tigsas Kraēs nivaēh gēn, wa nivaēh kēy!”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Tō ige del lōyōstiwag mahag yoyon̄, tō kēy yon̄teg hiy nakaka non Banabas kōyō Pol. Kōyō makaka gatay woqse vēglal wa naphah a Ḡod magaleg heylō kōyō lengon ige mey a et Juw te.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Vētmahē kōyō mohohole bah en, tō Jemes nihohole temun. Kē mavap so, “Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek, atmi yon̄teg me hiy no. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simon Pita mal vasem me qeleave tō Ḡod metgoy ige a et Juw te, tō mokokm̄egoy ige vēwti nan lahan. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Tō nohohole non ige belgēlgēg netnenen se qelenen, qele a Ḡod mavap tō Layapyap Yon̄ so,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Lēkle haphap nen, no tavan lok me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Tō nok wos lokse nēm̄ non Devēt mey a mal saq.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Nahap a misisgoy en, no telep kal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">tō towos lokse.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Veg bege gōh en ige tegha tosok Welan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">ige mino mey a kēy et Juw te, ba kēy nēglal nahek.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ino Welan, no mavap tō navavap gōh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:18">wa no melgēlgēg tō nahaphap gōh tō me am̄ag.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Amos 9:11-12</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Tō Jemes nihole tasga so, “Bastō, nok dēmdēm so gēn nitog akak hiy ige a et Juw te, a kēy mal van vatag hiy Ḡod. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ba itōk so gēn yap te yapyap van hiy kēy qelegēn. Kēy nitog gengen nēphog a kēy molol tō van nototgal vet. Tō nitog legleg solosloteg. Wa tō kēy nitog gengen naday. Wa tog gengen nēphog mey naday aē a net nipgiy goy ēwē nēnlon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ige Juw en, kēy mitig maymay so nitog gengen naday veg Nele non Mosis. Wa tō kēy et buste nibigbig mey a naday nan et lon̄ lō te. Sowo ige a et Juw te gen negengen nan, tō ige Juw tet buste so gengen tiwag mi kēy lēm̄ yon̄.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Veg Nele non Moses, mey am̄ag en, kēy vatah lō vel ēm̄ yon̄, vel vōnō del, wa vel Qōn̄ M̄ōkheg.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Neletes hiy ige a kēy et Juw te</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Tō ige hal tiwag mi ige lililwo wa ige del tēlēm̄ yon̄ mēdēmm̄ēt so vētleg yatkel et so van tiwag mi Pol kōyō Banabas n̄a Antiok. Tō kēy metyak Silas kōyō Judas (nahan vitwag Basabas), yoge mey a ige dēmtig del nēdēmap kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Tō neletes a kēy mēvētleg tiwag mi ige gōh en qelegēn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:23">Den ige hal tiwag mi ige lililwo a ige yathithimi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:23">Hiy ige yathithimem wa yatētētamem mey a et Juw te a lelo vōnō Antiok, Siria, bastō Silisia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:23">!Lemtap nēwē!<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Kemem moyon̄teg so yatkel et den gēn mavan me hiy kimi, ba mak hethet kimi mi nohohole nonon, tō kimi mēdēmdēm vōvōyō aē. !Ba kemem et vap te van hiy kēy so kēy so ak qelenen! <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Tō kemem movonm̄ēt so etyak te et se, tō vētleg kēy me hiy kimi. Tō kēy tadam me yoge bulsal sewsew nongēn a Banabas kōyō Pol. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Yoge gōh et mētēgteg te so kōyō mat lahan Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Bastō kemem mēvētleg Silas kōyō Judas so vap van hiy kimi qele a kemem mayap me hiy kimi agōh.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Veg itōk hiy Nuvu Yon̄, wa itōk hiy kemem, so kemem nitog m̄ōkm̄ōk se van nele dēw hiy kimi. Be kemem nemyōs so lep van le gōh mey a nitiy wē yeh. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Aso nitog gengen negengen mey a kēy mōlōl tō aē van hiy ḡod galgal, nitog gengen negengen mey a naday aē, wa tō nitog gengen nēphog mey a net mepgiy goy ēwē nēnlon. Wa nitog legleg solosloteg. So kimi wo motog viligteg nahaphap del geh gōh en, tō kimi mak nage mey a nēwē.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:29">Vēwē kimi.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Tō ige nen hatig den Jerusalem tō van Antiok. Mahē kēy dēn̄ me Antiok en, tō kēy ōlōl tiwag me ige tēlēm̄ yon̄, tō lep van hiy kēy neletes. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ige sil meptah lō neletes nen en, tō kēy memlaklak aē a nēkēkēn bohohole vasōsōp. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Judas kōyō Silas en, kōyō yoge belgēlgēg, tō kōyō mavap navavap m̄adeg so vasōsōp ige dēmtig, bastō mavahiy maymay kēy. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Kōyō motog mi ige dēmtig a Antiok nen suvay misin. Tō ige sil a Antiok mēvētleg m̄ōl lokse kōyō hiy ige lililwo a Jerusalem mi natm̄at.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yatkel yapyap tam̄ag vap beves 34 so “Ba Silas mēdēm so itōk so kē nihag lap.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Tō Pol kōyō Banabas motog lap Antiok. Ba kōyō tiwag mi ige et m̄adeg se mavasemlō noyoy ēwē, wa mavatvatne ige sil mi navavap non Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol kōyō Banabas mēvēlwoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Et misin te Pol nivap van hiy Banabas so, “!Itōk so dōyō van vatēp ige dēmtig lamahē del a dōyō mavasemlō tō navavap non Ḡod aē, tō et so kēy qeleave!”<verse eid="ACT 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Tō Banabas nemyōs so Jon Mak nidam tatag kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ba Pol et buste veg am̄ag Jon Mak mahaglap tō den kōyō n̄a Pamfilia. Kē et mugumgu tasga te tiwag mi kōyō, ba mōm̄ōl lok den kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Tō Pol kōyō Banabas mēvēy vavaleh liwo aē, mak tō kōyō mēvēlwoy, tō vanvan vivitwag. Banabas melep Jon Mak, tō kōyō moyow labaklap tō gam hiy Sayprus. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ba Pol metyak Silas. Tō ige dēmtig del a Antiok en mukēg Pol kōyō van lemnen Ḡod, tō kōyō van. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Tō kōyō mavan heylō napnō Siria tiwag mi Silisia, tō vavap hiy maymay ige lēm̄ yon̄ geh lepnō anen.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti mavan tatag Pol kōyō Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pol mavan me Dēbē tiwag mi Listra. Ba nitin̄qoy non Tigsas vitwag tog tō anen nahan Timoti. Tita non Timoti gōh, ikē Nujuw vitwag a kē nēdēmtig, tō imam nonon nage Tikrik. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ige yathēthēngēn a Listra tiwag mi Ikoniam mēdēmap Timoti so ikē net ēwē vitwag. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pol nemyōs so Timoti nivan tatag kē, ba ige Juw del a tog tō mahē nen nēglal so imam non Timoti nage Tikrik. Ba Pol metep vēglal Timoti so ak muhuy noboel nonoy. Tō Timoti nidam tatag Pol.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pol tiwag mi yoge yaplōplōn mavan heyheylō vel vōnō geh nen, tō vavasemlō van hiy kēy nele a ige hal tiwag mi ige lililwo lelo ēm̄ yon̄ Jerusalem mōm̄ōk tō. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Bastō nēdēmtig non ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ nen mamaymay, tō vel qōn̄ kēy yap batbat me nisil lēm̄ yon̄.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol met nage vitwag loqoyqoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pol tiwag mi yoge yaplōplōn mavan heylō napnō Ḡalasia tiwag mi Frigia. Ba Nuvu Yon̄ et ukēg te so kēytēl so vasemlō noyoy van lepnō Esia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Mahē kēytēl van dēn̄ me lepnō Misia en, tō kēytēl mehelhel etgal so yow lege napnō Bitinia, ba Nuvu non Tigsas et ukēg te. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Tō kēytēl mavan lō Misia tō van tasga Troas.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Tō anqōn̄ nan en, Pol met nage vitwag a loqoyqoy. Kē met qeleso net vitwag Tamasedonia tig tō anen, ba kē nivēhge maymay van hiy Pol so, “Nēk so van ēgē me Masedonia, so biyin̄ kemem.”<verse eid="ACT 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Pol met bah nage nen en, vag tiwag ēwē kemem sok namtehal tō so van Masedonia. Veg kemem nēglal so Ḡod mōlōl kemem so vasemlō noyoy ēwē van hiy ige sil lelo vōnō anen.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kēy mavan me Filipae tō Lidia mēdēmtig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tō kemem melep nabaklap nen tō mukēg den Troas tō magam tenenen van lepnō Samotres. Tō taval qōn̄ nan en, kemem magam tasga dēn̄ me Neapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Tō kemem hēw den nabaklap, tō van dēn̄ me Filipae. Napnō Filipae en, kē nam̄e vōnō a loprovēns Masedonia, ba ige lelqelqe vōnō nen ikēy mavan me den Rom. Tō kemem motog natkelgi lelo vōnō anen.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg a Layavēg kemem makalō den nalqelqe vōnō nen, tō van me sili bē liwo, veg kemem moyon̄teg so mahē vitwag nen ige Juw vanvan me batatay aē. Kemem van me mahē nan en, ba ige lōqōvēn mal dēn̄ me, tō kemem haghiy hōw tō kemem kaka ēgēn. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ba nalqōvēn vitwag yon̄teg tō hiy nakaka nonmem en, nalqōvēn nan nahan Lidia. Ikē nage te lelqelqevōnō Tiatira. Ba kē nin̄yen̄yeg namalmal a nalahme ba nēsēm nan neketket geh. Nalqōvēn nan, kē et Juw te, ba kē nataqtaqlun̄ goy Ḡod vaga. Tō Welan mawak nēdēmdēm nonon tō kē mēdēmtig nohohole nonon Pol. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Tō ikē tiwag mi ige del lēm̄ nonon wa ige et mugumgu nonon, kēy del mavasugyon̄ qēt. Tō kē nivap me hiy kemem wo, “Sowo kimi dēm van so no nēdēmtig hēyhēywē Welan, ba van me tog qōtō lēm̄ mino.” Tō kē nivēhge maymay kemem, tō kemem van lēm̄ nonon ēgēn.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kēy mētēy Pol kōyō Silas lēm̄ yētyēt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag, kemem so van batatay, ba nam̄alm̄al vitwag metsas kemem. Nam̄alm̄al nan, kē neslev. Tō ige welan nonon tēytēy nēsēm liwo veg kē, veg nuvu vitwag aē mi kē bēsēsēil. Tō ige sil wēlwēl ige welan nonon, veg nam̄alm̄al nan netet vēglal nahaphap. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Tō nam̄alm̄al nan madamdam lap Pol tiwag mi kemem. Tō kē niōlōl a nilwo so, “!Ige gōh, ige yowyowveg non Ḡod a neketket yeh! !Kēy vavasem van hiy kimi namtehal a kimi so tētēy nēh lap aē!”<verse eid="ACT 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Kē mak qelegōh nōqōn̄ m̄adeg, ba Pol moyon̄ ninhet aē. Tō Pol mat kēlē me hiy nuvu het nen ba nivap so, “!Mi naman non Tigsas Kraēs, nok vap van hiy nēk so kalō den nam̄alm̄al anen!” Vag tiwag ēwē tō nuvu het nen nikalō den kē.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Mahē a ige welan nonon met van qelenen en, tō kēy mēglal tēymat so kēy tit tēy se vēhte nēsēm aē ēgēn. Tō kēy tēy maymay Pol kōyō Silas, tō gamteg kōyō hiy ige lililwo ne vōnō van lehyay. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Kēy vantēy Pol kōyō Silas me hiy ige mayanag non ige Torom, tō vap van hiy kēy wo, “!Yoge Juw gōh mavan me ba makak tēqtēqyeg ige sil lelo vōnō nongēn! <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Kōyō mavasemlō nēmētwuyō mey a nele nongēn Torom mal higoy.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Tō ige sil mahatig goy kōyō. Tō ige lililwo non ige Torom mahay qēt namalsam nonoyō. Ba melmelm̄eh kōyō mi nēqētēnge vag m̄adeg. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Tō kēy m̄ōk bat kōyō lēm̄ yētyēt. Tō kēy vap van hiy net betetgoy nēm̄ yētyēt so etgoy galsi kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kē moyon̄teg van qelenen en, tō kē mōm̄ōk bat kōyō a lidin mey a yeh hay alon. Tō mēqlēh maymay nayn̄oyō mi neyep liwo len̄.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Sisqet lētn̄ēt ne qōn̄, tō Pol kōyō Silas tatay ba sese neh van hiy Ḡod. Ba yatkel et a lēm̄ yētyēt en hag ba yon̄teg van hiy kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Tō kēy yon̄teg ganwon van a nēm̄ miyiyeg qēt, tō natawye mete ēm̄ del mawak qēt. Tō ige del mey a kēy mēyēt kēy mi nējēn en, nējēn mutuwyak den kēy.<verse eid="ACT 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Net betetgoy nēm̄ yētyēt nen matyak me so et van qele kē namte ēm̄ del mal wak tawal. Kē dēmdēm so ige hay lelo ēm̄ en mal valaplag qeleqlen̄. Tō kē nilepyak nagasel bepgapgal nonon so nigon mat kē mahgen. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ba Pol magaygayka so, “!Nitog gongon mat nēk! !Kemem del agōh!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Tō net betetgoy nēm̄ yētyēt en niōlōl van hiy net vitwag so nilep me nuqul, tō kē niplag bat hay lelo ēm̄ mi nihiyey, tō vatiqaw hōw a lengon Pol kōyō Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Bahnentō, kē nivēl lōlō kōyō yow me tō nivap van hiy kōyō wo, “?Yohē, no tak qeleave tō no tētēy nēh?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Kōyō meplu goy kē van wo, “Nēk dēmtig Welan Tigsas, tō nēk tētēy nēh lap, inēk tiwag mi ige del a lelo ēm̄ nōnōm.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Tō Pol kōyō Silas vasem Noyoy Ēwē veg Welan van hiy kē tiwag mi ige del a lelo ēm̄ nonon.<verse eid="ACT 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Vag tiwag ēwē anqōn̄ nen, kē nivēl lōlō kōyō me, tō nimen̄ m̄ōgm̄ōgteg namtewot noyō. Tō kēy del vasugyon̄ qēt. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Tō kē nivan tēy kōyō lēm̄ nonon, tō nilep van negengen hiy kōyō. Tō kē memlaklak a nēkēkēn veg kē mēdēmtig Ḡod, tiwag mi ige del nonon.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Mahē mal meyen, tō ige lililwo non ige Torom vētleg me ige yowyowveg nonon lēm̄ yētyēt, so vap so “Ukēg lō yoge anen.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Tō net betet goy ēm̄ yētyēt vap so, “Ige lililwo Torom ma vap so nok ukēg taywah kōmyō. Bastō, kōmyō kalō mi natm̄at.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ba Pol vap van hiy ige yowyowveg nen so, “!Nahap qelenen! Kamyō nēteg vōnō Torom ba kēy melm̄eh kamyō lengon ige sil yeghuquy, a nēvēvēg tateh. ?Ba kēy nemyōs so lōn̄veg kamyō, so kamyō so kalō? !Tateh! Itōk so kēy van me, tō tig helem̄ag lō kamyō.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Noyowyowveg nivan tō nivasem lokse van naln̄an Pol hiy ige lililwo nen. Kēy a moyon̄teg van aso kōyō nēteg vōnō Torom en, tō kēy memtēgteg. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Tō kēy van me, tō vap namgaysēn van hiy kōyō, tō tig helem̄ag kōyō, tō vēhge kōyō so ukēg nowmat napnō anen. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Kōyō makalō den nēm̄ yētyēt, tō kōyō mavan vatēp Lidia. Mahē kōyō mohole biyin̄ bah ige dēmtig en, tō kōyō van ēgēn.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Pol kōyō Silas mavan Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pol kōyō Silas mavan heylō napnō Amfipolis tiwag mi Apolonia tō mavan dēn̄ Tesalonika. Van lepnō nan en nēm̄ tatay vitwag aē a non ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pol mahayveg van lēm̄ tatay nen qele kē niwowow vaga. Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg vētēl en, Pol muqul tiwag mi kēy so hole gatay Nayapyap Yon̄ veg Kraēs. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Kē mavatne kēy so Nayapyap Tēnēte mavap so Kraēs toyon̄ memeh, tō me atgiy, tahatig lokse den namatmat. Kē wo, “Tō Tigsas a nok vasemlō van hiy kimi en, ikē Kraēs.”<verse eid="ACT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Tō yatkel Juw den kēy mēdēmtig, tō muqul tiwag mi Pol kōyō Silas. Wa tō ige Tikrik m̄adeg mey a kēy mogmogo goy Ḡod muqul tiwag, wa ige lōqōvēn m̄adeg non ige lililwo telepnō nen, kēy se mēdēmtig. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ba ige Juw meqneg kōyō aē, tō kēy van tō vēl ige qōvē, tō kēy mak nēvēwti liwo vitwag tō kesyak nēvēygēl liwo. Kēy meplag van lēm̄ non Jeson so tēy Pol kōyō Silas, so vantēy kōyō me hiy ige sil.<verse eid="ACT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ba kēy et etsas te kōyō, tō kēy tēy Jeson tiwag mi ige dēmtig yatkelgi se, tō gamteg kēy van lengon ige lililwo telepnō. Tō ige sil nen gaygayka hag wo, “Yoge mey a mak tēktēk tō vel mahē lemyam en, kōyō mal dēn̄ me vētmahē gōh, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />tō Jeson mal lep vasgēt kōyō me. Kēy del helhel nele non nēqēt mayanag Sisa, veg kēy vap so namyanag tegha aē, a nahan Tigsas.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ige lililwo wa ige telepnō moyon̄teg qelegōh en, tō kēy moyon̄ ninhet aē. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Tō kēy mēvēvēg Jeson kēy so tamgoy mi nēsēm, tō kēy ukēg taywah kēy.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol kōyō Silas mavan Berea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Anqōn̄ nan how nen en, tō ige yathēthēy vētleg yak Pol kōyō Silas n̄a Berea. Kōyō dēn̄ van mahē nen en, tō kōyō van hay lēm̄ tatay non ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Tō vel qōn̄ Pol kōyō Silas vatvatne ige Juw. Ige Juw nen, kēy nam̄e et yeh den ige Tetesalonika, veg ige Juw Teberea netet m̄ōleg Nayapyap Yon̄ so navatvatne nan hēywē si tateh, tō kēy nemlaklak yeh so yon̄teg. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Bastō ige Juw m̄adeg mēdēmtig, tiwag mi ige Krik m̄adeg, wa ige lōqōvēn nan a netey natno lililwo.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ba mahē a ige Juw Tetesalonika moyon̄teg so Pol nitoytoy nohohole non Ḡod n̄a Berea en, tō kēy van se me Berea. Tō kēy mak nēdēmdēm non ige sil mem̄geygey, tō so kēy tiple vēygēl se. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Tō ige dēmtig nen vētleg yak togotgo Pol den Berea, ba Silas kōyō Timoti tog lap. Tō Pol nihēw tēqēl hiy nale. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Tō ige mey a van tiwag tō mi Pol en, kēy mavan tēy kē mahē hoyo mēdēn̄ Atens. Mahē kēy so m̄ōl lok Berea en, tō Pol mavap van hiy kēy so “Vētleg togotgo me Silas kōyō Timoti hiy no.”<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol n̄a lepnō Atens</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pol menyēnyē Silas kōyō Timoti n̄a lepnō Atens. Tō nēdēmdēm nonon et muhuy te veg kē met van so napnō nen nōyheg totgal ne ḡod galgal. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Bastō kē nitoytoy hiy ige Juw wa ige tegtegha mey a kēy mogmogo goy Ḡod lēm̄ tatay. Tō kē nitoytoy se hiy ige sil lehyay vel qōn̄. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wa tō yatkel et mēnay vēy vavaleh tiwag mi kē. Ikēy yatkel et a kēy ōl so Epikurean wa yatkel et a kēy ōl so Stoik. Tō kēy vap so, “Net beptōptog hohole solosloteg gōh, kē nihole gatay nahap?” Ba yatkelgi wo, “Kē wun nihohole gatay ige ḡod halvan.” Kēy vap qelenen veg Pol nivavasemlō noyoy ēwē a qeleave Tigsas mahatig lokse den namatmat.<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Tō kēy tēy Pol tō vantēy kē lēm̄ yōstiwag vitwag, nahan Areopagus. Tō kēy vap so, “Kemem nemyōs so ēglal m̄ōleg nēdēmdēm gayaq mey a nēk vavasemlō tō anen. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Veg nage a nēk vap geh tō nen, ikē negyaq me hiy kemem. Kemem nemyōs so ēglal galsi namanig ne hohole nan.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ige et Tatens, tiwag mi ige halvan a tog tō lepnō gōh en, vel qōn̄ kēy hag kaka gatay vēlēs nēdēmdēm gayaq anen.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Bahnentō, Pol mitig ketket hag a lelo yōstiwag a Areopagus en, tō mavap so, “Ige sil lelo vōnō Atens, no mal etsas so kimi gōh ige batatay. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Veg mahē a no mavan heylō napnō nonmi en, no metsas qēt nahaphap del a kimi mogmogo goy. Tō no metsas nahye olol vitwag a nayapyap taq tō aē en so, ‘Van hiy ḡod a gēn et ēglal te.’ Tō kimi mogmogo goy Ḡod mey a kimi et ēglal te. Ikē nitiy Ḡod a nok so vasemlō van hiy kimi.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Ḡod a mitin̄ namyam tiwag mi nahaphap del a lelo mayam en, kē nilwo goy nōtōq wa nēvētan. Tō kē et togtog te lēm̄ olol mey a net mak tō. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Wa tō kē et mōyōs te namyimyin̄ den ige sil veg nahaphap del nonon aē. Veg Ḡod gōh a kē melep me nōmōkhangēn, wa nēh, tiwag mi nahaphap del. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Tō Ḡod mitin̄ ige viwti et del yak den net vitwag, tō so kēy tog velvel vētmahē del lemyam. Tō kē mēvēlwoywoy ige et, so kēy totogtog ave wa tēdēn̄ n̄ēh. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Kē mak qelegōh tō so ige et so sok kē, tō halveg dēln̄et vel mahē, tō wun etsas kē. Ba kē et yeh te den gēn vivitwag, veg,<verse eid="ACT 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Heylō kē en, kemem mēh, tō tak vēh nahaphap, wa tō totog vēh lemyam gōh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:28">“Qele ige nōnōm mayap tō me am̄ag, so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">Igēn ige nētnētm̄ey nonon.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Veg igēn ige nētnētm̄ey nonon en, tō kimi nitog dēmdēm so Ḡod en, kē qele nōḡōl, si nēsēlva, si nevet. Mey gōh en nototgal mey a net mak mi nēmnay wa nēdēmdēm nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Nēmētwun ige sil mey am̄ag, mahē a kēy et ēglal te Ḡod en, kē et dēm te van aē. Ba togtōkē, kē niōlvayēg ige sil del vel mahē so kēy dēm leh. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Veg Ḡod mal etyak nōqōn̄ vitwag so net nonon tēvēvēg ige del telemyam mi nēvēvēg tenenen. Tō Ḡod mal ak ēh lokse net nan den namatmat. Meygōh nivasemlō hiy ige del so nahap a Ḡod mavap gatay Tigsas en, kē nēhēyhēywē.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Mahē a ige sil moyon̄teg van so net mahatig lokse den namatmat en, ba yatkel et moboyboy aē. Tō yatkelgi mavap so, “Kemem nemyōs so yon̄teg lokse nēdēmdēm nen den nēk.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Tō Pol nukēg veteg kēy tō nivan. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ba yatkel et mēdēmtig Pol, tō matatag kē. Tō ige a madam Pol en, net liwo vitwag lēvēwti non Areopagus nahan Dionisius, wa nalqōvēn vitwag nahan Damaris, tiwag mi yatkel et se.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pol n̄a lepnō Korint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Me atgiy, Pol nivan yak den Atens tō nivan Korint. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Tō kē metsas Nujuw vitwag nahan Aquila, kē nage Topontus. Aquila qoyo van gayaq ēwē tō me den Itali, a lepnō Rom. Ba mahē nēqēt mayanag Kladius mōvōyyak ige Juw del den Rom en, tō Aquila kōyō ēgnōn, nahan Prisila, mavan me lepnō Korint. Tō Pol mavan tō nitog tiwag mi kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Ba namgumgu namuytēl haytēyēh, a bususuy tapolēn ne ēm̄. Bastō Pol motog mi kōyō, tō kēytēl mugumgu tiwag. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Vel Qōn̄ M̄ōkheg, Pol nitoytoy lēm̄ tatay, so yap me ige Juw wa ige Krik.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Mahē Silas kōyō Timoti mavan me den Masedonia so biyin̄ goy Pol en, tō Pol nibah den nususuy tapolēn, bastō nitig tasga bavavasemlō Yoy Ēwē. Tō kē mavasem galsi van hiy ige Juw aso Kraēs en, ikē Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ba kēy mitig kēlē Pol, tō mitig het kē. Bastō kē mesyap yak nelem den neheyhey nonon. Tō kē nivap van hiy kēy so, “!Nēvēvēg wa naday nonmi apwomi mahgemi, ba et hiy no te, veg no netnenen! Entō gōh, no tavan vēlēs hiy ige mey a kēy et Juw te.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Tō Pol nikalō den nēm̄ tatay, tō nivan lēm̄ non net vitwag nahan Titius Justus. Titius et Juw te, ba kē net bomogmogo goy Ḡod. Tō nēm̄ nonon nahag tiwag mi nēm̄ tatay non ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Bahnentō, Krispus, net liwo goy nēm̄ tatay nen, kē mēdēmtig Welan. Tō ige del a lelo ēm̄ nonon Krispus en, kēy mēdēmtig qēt. Tō ige m̄adeg Tokorint moyon̄teg noyoy ēwē, tō mēdēmtig, wa mavasugyon̄.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Tō anqōn̄ vitwag, Welan mohole van hiy Pol loqoyqoy, so “Nitog mētēgteg, wa nitog haghag yoyon̄, ba hole tasga. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Veg ino tiwag mi nēk, tō tateh et so tak tēqtēqyeg nēk si so tak memeh nēk, veg net nam̄adeg me lepnō gōh mey a tēdēmtig no.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Tō Pol motog van nen nēte vitwag nagaytegi, nivatvatne ige sil mi navavap non Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige Juw mavantēy Pol lokot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mahē Galio namyanag liwo goy noprovēns nan (nahan Akaya), ige Juw hay tiwag so tēy Pol tō m̄ōk kē lokot. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Tō kēy vap van hiy Galio so, “!Net gōh nivatvatne ige sil so mogmogo goy Ḡod lemtehal mey a et tatag te nele!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bahnentō, Pol nitēymat so nivap te hap, ba Galio nihole van hiy ige Juw so, “Yēhē Juw, so net vitwag wo mehel nele siso mak nage mey nehet yeh, tō no toyon̄teg vēh kimi aē. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ba veg kimi vēy vēyle gatay navavap, wa nahah tegtegha, wa nele nonmi, tō atmi van ak lemyōs nonmi. Nok valeh yak no so vēvēg nahaphap qele anen.”<verse eid="ACT 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Tō Galio nivōyyak kēy den nēm̄ kot. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Tō ige Juw del mētēy maymay net liwo nonoy Sostēnēs, a kē net liwo ne ēm̄ tatay nonoy. Tō kēy vēhyuw mi kē lengo ēm̄ kot, ba Galio et dēmdēm te van aē.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mōm̄ōl lokse Antiok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Tō Pol motog nōqōn̄ m̄adeg van lepnō nen, tō kē qoyo van veteg ige yathēthēn. Ba Prisila kōyō Aquila mavan tiwag mi kē. Kēy mavan dēn̄ Kenkria, tō Pol nibal nēlēn tatag van navatvat a kē mavatvat tō aē.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nēvēnan ige Juw en, net tak vēh navatvat van hiy Ḡod so gaygay mamah den ninin maymay wa yatkel haphap se tatag van Numbers 6:1-21. Mahē a navatvat nibah en, tō net nan nibal nēlēn tō nilep van nolol hiy Ḡod.</char></note> Bahnentō, kēytēl gam hiy Siria. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Tō kēytēl van me Efesas. Tō Pol mōm̄ōk Prisila kōyō Aquila so kōyō hag lap Efesas. Ba Pol mahgen nivanvan lēm̄ tatay, tō kē nitoytoy hiy ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Tō kēy mēvēhge so kē totog tusu vēh tiwag mi kēy, ba kē mavaleh kēy. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Mahē kē so nivan veteg kēy en, kē nivap van hiy kēy so, “Nok van, ba no tavan lok me hiy kimi, sowo lemyōs non Ḡod.” Tō kē niyem lokse labaklap, tō nigam yak den Efesas.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Pol nivēykal van lepnō Sisaria en, tō nivan dēn̄ Jerusalem so nivap nohohole batamtam nonon van hiy ige tēlēm̄ yon̄. Tō me atgiy, kē nim̄ōl lokse Antiok. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Tō kē motog tekelgi bah van nen, tō kē nivan heylō lokse lelqelqevōnō Ḡalasia tiwag mi Frigia. Tō kē nivahiy maymay ige tin̄qoy telepnō nen.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos motog lepnō Efesas ba Korint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Nujuw vitwag mavan me Efesas. Kē nahan Apolos, kē mowot n̄a Aleksadria. Ikē net lolmeyen vitwag, wa kē nēglal m̄ōleg hiy Nayapyap Yon̄. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Kē nēglal namtehal non Kraēs, tō navaksan aē bohole veg Tigsas. Tō navatvatne nonon netnenen. Ba kē nēglal vēlēs navasugyon̄ non Jon. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Tō kē meqtēg toytoy lēm̄ tatay non ige Juw. Prisila kōyō Aquila moyon̄teg kē en, tō kōyō mokokm̄egoy kē. Tō kōyō tuan malig se van hiy kē navatvatne bemtehal non Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Mahē Apolos nemyōs so nivan how Korint a loprovēns Akaya en, ige yathēthēn Tefesas hole biyin̄ kē. Tō kēy mayap neletes van hiy ige tin̄qoy telepnō nen, so kēy lep vasgēt kē. Heylō nasgōp Ḡod mak tō ige Takaya mēdēmtig. Mahē a Apolos mēdēn̄ van Akaya en, kē memyin̄ kēy a nēkēkēn. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Veg Apolos mavaplō m̄ōleg so qeleave Nayapyap Yon̄ nivasemlō so Tigsas en, ikē Kraēs. Tō kē mēvēyle liwo tiwag mi ige Juw lengon ige sil, ak tō so ige sil m̄ōleg so nēdēmdēm non ige Juw et hēywē te.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pol lelo vōnō Efesas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Mahē Apolos lapgetō Korint en, Pol madam namtehal a nivan woy napnō, tō nidēn̄ me Efesas. Tō kē metsas yatkel tin̄qoy van anen. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Tō Pol mēvēhge kēy van wo, “?Mahē a kimi mēdēmtig en, kimi mōyheg mi Nuvu Yon̄?” Ba kēy meplu goy kē van so, “!Tateh! !Kemem et ēglal hōn te veg Nuvu Yon̄, so aē si tateh!”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Tō Pol mēvēhge wo, “?Ba kimi mohyon̄ mi nahan vasugyon̄?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Ba kēy meplu so, “Kemem mohyon̄ mi navasugyon̄ mey a Jon magaleg tō.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Ba Pol wo, “Navasugyon̄ namun Jon en, ikē navasugyon̄ bēdēmleh den negengenyeg. Tō kē mavap van hiy ige sil so dēmtig net mey a tavan me atgiy, tō net nan a Tigsas en.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Kēy moyon̄teg van qelenen en, tō kēy del mavasugyon̄ lahan Welan Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Tō Pol matan̄ apwoy, tō Nuvu Yon̄ mēhēw kēy, tō kēy qētēg hohole mi nagatgat tegtegha, tō qētēg lēgēlgēg. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ige lēvēwti nan, kēy tege son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pol motog tiwag mi ige Juw bōwōl vētēl. Kē motoytoy maymay lēm̄ tatay nonoy so niwseg me nēdēmdēm nonoy bemyeyen talge. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ba yatkelgi et dēmtig te, tō mavan mēqēt maymay. Tō kēy hohole hethet Bemtehal mey Nēwē lengon ige sil. Bastō Pol mēvēl yakyak ige tin̄qoy tiwag mi kē, tō nivatvatne kēy vel qōn̄ luskul vitwag nahan Tiranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Nage gōh mavan tasga gaydēn̄ bēte vōyō, mak tō noyoy veg Welan maga walēg qēt Esia, hiy ige Juw wa ige mey a et Juw te.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige yantēntēn Iskeva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Tō Ḡod mak nam̄e vahah heylō namnen Pol. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Yatkel et mēvēhge Pol so tan̄qal nemen̄men̄ susu si so natvēl malmal. Tō kēy so m̄ōk apwon ige gom. Tō nogom, wa tō nuvu het, niqleqlen̄ den kēy.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Yatkel Juw vanvan walēg so vōyyakyak nuvu het den ige et. Tō kēy helhel etgal so vōyyak nuvu het lahan Welan Tigsas. Kēy mavap so, “!Atmi vayak lahan Tigsas, mey a Pol nitoytoy gatay!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Ige mugumgu gōh, kēy liviyō, ikēy yantēntēn nipris liwo vitwag non ige Juw, nahan Iskeva.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Nōqōn̄ vitwag nuvu het mavap van hiy kēy wo, “?Ino nēglal Tigsas, tō no nēglal veg Pol, ba kimi gōh nahan etgeh?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Tō net a nuvu het aē mi kē niyow hatig tō nivēhyuw tiwag mi kēy, mak tō kēy meplaplag den nēm̄ a neleleh tateh wa tō memtemtewot. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Noyoy nan maga walēg ige Juw wa ige Krik del a notogtog Efesas. Tō namtēgteg maqal kēy del tō kēy mēdēmap galsi nahan Welan Tigsas.<verse eid="ACT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Tō ige m̄adeg a nedēmtig mahatig hag lengon ige sil tō mavasemlō nubug nagay. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Tō ige dēmtig m̄adeg mey a kēy mehewhew tō am̄ag en, kēy mēvēl lōlō tiwag me nōbōk behewhew, tō hil qēt lemtan ige sil. Ba nōbōk geh gōh en, nēsēm nan neketket a neketket, nēsēm nimil son̄wul tēvēlēm (50,000).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nēsēm nan nahan ‘drachma.’ Nadrachma vitwag haytēyēh bēwēlwēl net bemgumgu bōqōn̄ vitwag.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Bastō nohohole non Ḡod niga tasga, tō nileh nēh non ige m̄adeg.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol nitēytēymat so nivatēp Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Lēkle haphap del gōh en, tō Pol nemyōs so nivatēp Jerusalem. Tō kē mepnog namtehal nonon so nivan walēg Masedonia, wa Akaya, tō me atgiy kē so nivan dēn̄ me Jerusalem. Tō kē vap so, “Mahē nok vatēp bah Jerusalem en, ba itōk so nok van n̄a Rom.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Tō Pol mēvētleg noyowyowveg vōyō, Timoti kōyō Erastus, hiy Masedonia. Tō kē mahgen mahag lap qōtō tusu Esia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēvēygēl vitwag n̄a Efesas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Lamahē nen, nēvēygēl liwo len̄ n̄a Efesas bōtōti dēmdēm Bemtehal Ēwē veg Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Net vitwag nahan Demetrius, kē nemgumgu lēsēlva, tō kē nimhemhe nēm̄ susu a qele nēm̄ yon̄ non ḡod lōqōvēn a Atemis. Ba kē nitēytēy nēsēm liwo aē, veg ige m̄adeg wēlwēl, kē tiwag mi yatkel et se a kēy nemgumgu lemgumgu anen.<verse eid="ACT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag Demetrius mētēy nuvug hiy ige del a kēy mugumgu se qeleanen. Tō kē mavap van hiy kēy wo, “Yēhē, kimi nēglal galsi so namgumgu nongēn gōh, gēn nētēytēy nēsēm liwo aē. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />!Ba atmi et van Pol wow tō gōh! !Nohohole nonon mal leh nēdēmdēm non ige m̄adeg Tefesas gōh tiwag mi Esia! Pol mavap so ḡod mey a net mitin̄ ēwē tō en, ikē et tiy ḡod te. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Veg bege gōh en, ige sil tiple hohole hethet bemgumgu namungēn. Tō ige sil tiple dēmdēm hethet veg Nēm̄ non Atemis, tō lepyak kē den natno liwo nonon. !Atemis gōh, ige del Tesia tiwag mi ige del lemyam mogmogo goy kē!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Mahē kēy moyon̄teg van qelenen en, ba kēy mololgagay, tō kēy ōlōl a nilwo so, “!Atemis nage Tefesas neketket a neketket yeh!”<verse eid="ACT 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Tō ige sil telepnō nen moyon̄teg navaliqōqō gōh, tō kēy mosotak aē tō kēy valaplag me. Tō kēy hatig hag tō tēy maymay yoge yaplōplōn Pol, Gayus ba Aristakas. Kōyō nage Tamasedonia ba vanvan tatag Pol. Tō kēy mētēy kōyō, tō van tēy lelo gemel liwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Tō Pol nemyōs so nihayveg hay so nihohole van hiy ige sil, ba ige tin̄qoy et ukēg te kē. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Tō ige lililwo lakapman Tesia se, a ige bulbulsal non Pol, kēy mēvētleg noyoy hiy kē so kē nitog vanvan hay letno yōstiwag.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Hay lelo gemel gōh en, ige sil mēdēmdēm vōvōyō aē. Yatkel et ōlōl boel bege vitwag, wa yatkelgi ōlōl boel bege tegha. Ba taqse sil et m̄ōleg te aē so nēdēmdēm bōyōstiwag nen qeleave. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Tō yatkel Juw mey a et Krēstēn te mēvētgiy van net vitwag nahan Aleksanda a lengo sil. Tō kē mak nēvēglal mi namnen van hiy kēy so togtogyon̄, veg kē nemyōs so niōl gontegoy ige Efesas den tiltil ige Juw. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ba ige sil et van qelekē Aleksanda en Nujuw, tō kēy qētēg ōlōl tawtaw lokse “!Atemis nage Tefesas neketket a neketket yeh!” Tō kēy mōlōl qelegōh bawa vōyō.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Bahnentō, net liwo vitwag telepnō liwo nen nihatig hag tō nihigoy kēy. Bastō nihole so, “Yēhē sil Tefesas, ige del nēglal galsi so Efesas gōh en, ikē napnō mey a nētēygoy nēm̄ yon̄ liwo a nonon ḡod liwo nongēn a Atemis en. Wa ige del nēglal a so gēn netgoy galsi nevet yon̄ nonon a misisgoy tō me den hag lōtōk en. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Tō tateh et nivap so et hēyhēywē te. Tō itōk so kimi del hag yoyon̄ ba dēmdēm galsi bah en, bastō kimi qoyo ak te hap mey nehet. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Veg kimi melep bat me yoge gōh, ba kōyō et vap te hapte mey aso nehet van hiy ḡod nongēn. Wa kōyō et tan̄tan̄hephep te lēm̄ yon̄ nongēn.<verse eid="ACT 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />“So Demetrius tiwag mi ige a mugumgu tiwag mi kē wo dēmdēm so net vitwag mak nehet hiy kēy en, itōk so kēy van lokot, tō hole gatay hiy ige mayanag bēvēvēg. Tō kēy del tēvēyvēyvavaleh vēh aē. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Bastō sowo nahap tegha se aē a kimi nemyōs so hole gatay se en, tō kimi tōlōl vēh nōyōstiwag liwo a litiy metehal nan.<verse eid="ACT 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />“Nok vap qele gōh, veg sowo ige lililwo Torom met naksok nilwo a net et dēmap te kēy aē en, tō kēy tiple vēvēg gēn aē. Ba gēn tit vulu vēhte kēy, veg gēn et ēglal te so gēn yōstiwag tō gōh bahap.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Net liwo gōh mohohole bah en, tō nivētleg m̄ōlm̄ōl lok ige sil.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pol mavan heylō lepnō Masedonia so m̄ōl hiy Judea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Vētmahē nēvēy vavaleh nen nibah en, tō Pol mōlōl ige tin̄qoy, tō mohole biyin̄ kēy. Tō kē mukēg veteg kēy tō nivan n̄a Masedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kē mavan walēg loprovēns nan, tō nihole biyin̄ ige dēmtig mi navavap m̄adeg, tō nivan dēn̄ Kris. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Tō kē motog lepnō nen bōwōl vētēl. Tō Pol nemyōs so gam hiy Siria, tō kē qoyo yow labaklap, ba ige Juw mēdēmdēm so wuh kē. Bastō Pol meleh nēdēmdēm nonon, tō nivan heylō lokse loprovēns Masedonia.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ige yatkelgi madam tatag kē, ige nan wa Sopata, ēntēn Pirus, kē nage telepnō Berea; Aristakas kōyō Sekundus, yoge Tetesalonika; Gayus nage Tēdēbē; tiwag mi Timoti; Tikikus bastō Trofimus, yoge gōh nage Tesia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Ige gōh mavan am̄ag den kemem, tō qoyo dēyē kemem n̄a Troas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Tō kemem gam yak den Filipae lēkle Gengen Liwo Begengen Nēbrēyt a Nis Tateh Alon En, tō lēkle qōn̄ tēvēlēm, kemem qoyo dēn̄ kēy n̄a Troas. Tō kemem motog van nen nōqōn̄ liviyō.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nōlōmgep vitwag misisisgoy lemte len̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Lasante vitwag, kemem megen yon̄ tiwag. Tō Pol mohole van hiy ige viwti nen. Kē mohole mēdēn̄ a lētnētnē qōn̄ veg kē nitēytēymat so nivan veteg kēy taval meyen. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kemem mōyōstiwag tiwag a lidin vitwag a lēm̄ alge, ba nuqul nam̄adeg hag lidin anen. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Nōlōmgep vitwag nahag a lemte len̄ vitwag, nahan Yutikus. Ba nēm̄ nan en nehey vahgey vagtēl. Vētmahē a Pol nihohole en, Yutikus nihag mitiy. Kē memtiy taq, tō nisisgoy lō den namte len̄ tō nisisgoy how lēvētan. Tō kēy vanvan so lep kal kē, ba kē mal mat.<verse eid="ACT 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Tō Pol niplag tēqēl hōw hiy nōlōmgep en, tō nivatiqaw hōw tō nioyveg goy kē. Tō Pol nivap so, “Nitog dēmdēm van aē veg kē nēh.” Tō nōlōmgep en, kē nēh. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Tō Pol nivan kal lokse hag lidin alge, tō kēy gengen tiwag. Tō kē mohohole tasga tiwag mi kēy mēdēn̄ mahē nimyen. Tō kē qoyo ukēg veteg kēy ēgēn. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Tō kēy hatig tō lep m̄ōl nōlōmgep nen lepnō nonon, a kēy del nemlaklak aē aso kē mēh lok en.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mukēg den Troas so nivan Miletus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Tō Pol mēvētleg kemem so gam van Asos labaklap vitwag. Ba Pol mahgen nemyōs so nivan wotanmas dēn̄ Asos, tō kē tadam nabaklap van anen. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Mahē a kē mēdēn̄ kemem me Asos en, tō kemem lep kē labaklap tō gam tasga Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Taval meyen, kemem gam yak den Mitilene tō van me mahē vitwag a sisqet lepnō Kios. Taval meyen, kemem hatig lokse tō gam heylō me Samos, tō taval meyen nan hag en, kemem qoyo dēn̄ Miletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ba Pol nemyōs yeh so van dēn̄ Jerusalem am̄ag den Nōqōn̄ Pentekos. Bastō, kē et buste so tog misin Esia. Tō kē mēdēmdēm so nivan veyvey den Efesas.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol nivap “tata” van hiy ige lililwo Tefesas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Bahnentō, mahē kemem vēykal me Miletus en, tō Pol nivētleg goy ige lililwo ne ēm̄ yon̄ a Efesas. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Tō mahē a kēy mavan dēn̄ kē me en, tō kē nihole van hiy kēy so, “Kimi mal ēglal galsi namtevuk mahē del a no motogtog tō tiwag mi kimi, meqtēg a no mēdēn̄ tō Esia am̄ag. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />No memgumguteg Welan mi nēdēm bēbēw, wa natn̄ēh mino molon̄ aē. Ige Juw mepnog nēdēmdēm veg no, tō mak no mololwon aē a nēkēkēn. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ba kimi nēglal so vaga a nok toytoy hiy kimi en, nok et lōn̄veg te nahap vitwag den kimi aso temyin̄ vēh kimi aē. Ba no mohoyhoylō kimi yow aslil, wa mavatne kimi hay lelo ēm̄ vivitwag nonmi. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />No mal vap vētday hiy ige Juw tiwag mi ige Tikrik so dēmleh, tō van me hiy Ḡod, ba dēmtig Welan nongēn Tigsas.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Ba yon̄teg, Nuvu Yon̄ mal hole maymay me hiy no so nok so van n̄a Jerusalem. Tō nok et ēglal te so nahap taqal no mahē nen. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ino nēglal ēwē so, vel vōnō a nok van aē en, Nuvu Yon̄ nihole vētday no. Kē nihole so no tavan qalgoy yatkel metewot wa nēm̄ yētyēt a nawak tēymat veg no. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Nōk et dēmdēm meh te van bēh mino mahgēk. Nage mey a nitiy wē yeh en, so nok so ak qēt namgumgu namuk. So nok ak qēt namgumgu mey a Welan Tigsas melep tō me hiy no so vasemlō Noyoy Ēwē veg besgōp non Ḡod.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Yēhē, togtōkē no nēglal so tateh et den kimi tet lokse vēh nangēk, kimi mey a no mavan walēg tō so vasemlō namyeyen talge van hiy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Tō qiyig gōh nok vap van hiy kimi so vitwag den kimi wo meqlen̄ en, tō no newenwen den, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />veg no mal vasem qēt van hiy kimi nahap a Ḡod nemyōs so kimi so ēglal.<verse eid="ACT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />“Ba etetgoy galsi kimi, tiwag mi ige sil a Ḡod mōm̄ōk kēy van lemnemi. Nuvu Yon̄ melep van namgumgu hiy kimi so etgoy nisipsip agōh. Kimi del so van me qele ige etetgoy sipsip, tō kimi so etgoy galsi nēm̄ yon̄ non Ḡod. Veg nēm̄ yon̄ gōh en Ḡod mēwēl yak mi namatmat nonon mahgen.<verse eid="ACT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />“No nēglal galsi so mahē a no mavanyak den kimi en, yatkel et tavan me qele notok tuytuy, tō tehelhel etgal so ak hethet ige sipsip agōh. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Tō yatkel et den kimi a lēvēwti agōh, kēy tahatig vēh so leh nēdēmdēm nonmi den nage mey a nēhēyhēywē. Tō kēy titig helem̄ag vēh ige tin̄qoy van lemtehal mey a et tenenen te. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />!Bastō, etgoy galsi! Ba dēmsas vaga so bēte vētēl nok et m̄ōkheg te bohohole maymay hiy kimi. Nok vatne kimi vel anqōn̄ wa vel meyen, wa nok ten̄ten̄ vaga hiy kimi. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Tō nōk m̄ōk veteg kimi van lemnen Ḡod tiwag mi noyoy besgōp nonon. Noyoy nan telep van hiy kimi navak, tiwag mi navawē mey a Ḡod togtēy tō a veg ige yon̄ del nonon en.<verse eid="ACT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />“Nok et vesves te hiy nēsēlva, nōḡōl, wa neleleh non net tegha. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kimi mahgemi nēglal so mi namnēk mahgēk nok mugumgu bemyōs mino tiwag mi namyōs non ige mey a mugumgu tiwag mi no. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />No mal vasem namtehal van hiy kimi so kimi so mugumgu a qele no memgumgu tō, wa biyin̄ ige magamgaysēn. No mavatne kimi so kimi so dēmlok navavap non Tigsas, a kē mavap so, ‘Nēk telep navawē liwo bohoghog, den mey a nēk tēygoy.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Mahē a Pol mavap bah navavap del gōh van hiy kēy en, tō kē nivatiqaw hōw, tō nitatay tiwag mi kēy. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37-38" />Ige del me ten̄ qēt veg Pol mohole so kēy tit et lokse vēhte nangon. Tō kēy del moytitin goy kē, tō pōpōn qēt kē. Tō kēy vantēy kē labaklap.<verse eid="ACT 20:37-38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pol mavan Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Mahē kemem mukēg veteg kēy en, tō kemem yem labaklap tō gam. Kemem mahatig en magam togolgol nowmat a lepnō Kos. Tō taval meyen kemem dēn̄ me lepnō Rodes. Kemem ukēg veteg Rodes tō van Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Mahē gōh, kemem metsas nabaklap vitwag so nivan Fonisia. Tō kemem yem lok van labaklap nen tō van. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Kemem magam sisqet van napnō Sayprus. Kemem etet napnō Sayprus a lok hiy nalo yoy, tō kemem gam tasga lok hiy loprovēns Siria. Kemem mēvēykal natkelgi van lepnō Taya en, veg ige labaklap en so heh yak yatkel haphap a lepnō nan en.<verse eid="ACT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Kemem metsas ige tin̄qoy yatkelgi van Taya en, tō kemem motog mi kēy nōqōn̄ liviyō. Tō kēy vap van hiy Pol heylō Nuvu Yon̄ so kē nitog vanvan qete Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Nōqōn̄ liviyō nibah en, tō kemem so van tasga lokse lemtehal nonmem. Tō kēy del mitiok kemem, kēy tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn wa ige nētnētm̄ey se. Kēy van yak den napnō liwo nan tō van dēn̄ ale. Tō kemem del vatiqaw hōw lēvēthiyle nen tō tatay. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Kemem matatay bah en, tō vap tata van hiy kēy tō yem lokse labaklap, tō ige dēmtig nen m̄ōl.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Kemem lep lokse namtehal nonmem den Taya tō gam dēn̄ me Potolemays. Kemem melep bah nohohole tamtam van hiy ige dēmtig van nen en, tō motog mi kēy nōqōn̄ vitwag. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Taval meyen kemem mahatig tō gam dēn̄ Sisaria. Tō Filip mokokm̄egoy kemem lēm̄ nonon. Filip en, kē net bavavasemlō noyoy ēwē, wa am̄ag, ikē vitwag den ige buliviyō bohoghog gengen n̄a Jerusalem.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Acts 6:5, 8:5-8</char></note> Tō kemem motogtog tiwag mi kē. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ige m̄alm̄al nonon bulvet a et leg geh qete, kēy ige belgēlgēg.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Kemem motog bah nōqōn̄ m̄adeg en, tō net vitwag nivan tēqēl me den Judea. Kē net belgēlgēg, nahan Agabus. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Kē mavan me hiy kemem tō nilepyak nogoytig nonon Pol. Tō kē mēlēg namnen tiwag mi nayn̄on mahgen aē ba mavap so, “Nuvu Yon̄ mavap so, ‘Ige lililwo Tujuw van Jerusalem tēyēt namne et benon goytig gōh qeleanen, tō kēy tōm̄ōk kē van lemnen ige mey a et Juw te.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Kemem moyon̄teg van noyoy gōh en, tō kemem tiwag mi ige sil Tisisaria me helhel etgal so gatgoy so Pol nitog vanvan Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ba amtan Pol wo, “?Bahap tō kimi ten̄ten̄ me so ak lolwon no qelegōh? No nētēymat so kēy so lēg no Jerusalem. !Wa no nētēymat so matwēl nahan Welan Tigsas!”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Veg kē et leh te nēdēmdēm nonon, tō kemem mukēg veteg qelenen, ba mavap so, “Itōk so namyōs non Welan niaktig.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Kemem motog natkelgi se bah en, tō tēytēymat so van hag Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Yatkel tin̄qoy Tisisaria madam kemem. Tō kēy mavantēy kemem a lēm̄ non Nason. Nason gōh nage Tasayprus, ikē nitin̄qoy non Tigsas a nēte. Tō kemem memtiy lēm̄ nonon.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mavatēp Jemes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Mahē kemem dēn̄ me Jerusalem en, tō ige yathithik wa yatētētek melep vasgēt kemem mi namlaklak. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Taval meyen Pol mavan vatēp Jemes, wa tō kemem tiwag mi ige qēt ēm̄ yon̄ del Tejerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Tō Pol mohole malaklak van hiy kēy, tō nikaka m̄ōleg van hiy kēy nahap a Ḡod mak tō van hiy ige mey a et Juw te heylō namgumgu namun.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Kēy moyon̄teg van qelenen, tō kēy ōliwo Ḡod aē. Tō kēy vap van hiy Pol so, “Ithimem, nēk nēglal so ige Juw tey vag vēh a mal dēmtig Tigsas, tō kēy del natatag galsi Nele non Mosis. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Tō kēy moyon̄teg so nēk mavap van hiy ige Juw a mey a tog tiwag tō mi ige mey a et Juw te en so ukēg veteg Nele non Mosis. Kēy moyon̄teg so nēk mavap van hiy kēy so nitog so tep vēglal ige nētnētm̄ey nonoy, bastō so nitog tatag van nēvēnangēn. Tō noyoy galgal gōh tiple ak so ige sil dēmdēm hethet veg nēk.<verse eid="ACT 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />“?Tō gēn tak qeleave? Veg noyoy taga vel mahē so nēk mal dēn̄ me. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ba itōk so nēk ak qelegēn: Net vēvet nongēn mal vatvat van hiy Ḡod bagaygay mamah. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Mahē nagaygay mamah so nibah, itōk so nēk tig tiwag mi kēy mahē a kēy ak wenwen tō sisiy qas nēlēy. Tō nēk temyin̄ kēy mi nēsēm bahaphap nan. Sowle, gēn ak qelegōh en, tō ige sil tet vēglal so noyoy veg nēk et hēywē te, ba nēk nadam galsi Nele non Mosis.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />“Ba veg ige dēmtig mey a et Juw te en, kemem mayap tō neletes van hiy kēy so nitog gengen nēphog mey a kēy molol tō van hiy ḡod galgal, nitog gengen naday, nitog gengen nēphog mey a naday aē, wa nitog legleg solosloteg.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Bastō taval meyen Pol melep ige bulvet gōh, tō kē niak wenwen kē tiwag mi kēy. Tō Pol nihayveg hay Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non ige Juw so nim̄ōk nōqōn̄ tenenen mey a kēy telep van namlay vivitwag so olol aē, mahē a kēy ak wenwen bah.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige Juw mētēy Pol lelo Tiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Sisqet nōqōn̄ liviyō nibah, yatkel Juw Tesia metsas Pol Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol. Tō kēy ak tēqtēqyeg ige sil, tō tēy maymay Pol. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Tō kēy ōlōl so, “!Yēhē Tisrael, atmi van me biyin̄ kemem! Net gōh, kē a mitig tavale tō tiwag mi ige Tisrael, bastō Nele non Mosis wa Nēm̄ Bolol nongēn. Kē mavanvan tō vel mahē tō nivatvatne ige sil bahaphap mey a et tatag te Nele. !Tō entōgōh, kē mal lep batbat me ige Tikrik lelo Ēm̄ Bolol nongēn tō mak solosloteg vētmahē yon̄ agōh!” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Kēy mavap qelegōh veg am̄ag kēy metsas tō Trofimus tiwag mi Pol a Jerusalem. Trofimus nage Tefesas. Tō kēy mēdēmdēm so Pol melep bat tō kē van lelo Ēm̄ Bolol, ba et hēywē te.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ige sil del a Jerusalem en moyon̄ ninhet qēt aē, tō kēy valaplag hay lelo Ēm̄ Bolol tō tēy maymay Pol tō yap lō kē den Nēm̄ Bolol. Tō kēy tabegoy namte Ēm̄ Bolol. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ige nen so wuh mat Pol wah. Tō net liwo goy ige bepgapgal non ige Torom yon̄teg so nēvēygēl liwo wow tō a lepnō. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Tō kē nihatig tō nilep ige yowyowveg tiwag mi ige bepgapgal nonon, tō kēy gityak tēqēl how hiy ige sil. Ba mahē a ige sil metsas van net liwo tiwag mi ige bepgapgal en, tō kēy ukēg kē den vēvēhyuw mi kē.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Tō net liwo nan mētēy Pol, tō nivap hiy ige bepgapgal so lēg maymay kē mi nējēn vōyō. Tō net liwo mēvēhge ige sil so kē nahan et wa kē mak nahap mey nehet. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Tō nēvēwti a taq tō en, kēy ōlōl bege tegtegha. Veg bohohole solosloteg tiwag mi naln̄e ōlōl tawtaw nen en, net liwo et lep hōn te nēdēmdēm tenenen. Bastō kē nivap van hiy ige bepgapgal so van tēy Pol n̄a lēm̄ nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Kēy van dēn̄ me natamlaglag a lemte ēm̄ en, ba ige sil nemyōs lepgetō so vēhyuw mi Pol. Ba ige bepgapgal tigoy Pol, tō hah ketket kē so lep bat kē lelo ēm̄. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Veg ige sil a damdam tō kēy en, kēy ōlōl tawtaw so, “!Wuh mat kē!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Tō sisqet so kēy so lep bat Pol hay lēm̄ nonoy wah, kē nihole van hiy net liwo en wo, “?No tavap te hap vēh van hiy nēk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Ba net liwo nivap van hiy kē wo, “?Ey, nēk hohole mi nagatgat Tikrik? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nok dēm so nēk nage Titsip, so inēk a meqtēg tō natvale tiwag mi kapman, tō melepyak ige teyvag vet buwuwuh et tō mitig helem̄ag kēy lepnō vadalm̄eg en.”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Tō Pol meplu goy so, “Ō-ō-ō, ino Nujuw, nage Tarsus a lepnō Silisia. Ino nage telepnō mey a nēwē anen. ?Itōk so nok hole tusu van hiy ige sil?”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Tō net liwo mukēg Pol so nihole. Pol nitig kal hag natamlaglag en, tō kē niak nēvēglal mi namnen so ige sil so togtog yon̄. Mahē ige sil mataq yoyon̄ en, tō Pol niqtēg hohole van hiy kēy mi nagatgat Tujuw.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="s">Pol mohole van hiy ige sil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Pol vap van hiy ige sil so, “Ige imam, tiwag mi ige yathithik. !Atmi yon̄teg me nam̄e dēmdēm mino!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Vētmahē a ige Juw moyon̄teg van a kē nihohole mi nagatgat nonoy e tō kēy taq yoyon̄ galsi ēgēn.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Tō Pol wo, “Ino nage Tisrael. No mowot Tarsus n̄a Silisia, ba ino milwo me Jerusalem kē. Navatgo mino Gamaliel, kē mavatne galsi no mi nele non ige bōbō gēpgēp nongēn. Tō no moboelgoy Ḡod, qele kimi del a qiyig agōh. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />No manahiy tō ige mey a madamdam namtehal non Tigsas so wuh mat kēy. Yatkel mahē, nok tēy ige lōqōvēn tiwag mi ige tam̄an tō vantēy kēy lēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Nipris Liwo a nam̄agoy ige pris en, kē tiwag mi ige viwti et lililwo nongēn tavap vēh so hēyhēywē. Veg kēy melep neletes me hiy no so nok so van tēy hiy ige Tadamaskus. Tō nok so tēy ige a nēdēmtig Tigsas, tō so tēy lokse kēy me Jerusalem so vēvēg kēy.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Bahnentō, nok vanvan sisqet me Damaskus, tege lēlwomyen en, tō nok m̄alyow bihin̄yeg a mavalwey me hag lōtōk en, tō memyeyen walēg no. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Tō no misisgoy hōw lēvētan en, tō nok yon̄teg naln̄e et nihole wo, ‘?Sol, Sol, bahap tō nēk ak memeh no qelegōh?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Ba nok vēhge lok van wo, ‘Inēk ihē, Welan?’ Tō kē wo, ‘Ino Tigsas Tanasaret, a nēk ak memeh tō no agōh.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ige a tiwag mi no netsas namyeyen, ba kēy et yon̄teg m̄ōleg te nohohole nan. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Tō no wo, ‘?No tak qeleave, Welan?’ Tō Welan meplu goy no wo, ‘Hatig ba van n̄a Damaskus. Tō net vitwag qoyo vasem van nahap a no mētēymat tō veg nēk so galeg.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Navalwey ne hin̄yeg mak matbē namtek, tō kēy mētēy ēwē namnēk tō van tēy no van Damaskus.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Tō net vitwag mavan me hiy no. Ikē Ananias, ikē net a nadamdam galsi Nele, wa ige Juw del lamahē nen, kēy nēdēmap kē. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ananias mitig sisqet no me, tō mavap so, ‘Sol, ithik, etet lokse.’ Tō vag tiwag ēwē nen nok etet lokse tō etsas kē. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Tō Ananias vap so, ‘Ḡod non ige imam nongēn mal etyak tō nēk, so nēk tet Tigsas, a ikē Net Tenenen, wa so yon̄teg nohohole den naln̄an mahgen, wa so ēglal nahaphap a kē nemyōs. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Veg nēk tavan me net nonon bavavasemlō van hiy ige del nahap a nēk metsas wa nēk moyon̄teg tō. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />!Hatig! ?Nēk dēyē bahap? Van vasugyon̄ tō oh wenwen den negengenyeg nōnōm lahan Welan.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Mahē nok m̄ōl lokse Jerusalem en, qōn̄ vitwag nok tatay Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol, tō no met noqoyqoy. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />No metsas Welan, tō kē mavap me hiy no so, ‘!Velēgē! Vanyak ēgē den Jerusalem, veg ige gōh tit yon̄teg vēhte nēk mahē nēk vasemlō no van hiy kēy.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Tō no wo, ‘Welan, kēy nēglal so no mavan walēg tō nēm̄ tatay m̄adeg tō mōm̄ōk ige dēmtig lēm̄ yētyēt wa tō melm̄elm̄eh kēy. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Wa mahē kēy miyim mat Steven en, veg kē mavasemlō nēk, no met naday molon̄ den kē, tō nok dēm so itōk. Tō no mētēygoy tō nōkōt nonon ige a miyim mat kē en.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Tō Welan vap me hiy no wo, ‘Van, veg no tēvētleg nēk a yeh tewiwi hiy ige a et Juw te.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Ige sil moyon̄teg galsi nohohole non Pol. Ba mahē a Pol mohole gatay ige mey et Juw te en, kēy ōlōl so “!Wuh kē! !Net qelegōh et sey te so nitog ēh me lemyam agōh!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Kēy gaygayka mi nololgagay, tō hayhay suwsuwyeg nōkōt nonoy. Tō wōw nōwōwō tō suwuswuy kal hag lemyayawoy. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Tō net liwo non ige bepgapgal nivantēy Pol a lēm̄ non ige bepgapgal. Tō kē nivap van hiy ige bepgapgal so lem̄eh Pol, tō so vēhge maymay kē bahap tō ige sil magayka van hiy kē qelenen.<verse eid="ACT 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ige bepgapgal nen lēg maymay galsi Pol tō so lem̄eh kē wah, tō kē nivap van hiy noyowyowveg non net liwo, so “Nēk tit lem̄eh vēhte net tēgvōnō Torom mey a et van heylō qete nēvēvēg.” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Mahē a noyowyowveg moyon̄teg van a Pol mohole qelenen e tō, kē niplag van hiy net liwo nonon wo, “?Nēk nēglal nage a nēk ak tō gōh? !Net gōhkē, ikē net tēgvōnō Torom!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Net liwo nan nivēhge Pol wo, “Wo hēywē so nēk nitiy et tēgvōnō Torom?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Tō Pol wo, “O-oh.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Tō net liwo nan meplu wo, “No mēwēl nēsēm liwo so van me net tēgvōnō Torom.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Ba Pol vap so, “Ba ino mowot tēgvōnō Torom.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Vag tiwag ēwē ige a mētēytēymat tō so vēvēhiy kē en, kēy meslen̄ hiy mahē. Tō net liwo non ige bepgapgal nen memtēgteg veg kē mal lēg maymay nitiy et tēgvōnō Torom.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mohole van hiy ige lililwo non ige Juw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Taval meyen nan hag nen, net liwo non ige bepgapgal nemyōs so nēglal galsi so bahap tō ige Juw vēyvēy vavaleh tiwag mi Pol. Tō kē mēvētleg goy ige Pris Lililwo tiwag mi ige vēwti mayanag ne Sanhedrin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sanhedrin en, kē qeleso Malvatumaori non ige Juw.</char></note> non ige Juw so kēy so yōstiwag. Tō kē nituwyak nējēn den Pol. Tō nilep lō kē me, tō nivētgiy kē van lengon ige mayanag.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pol metyak van hiy ige lililwo Tujuw ne Sanhedrin, ba nihole van hiy kēy wo, “Yēhē yathithik, lēh mino del, no motogtog galgalsi lengon Ḡod gaydēn̄ me qiyig agōh.”<verse eid="ACT 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Tō Nipris Liwo Ananias nivap van hiy ige tig sisqet tō Pol en so kēy so woh nan̄yan. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Tō Pol vap van hiy kē so, “!Ḡod towoh se nēk! !Inēk qele nōtōytōy ne ēm̄ aslil a nelm̄eh qagqag galsi, ba alon en nelem! Nēk hag tō nen so vēvēg no mi Nele non Mosis, ba nēk et tatag te Nele nan. Veg nēk mōsōyteg kēy so woh no, ba Nele nagatgoy.”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Tō ige a tig sisqet tō Pol en hole van hiy kē wo, “!Et wē te so nēk hole qelenen van hiy Nipris Liwo non Ḡod!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ba Pol meplu wo, “Nemgaysēn, ithik, no et ēglal te aso ikē Nipris Liwo en, veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so, ‘Nitog vavap hethet hiy net mey a nilwo goy ige sil.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Exodus 22:28</char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Ba Pol nēglal so yatkel et den kēy ige Sadusi, wa yatkelgi ige Farisi, tō nēvēwti vōyō nen kēy vēy vavaleh tasga. Bastō kē nōlōl van hiy kēy del so, “Yēhē yathithik, ino Nafarisi, wa yatmekmek se, kēy Nafarisi, tō kēy vēvēg no veg no nēdēmtig so Ḡod tōlōl lok ige nonon den namatmat.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nohohole nonon mak tō so ige Farisi wa ige Sadusi qētēg vēyvēyle liwo aē, tō kēy vēlwoy aē nēvēwti vōyō. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Veg ige Sadusi nēdēmtig so mahē net so nimat en, kē tit hatig lokse vēhte. Tō kēy dēmtig so tateh in̄sel, wa tateh vu geh lemyam. Ba ige Farisi en, nēdēmtig nonoy netegha. Kēy nēdēmtig so nahaphap del gōh aē.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Tō nēvēygēl liwo mahatig van a lēvētne yōstiwag en. Bahnentō, yatkel vatvatgo ne Le den ige Farisi hatig hag nen tō hole mi nololgagay so, “!Kemem et etsas te hap mey nehet te aso net gōh mak tō! Wun nin̄sel siso nuvu mohole van hiy kē.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Tō kēy mēvēy vavaleh van nen e tō sisqet so kēy vēy titit. Tō net liwo non ige bepgapgal nen memtēgteg goy so kēy tiple hay mununuy Pol. Tō kē nivētleg ige vagapgal so van tēqēl yow, ba lepyak Pol, tō van tēy lokse kē n̄a lēm̄ non ige vagapgal.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Anqōn̄ nan en, Welan nivan me hiy Pol tō nivap so, “!Nitog mētēgteg! Nēk so vasemlō se no Rom, qele a nēk mal vasemlō tō no Jerusalem en.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Taval meyen nan hag nen, Ige Juw hay tiwag van tō vonvon so wuh mat Pol. Kēy mavatvat so kēy tit gen te hap vēhte tō tit in te hap vēhte gaydēn̄ a kēy wuh mat Pol. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ige a mōm̄ōk nēdēmdēm gōh en, kēy tege son̄wul vet. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Tō kēy van tō vasem van nēdēmdēm nonoy hiy ige pris lililwo tiwag mi ige lililwo Tujuw so, “Kemem mavatvat mahgemem so kemem tit gengen vēhte siso in te hap vēhte gaydēn̄ a kemem wuh Pol. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Tō kemem nemyōs so kimi so ak qelegēn, atmi vētleg noyoy hay hiy net liwo non ige bepgapgal so lep tēqēl me Pol lōyōstiwag, tō so kimi vēhge te vēvēhiy van hiy kē. Tō kemem tataq dēyē kē a metehal so wuh mat kē.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ba moyōn Pol moyon̄teg gēdi nohohole non ige nen, tō kē nivan tō nivasem van hiy Pol a lēm̄ non ige bepgapgal. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Tō, Pol niōlōl noyowyowveg non net liwo, tō nivap van hiy kē so, “Vantēy nōlōmgep nōk hiy net liwo, veg noyoy namun aē mi kē.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Tō noyowyowveg nan nilep nōlōmgep nen hay hiy net liwo tō nivap so, “Pol a lēm̄ yētyēt vap so nok so vantēy me nōlōmgep gōh hiy nēk, veg noyoy namu aē mi kē.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Tō net liwo nan nitēy namne lōmgep nan, tō kōyō van mahē a nabat, tō kē nivēhge kē van wo, “?Nēk so vap nahap me hiy no?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Tō nōlōmgep wo, “Ige Juw mal vonm̄ēt so vētleg me hiy nēk so lep tēqēl Pol yow lōyōstiwag talōw. Ba kēy so ak ēwē so kēy so vēhge te vēvēhiy van hiy kē. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ba nitog dēmdēmtig kēy van, veg yatkel et den kēy so taq dēyē kē a lēvēt metehal so wuh kē. Kēy nehep den son̄wul vet, wa kēy mal vatvat mahgey so kēy tit gengen vēhte siso tit in te hap vēhte gaydēn̄ a kēy wuh kē. Tō kēy dēyēnyē ēwē so nēk so wēhgoy.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Net liwo nen nivētleg yak nōlōmgep nen, ba nivap van hiy kē so, “Nitog vavaplō se so nēk mal vasemlō me noyoy gōh hiy no.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kēy vētleg yak Pol n̄a Sisaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Tō net liwo nen niōlōl me ige yowyowveg nonon tō nivap van hiy kēy so, “No nemyōs yatkel et so van Sisaria, etyak tēymat ige bepgapgal m̄eldēl vag yō. Bastō ige beplaplag lohos son̄wul liviyō, tiwag mi ige mey nētēy nesey m̄eldēl vag yō. Atmi tēytēymat so van qiyig anqōn̄ a lelo levevet. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Ba lep van nohos vitwag hiy Pol so niplag qiyig aē. Tō etgoy galsi kē lemtehal gaydēn̄ kimi lep kē van lemnen Mayanag Liwo Felix.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Tō net liwo mayap neletes vitwag van hiy Felix, so,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Den Kladius Lisias.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Hiy Mayanag Liwo Felix.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Lemtap nēwē.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 23:26">Nok so vasem ēwē van hiy nēk veg net agōh. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Net gōh, ige Juw mētēy kē, tō kēy helhel etgal so wuh kē. Ba veg no nēglal aē so ikē nētēgvōnō Torom en, tō no tiwag mi ige bepgapgal mino mavaēh kē. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ba no nemyōs so ēglal aē so kēy etet hethet tō kē gōh bahap. Tō no melep bat kē me lōyōstiwag liwo nonoy so vēhge kēy so nēdēmdēm nonoy qeleave. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Tō no metsas van so kēy mitil ēwē kē bele nonoy, ba tateh hap mey nehet a kē magaleg, tō kēy so wuh kē aē, siso m̄ōk kē lēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Mahē no moyon̄teg so ige Juw movonm̄ēt nēdēmdēm so wuh kē en, ba nok vētleg nowmat kē me hiy nēk. Tō no mavap tēymat van hiy ige Juw nan so kēy so vasem van hiy nēk nahap mey nehet a kē mak tō.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Tō ige bepgapgal nen mak tatag qēt nahap a net liwo nonoy mavayēg tō van hiy kēy. Tō kēy lep Pol tō vantēy gaylat ēwē kē dēn̄ lepnō Antipatris anqōn̄ anen. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Tō taval meyen nan hag, kēy vēlwoy kēy, tō ige beplaplag lohos vantēy tēqēl Pol Sisaria. Tō ige bepgapgal yatkelgi m̄ōl kal lok lēm̄ nonoy Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Kēy dēn̄ Sisaria en, tō kēy lep neletes van hiy Mayanag Liwo Felix, tō vayēg veteg van Pol hiy kē.<verse eid="ACT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mayanag Liwo meptaptah bah neletes en, tō kē mēvēhge Pol so kē nagetive, tō Pol meplu so kē nage Tisilisia. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Bastō, Mayanag Liwo wo, “Itōk. Mahē ige a mitil tō nēk van dēn̄ me en, tō nok qoyo vēvēg nēdēmdēm nan.” Tō Mayanag Liwo mavayēg ige bepgapgal nonon so tēy Pol ba etgoy kē lēm̄ non kapman mey a Herod mowos tō.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ige Juw mavasemlō so bahap tō kēy et buste Pol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Lēkle qōn̄ tēvēlēm, Nipris Liwo Ananias mavan Sisaria, kē tiwag mi ige lililwo non ige Juw wa net bele vitwag, nahan Tertulus. Ige gōh mavan me so vasemlō nehet del non Pol van hiy Mayanag Liwo Felix. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Tō kēy ōlōl bat me Pol lōyōstiwag, tō Tertulus niqtēg hohole lō nehet non Pol, tō nivap so, “Felix. !Inēk nam̄e et liwo! Natawye metehal ne mugumgu nōnōm netnenen, mak tō ige sil del motog letm̄at tōtēn nēk. Wa natawye haphap mey a et tenenen te en, nēk mak tenenen qēt lokse heylō nēmnay nōnōm. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tō vētmahē del kemem yon̄teg nēwē aē, wa tō kemem vēwē nēk aē. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ba nok et buste so hohole hoyo se van aē. No nemyōs so nēk ukēg kemem so hohole tusu ēwē bege agōh. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Kemem metsas so net gōh, ikē net bakak qōqōve haphap. Kē mak solosloteg qēt nēdēmdēm non ige Juw del a lelo mayam. Tō ikē net liwo ne vēwti non Net Tanasaret. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Bastō nage vitwag se, kē mehelhel etgal tō so niak solosloteg Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol. Tō kemem tēy kē aē. [Tō kemem nemyōs so vēvēg kē mi nitiy le nonmem, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />ba net liwo Lisias mētēy tōqtōqyeg kē den kemem, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />tō mavayēg kemem so van me hiy nēk.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yatkel yapyap tam̄ag en mavaplō neves 6b-8a. Ba nayapyap tam̄ag m̄adeg en, neves nan tataeh alon en.</char></note> Ba nēk mahge qoyo vēvēg kē, tō nēk qoyo etsas mahge van nahaphap del a kē mak geh tō.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Wa ige lililwo Tujuw mavap se so natawye hohole nen hēywē.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Bahnentō, Mayanag Liwo Felix niak nēvēglal van hiy Pol so kē so nihole. Tō Pol wo, “Mayanag Liwo Felix, veg no nēglal so nēk metgoy tō ige Juw nēte m̄adeg, tō no nemlaklak so vulu goy nohohole nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Nēk soksok etgal tow, so nēk tetsas vēh veg no mavan tō Jerusalem so mogmogo goy Ḡod natkelgi ēwē, et hep te den nōqōn̄ son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Tō kēy et etsas te no a nok vēyvēyle tiwag mi net, si akak tōqtōqyeg ige sil lelo Ēm̄ Bolol, si lēm̄ tatay tegtegha, siso lelo vōnō. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Tō nemeh mi kēy so vasemlō nahap a kēy mitil tō no aē veg nohohole nan et hēyhēywē te.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />“Ēwē nohohole vitwag a nēhēyhēywē en, nok damdam namtehal nonon Tigsas tō mogmogo goy Ḡod non ige yatqōtqōnmem. Kēy vap so namtehal nan et tiy metehal te. Ba ino en, no nēdēmtig qēt natawye Le non Mosis, tiwag mi nayapyap del namun ige lēgēlgēg. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Tō nēdēmtig mino hiy Ḡod nahaytēyēh a qele nonoy en a nēdēmtig nan aso ige mey nēwē, tiwag mi ige mey nehet, kēy del tahatig qēt lokse den namte. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Bastō nok akak etgal so ak nage mey a netnenen hiy Ḡod, wa hiy ige sil.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“No mal van yak tō den Jerusalem nēte suvay m̄adeg. Tō no mavan lokse me so leveteg nolol namuk, wa tō so m̄ōk veteg nolol bemyimyin̄ van hiy ige m̄asay Tejerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mahē kēy metsas no lelo Tiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod en, no mal wenwen bah lengon Ḡod, tō nok et qul tiwag te mi ige sil, wa tō nok et ak solosloteg tē nēdēmdēm nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ba yatkel Juw Tesia en, kēy so van me so tig temuy van lengē. Tō sowo no mak hēywē nage mey nehet, tō ige nen a tohole tavale vēh mino aē. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Si vēhge ige lililwo gōh, itōk so kēy mahgey vasemlō so kēy metsas te hap mey nehet mi no mahē a no mitig lōyōstiwag nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ba no mavap ēwē tō nage vitwag, a no nitig lengoy, so ‘!Kēy vēvēg no veg no nēdēmtig so Ḡod tōlōl lok ige nonon den namatmat!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ba Mayanag Felix en, kē nēglal galsi namtehal veg Tigsas. Tō kē mihigoy qōtō nuvug, ba vap so, “Mahē so net liwo Lisias so nivan me en, tō nok qoyo vonm̄ēt nēdēmdēm veg kimi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Tō Felix mōlvayēg ige lililwo non ige bepgapgal so tēy goy qōtō Pol. Ba kē mavap van hiy kēy so kēy su ukēg Pol nitatal m̄ōleg, tō ukēg ige nonon van me vatēp kē tō lep te hap van aso kē nemyōs.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mohohole tiwag mi Felix kōyō ēgnōn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Lēkle qōn̄ vēvēh qiyig en, Felix kōyō ēgnōn nahan Drusila, nalqōvēn Tujuw, kōyō mavan me. Tō kōyō vētleg goy Pol so yon̄teg temōyō nakaka a Pol nikaka gatay nēdēmtig veg Kraēs Tigsas. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Tō Pol nihohole gatay namtehal botogtog tenenen, tō bitigtigoy et den nahaphap mey nehet, wa bēvēvēg non Ḡod mey a tavan me. Ba Felix moyon̄teg nakaka en, tō kē memtēgteg aē, tō nivap van hiy Pol so, “Itōk, nēk van qōtō. Nok qoyo vētleg goy nēk lōqōn̄ tegha.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Lamahē nen, nēdēmdēm non Felix so Pol telep bat te sēm van hiy kē so ukēg taywah kē den lēm̄ yētyēt. Tō a Felix nivētvētleg goy Pol vaga qelenen, tō nikaka tiwag mi kē.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Bahnentō lēkle ēte vōyō en, Felix nibah den natno liwo, tō Posius Festus nileh kē. Ba Felix mak so Pol nihag lap lēm̄ yētyēt, veg kē nemyōs so niak malaklak ige lililwo Tujuw.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pol mitig lengon Mayanag Festus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Vētmahē Festus nidēn̄ me loprovēns, tō lēkle qōn̄ vētēl en, kē nihatig den Sisaria tō nivan Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Tō ige pris lililwo tiwag mi ige lililwo Tujuw hohole visipteg Pol van hiy Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Tō kēy mēvēhge van namyōs nonoy vitwag so Festus nivētleg lok Pol me Jerusalem. (Veg kēy mal vonm̄ēt nowmat nēdēmdēm vitwag so wuh kē a lemtehal.)<verse eid="ACT 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ba Festus meplu kēy van so, “!Tateh! Pol totog lap Sisaria, tō sisqet nok m̄ōl lokse Sisaria. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Bastō itōk so yatkel et lililwo nonmi dam no. So kē wo mak nahap mey nehet, tō kēy tēvēy vavaleh tiwag mi kē aē.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Tō Festus motog se Jerusalem nōqōn̄ tege levetēl, siso son̄wul. Tō kē qoyo m̄ōl lokse Sisaria tiwag mi ige Juw. Tō taval meyen en, Festus nivap van hiy ige bepgapgal so lep lō Pol me hiy kē. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Tō Festus nihaghiy hōw letno haghag non ige vēvēg, tō Pol nivan me. Tō ige Juw a mavan tō me den Jerusalem mitig dēln̄et kē. Tō kēy qētēg vēvēg kē mi nēdēmdēm m̄adeg mey a nitiy het yeh. Ba nohohole nonoy et tig te aē so vasemlō so nēdēmdēm nan hēyhēywē.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Tō Pol niplu so nitigoy lok kē mahgen, so “Nok et tig het te Nele non ige Juw, siso Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol, siso Mayanag Sisa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ba Festus nemyōs so niak malaklak ige Juw, tō kē mavap van hiy Pol wo, “?Nēk nemyōs so van Jerusalem tō nok so vēvēg nēk tatag nēdēmdēm geh gōh?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ba Pol meplu lok van so, “Nok tig vatag tō gōh letno vēvēg non Sisa, a nitiy mahē a nēk so vēvēg no aē. !Nēk nēglal galsi so nok et ak te hap mey nehet te van hiy ige Juw! <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Sowo no mak tō nage mey nehet a haytēyēh so wuh no aē en, itōk. No tit vēhge vēhte nēk so tog wuwuh no. Ba sowo natawye vēvēg gōh et hēyhēywē tē, tō tateh et telep no van hiy ige agōh. !Ba no nemyōs so Mayanag Sisa mahgen nivēvēg no aē!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Tō Festus mohohole susu tiwag mi ige vēwti leln̄an, so yon̄teg nēdēmdēm nonoy. Bastō kē nivap van hiy Pol so, “Nēk mal vēhge mahge so Sisa so nivēvēg nēk, tō entō nōk en, nēk van hiy Sisa!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mitig lengon Nēqēt Mayanag Akripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Lēkle qōn̄ vēvēh qiyig, Nēqēt Mayanag Akripa kōyō tētan vitwag nahan Bernis mavan me Sisaria so vatēp Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Kōyō motog nusuvay misin, tō Festus nivasem van hiy mayanag nēdēmdēm veg Pol. Festus mavap so, “Net vitwag togtō lēm̄ yētyēt gōh, Felix mōm̄ōk veteg tō kē. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Mahē no mavan Jerusalem en, ige pris lililwo tiwag mi ige lililwo goy ige Juw mohole me natkel dēmdēm veg kē. Kēy nemyōs so nok so vēvēg mat kē. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ba no meplu goy kēy so nēvēwti vitwag wo mitig het net vitwag en, et vēnan ige Torom te so lep nowmat kē van hiy ige tavale nonon. Ba kēy del tohohole nogoy, tō so net nan teplu vēh nēdēmdēm nonoy.<verse eid="ACT 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />“Bastō kēy mavan tiwag me gōh, ba nok et dēyē te, tō taval meyen nan hag en, nok haghiy van letno haghag bēvēvēg, tō vap van hiy ige bepgapgal so lep bat me Pol. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Mahē kēy mitig kal hag so vap so kē mak nahap mey nehet en, kēy et hole te hap te qele nok dēm van so kēy so hole. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ba kēy hole gatay tō nēdēmdēm batatay nonoy en, veg net vitwag a nahan Tigsas mey a mal mat, ba Pol vap so kē nēh lapgetō.<verse eid="ACT 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />“Ba nok et ēglal galsi te aē bēdēmdēm agōh, so tēvēvēg nēdēmdēm nan qeleave. Mak tō a no mēvēhge Pol wo, ‘?Nēk nemyōs so van Jerusalem, tō so vēvēg nēk van nen?’ <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ba kē mēvēhge so kē nitog lap me lēm̄ yētyēt Sisaria, veg kē nemyōs so Mayanag Sisa tēvēvēg kē. Tō no mavap van hiy ige mino so etgoy galsi Pol gaydēn̄ aso no metsas namtehal mey nēwē en, tō qoyo vētleg kē hiy Sisa n̄a Rom.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Tō Akripa nivap van hiy Festus so, “Ah, ba no nemyōs so yon̄teg temuk nohohole non net anen!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Tō Festus wo, “Talōw en, nēk qoyo yon̄teg temu kē.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Bastō taval meyen en, Festus niōlōl nōyōstiwag liwo. Tō ige lililwo non ige bepgapgal tiwag mi ige lililwo telepnō vanvan me. Tō Akripa kōyō Bernis hayveg hay lēm̄ yōstiwag, tō kēy lep vasgēt kōyō mi namlaklak liwo. Tō Festus nōlvayēg ige bepgapgal so lep bat me Pol.<verse eid="ACT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Tō Festus nivap so, “Mayanag Akripa tiwag mi ige sil a taq sey tō gōh, atmi et van net gōh. Ige Juw del Tejerusalem tiwag mi ige mey a togtō agōh en, kēy mēvēvēhge tō no veg net agōh, tō kēy ōlōl tawtaw aso kē nitog togtog ēh se. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ba mahē a no mēvēvēg kē en, nok et etsas te hap vitwag te aso kē tamat vēh aē. Ba kē mēvēhge Sisa so nivēvēg kē. Bastō no mēdēmdēm so vētleg kē. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ba nok et etsas te dēmdēm vitwag te aso no tayap vasem vēh van hiy welan mino veg net agōh. Bastō no melep lō kē me lengomi del, yakhag yeh inēk Mayanag Akripa, tō so nēk tēvēhge vēh kē mi nēvēvēhiy bah en, tō no qoyo yap neletes aē. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Veg lēdēmdēm mino en, et wē te so tēy maymay net vitwag so vētleg kē bēvēvēg, ba et vasemlō te so kē mak tō nahap mey nehet.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pol nitigoy kē mahgen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Akripa nivap van hiy Pol so, “Nēk tohole vēh so tigoy lok nēk mahge ēgēn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Bahnentō, Pol nihog kal namnen tō niqtēg hohole. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Kē wo, “Qiyig gōh no tohole gatay natawye vēvēg del a ige Juw mak sey tō a veg no en. Tō no nemlaklak so tig lengē, Mayanag Akripa, so vulu nēdēmdēm nonoy. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Veg nēk nēglal galsi nēdēmdēm lēvēnan ige Juw, bastō nage a kēy vēyvēy vavaleh aē en. Tō nok vēhge van hiy nēk so nēk yon̄teg matdiy me hiy nohohole mino.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Ige Juw del nēglal galsi namtevuk, meqtēg tō no notogtog lepnō mino, mahē no nōlōmgep, gaydēn̄ a no motogtog tō Jerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Kēy mal ēglal tō no a nēte. So kēy temyōs en, togtō kēy tavasem vēh van hiy nēk so ino nam̄e Farisi. Veg ige Farisi natatagoy galsi yeh natawye Le del batatay nonmi den ige Juw tegtegha. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Tō nok tigtō gōh bēvēvēg veg nok dēmdēyē bavatvat non Ḡod, a kē melep tō van hiy ige yatqōtqōmi. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Navatvat nan en, ige ginwotwot son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō non ige mino, kēy se nēdēmdēyē so lep. Veg bege gōh en, kēy mogmogo Ḡod vel anqōn̄ wa vel meyen. !Mayanag, ige Juw mēvēvēg no veg bēdēmdēyē nan! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />?Bahap tō kimi dēmdēm so nemeh mi Ḡod so nilep hatig net den namte?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Hēywē, am̄ag no mahgēk dēmdēm so itōk so nok tak nahaphap m̄adeg, a so tavale tiwag mi Tigsas Tanasaret. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Tō van lelo vōnō Jerusalem en, no mak nahaphap mey nehet m̄adeg hiy ige yon̄ non Tigsas. Tō no mōm̄ōk ige m̄adeg non Tigsas lēm̄ yētyēt lahan ige pris lililwo. Tō mahē a ige lililwo muvug tiwag so vonm̄ēt so wuhmat kēy en, no memhuy aē. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Nok van walēg nēm̄ tatay so ak memeh kēy, tō vaga en, nok akak etgal so kēy so hole hethet hiy nahah a Tigsas en. No mololgagay kēy a nēkēkēn, tō no mavan lepnō tegtegha tō ak tōqtōqyeg kēy.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Veg bege gōh en, no mavanvan hiy napnō Damaskus a lahan ige pris lililwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mayanag, lēlwomyen nok vanvan lapgetō lemtehal en, tō nok etsas navalwey a mihin̄yeg me den nōtōq. Namyeyen nan nemyeyen galsi den nalo, tō mihin̄yeg walēg no tiwag mi ige a vanvan tiwag tō mi no en. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kemem del misisgoy qēt how lēvētan. Tō nok yon̄teg a nohohole vitwag mavan me den hag lōtōk en mi nagatgat non ige Tisrael, a mavap so, ‘?Sol, Sol, bahap tō nēk ak memeh tō no qele gōh? Nēk akak memeh ēwē nēk a nēk vēhyuw tō mi no anen.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Tō no wo, ‘?Inēk ihē Welan?’ Ba Welan meplu lok me so, ‘Ino Tigsas, a nēk ak memeh tō no anen. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />!Hatig ba tig mi nayn̄ē! No mal vasemlō no van hiy nēk ēgēn tō so nēk van me net yowyowveg mino. Tō nēk tavan me noyowyowveg mino bavavasemlō nahap mey a nēk met. Nēk so vasemlō van hiy ige sil nahap a nēk met tō mi namte, bastō yatkel haphap se aē a no tavasem van hiy nēk atgiy. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Tō no tavaēh nēk den ige sil nōnōm wa den ige mey a et Juw te. Tō nok so vētleg nēk hiy ige mey a et Juw te, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />so wak namtay, tō so kēy tig kēlē den namlēglēg tō van me lemyeyen. Nok vētleg nēk van hiy kēy so kēy so van yak den mahē a Satan nilwo goy, ba van me so Ḡod nimyanag goy kēy. Tō no tēdēmveteg nubug nonoy, tō no tuqul tiwag kēy mi ige mey a noyon̄ vatag veg kēy nēdēmtig no.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Mayanag Akripa, veg bege gōh en, no mēdēmap galsi nohohole a mavan me den nōtōq. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />No meqtēg Damaskus, tō mavan Jerusalem, tō mavan walēg vel vōnō a Judea, wa tō mavan hiy ige mey a et Juw te. Tō no mavasemlō van hiy ige sil so kēy so dēm leh, tō wulyis van hiy Ḡod, tō ak namgumgu mey a nivasemlō so kēy mal dēm leh. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Veg bege gōh en, ige Juw mētēy no lelo Tiy Ēm̄ Bolol, tō makak etgal so wuh no. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ba Ḡod memyin̄ tasga no gaydēn̄ me qiyig gōh, ak tō nok tig tō lengomi ige mayanag tiwag mi ige sil. Tō nok vasemlō van nēdēmdēm vēlēs mey a ige lēgēlgēg tiwag mi Mosis mavaplō tō so tak tig. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ige lēgēlgēg mavap so Kraēs toyon̄ memeh, tō kē totogyeg a mahatig den namatmat, wa tō kē taklō namyeyen hiy ige Juw tiwag mi ige mey a et Juw te.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol nihelhel etgal so niyap me Mayanag Akripa hiy Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Vētmahē a Pol nihohole nahaphap geh gōh en, kē nitigtigoy lok kēy mahgen, ba Festus mohole a nilwo so, “!Pol, nēk naqaqa! Nēk dēmdēm meh bololmeyen nōnōm, ak tō nēk maqaqa aē.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ba Pol wo, “Festus, nēk nam̄e et. Ba nok et qaqa te, nohohole mino hēyhēywē wa namanig nan aē. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Veg Mayanag Akripa nēglal galsi aē bahaphap geh agōh, tō no tohohole togolgol vēh van hiy kē. Ba nok dēm so tateh hap geh a kē et etsas te, veg nage geh gōh et wowow yoyon̄ te mahē su ēwē. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />?Mayanag Akripa, nēk nēdēmtig nohohole non ige lēgēlgēg? !Veg no nēglal so nēk nēdēmtig kēy!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Ba Mayanag Akripa mavap lok van hiy Pol wo, “?Nēk dēm van so nēk teleh togotgo vēh no so van me Nēkrēstēn lēvētmahē malte gōh?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Tō amtan Pol wo, “Sowo mahē malte, siso mahē hoyo, ba nok tatay so et inēk mahge te, ba ige del a yon̄yon̄teg tō nohohole mino qiyig gōh en, kēy so van me qele ino. Ba nējēn a kēy mēyēt no aē gōh en, nok et buste so kēy yēt kimi aē.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Bahnentō, Nēqēt Mayanag Akripa kōyō mayanag liwo Festus hatig. Tō Bernis tiwag mi ige del a mahag tiwag tō mi kēy en, kēy del hatig, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />tō kakalō den nōyōstiwag. Tō kēy hohole mahgey lokse so, “Net gōh et ak te hap mey nehet te so nimat aē siso nivan lēm̄ yētyēt.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Tō Akripa nivap van hiy Festus so, “Kamyō tukēg vēh kē, ba tateh ēgēn veg kē mahgen mēvēhge tō so Sisa so nivēvēg kē.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pol nigam hiy Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Mahē ige lililwo Torom movonm̄ēt bah so kemem so van n̄a Itali en, tō kēy metyak net vitwag so nivan tēy ige del lēm̄ yētyēt a kēy so vētleg. Kēy metyak net liwo non ige vagapgal vitwag nahan Julias en, tō kēy mōm̄ōk Pol tiwag mi yatkel et lemnen. Julias en, ikē nam̄agoy ige m̄eldēl a ige bepgapgal lēvēwti non Nēqēt Mayanag Torom. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tō kemem yem labaklap vitwag tō ēqyeg. Nabaklap nan, ikē nabaklap telepnō Adramitium, tō kēy so gam hiy nasle tegtegha a Esia. Tō net vitwag, nahan Aristakas, madam kemem. Aristakas nage Tetesalonika a lepnō Masedonia.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Tō taval meyen kemem valag dēn̄ me lesle Saydon. Ba Julias nēwē mi Pol tō kē nukēg Pol so nivan vatēp ige yaplōplōn, tō kēy leplep van nahap a kē nemyōs. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tō kemem mahatig den Saydon, tō kemem meplag tekel vōnō Sayprus mahē a natay, veg nelen̄ lengomem. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Tō kemem meplag heylō nanaw sisqet Pamfilia wa Silisia, tō van dēn̄ Mayra n̄a Lisia, so yow leh labaklap tegha. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Mahē gōh en, net liwo bepgapgal nen metsas nabaklap tegha, mey a nabaklap Taleksanria. Nabaklap nan so nivan Itali, tō kemem moyow dam nabaklap nan. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kemem magam mulumlum nōqōn̄ m̄adeg so dēn̄ napnō Nidus. Namtehal nan nēvēgih mi kemem veg kemem gamgam goy nango len̄. Bastō kemem meplag namtehal tegha, tō gam yow hiy napnō Krit. Tō kemem meplag sisiyben napnō nan, sisqet lēn̄ēlmet Salmone mahē a natay. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tō kemem magam sisiyben napnō nen ba nelen̄ namaymay meh. Tō kemem mēdēn̄ me lesle vitwag a kēy ōl so “Noyoyōm̄ mey a Mēwēwē Bah,” sisqet napnō liwo Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ba kemem memsin meh, tō Nōqōn̄ Ohoh Wenwen Bug nibah. Namanig nan veg nōwōl ne len̄ wuh tō nabaklap tit valag kēlkēl se vēhte.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nōqōn̄ Ohoh Wenwen Bug nibah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nōqōn̄ Ohoh Wenwen Bug en nōqōn̄ liwo non ige Juw a lōwōl Oktoba. Kēy sisqet nan nōwōl ne len̄ wuh.</char></note> Tō Pol nihohole vētday van hiy kēy. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />Kē wō, “Yēhē, nok et van so gēn wo mahatig den mahē gōh en, woqse haphap mey nehet taqal gēn. !Tō nahaphap a lelo baklap tiwag mi nabaklap gōh tiple qelen̄, wa tiwag a mi nēh nongēn ōk!” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ba qētēgok ne baklap tiwag mi net benon baklap et mugu goy te van lēdēmdēm non Pol, veg nasle nan et wē te belen̄ wuh. Tō net liwo bepgapgal niyon̄teg kōyō. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Bastō ige m̄adeg dēmdēm so nabaklap so nihelhel etgal so van how Finiks. (Finiks en, nasle vitwag n̄a Krit mey a itōk belen̄ wuh veg nasle nan nahag bat den namtehal ne len̄.) Tō kēy dēmdēm so tog tusu mahē nen gaydēn̄ nelen̄ nihēw.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nelen̄ wuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Tō nelen̄ mey nēwē bagamgam maqal lō me yow lelam en, tō ige ne baklap mēdēm van so namyōs nonoy mitig. Kēy mayap kal nevet lēg, tō gamgam tatag sili vōnō Krit. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ba et minis te nelen̄ maymay nivan lō me a lepnō en, a niyip en a qeleso nelen̄ wuh. Nahe len̄ nan Nelen̄ Wovet. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Nelen̄ gōh miyip maymay me tō mavantēy yak nabaklap den napnō. Kemem so gam goy nango len̄, ba tit ak vēhte, bastō kemem mukēg so nelen̄ nigamteg kemem.<verse eid="ACT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Kemem mahal tō mavan tēqēl den napnō su vitwag Kauda. Nabaklap en, nōbō-ōt su nan aē. Mahē napnō nan memelmel goy kemem den nelen̄ en, tō kemem mēlēg maymay nōbō-ōt nan, ba nage gōh et towoyig te. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Kēy melep kal bah nōbō-ōt en, ba kēy dēmdēm so nabaklap tiple mowoy. Bastō kēy lēg nagayga lōme lōqōlte baklap so ak maymay. Tō kēy mētēgteg so nabaklap tiple valag mahē sagyet, veg sisqet Libia en, mahē sagyet nam̄adeg. Bastō kēy lep hiy nagban, tō nelen̄ nitēm mulumlum ēwē nabaklap.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ba tō nelen̄ maymay muwuh kemem mak tō so, taval meyen nanhag en, kēy qētēg suwsuwyeg nahaphap den nabaklap. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lōqōn̄ vētēl negi nan hag, tō ige mugumgu labaklap mahgey suwsuwyeg nahaphap ne baklap. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kemem et et te nango lo wa nivit bōqōn̄ m̄adeg veg nelen̄ wuh namaymay meh. Tō kemem dēmdēm so kemem tamatmat qēt.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ige del et gengen te bōqōn̄ m̄adeg. Bastō Pol nihatig hag lēvētnay nen, tō nivap van hiy kēy so, “Yēhē, no mavap van hiy kimi so gēn nitog hahatig den Krit. Kimi toyon̄teg tō no en itōk. Togtō gēn tit etsas vēhte namtewot geh agōh, wa togtō nahaphap m̄adeg tit qelen̄ vēhte. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />!Ba nok vap van hiy kimi so nitog mētēgteg veg kimi del tit mat vēhte! Ba nabaklap ēwē teqlen̄. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Veg anqōn̄ kē, Ḡod a no net mugumgu nonon mēvētleg me nin̄sel. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Tō nin̄sel nan mavap so, ‘!Pol, nitog mētēgteg! Nēk titig lengon Sisa. Tō Ḡod telep van hiy nēk navatvat qelegēn: kē tavaēh qēt ige del a gamgam tiwag tō mi nēk en.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />!Tō yēhē, atmi malaklak! No nēdēmtig so nage gōh taktig qele kē mavap en. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ba nabaklap teplag kal mahē sagyet n̄a lepnō vitwag.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Tō nelen̄ magamteg kēlkēl kemem heylō Mediteranian. Lēkle qōn̄ son̄wul nanm̄e vēvet a lētnētnēqōn̄, tō ige labaklap dēm so kemem sisqet vatag napnō. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Tō kēy togyak mahē nōqōqō mi nagayga so nōqōqō qeleave. Tō kēy metsas so nōqōqō nan yop togotgo vag son̄wul yō (20). Kemem halhal van et misin te en, tō kēy tog lokse yop togotgo vag son̄wul nanm̄e tēvēlēm (15). <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Tō ige labaklap memtēgteg so kemem tiple yow kal apwo vet. Bastō kēy suwyeg nevetlēg vēvet atgiy, tō kēy tatay so namyeyen nivan togotgo me.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Tō yatkel et labaklap nemyōs so hō qelen̄ den nabaklap. Tō kēy magal so kēy so suwyeg lokse nevetlēg vitwag lengo baklap. Tō kēy lep tēqēl nōbō-ōt how lenaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ba am̄ag den kēy hēw how lōbō-ōt en, Pol nivap van hiy net liwo non ige vagapgal tiwag mi ige vagapgal nonon so, “!So kēy wo et hag lap te labaklap, tō kimi tit ēh vēhte!” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Bastō ige bepgapgal nen tig van tō hel m̄ēt nagayga den nōbō-ōt, tō kēy ukēg nōbō-ōt niqlen̄ lenaw.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Sisqet mahē nimyen, tō Pol nihole biyin̄ kēy so kēy so su gen te hap. Kē mavap van hiy kēy so, “Nōqōn̄ son̄wul nanm̄e vēvet mal vēy kelan gēn, a kimi menyēnyē tō, wa mēdēmdēm tō so gēn tamat si tateh! Tō kimi et su gen te hap hōn te. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nitog mētēgteg, veg tateh et vitwag den kimi teqlen̄. Hēywē, tateh lige vitwag tisisgoy qelen̄ den niqtimi. Veg bege gōh en, nok hole maymay van hiy kimi so atmi gengen galsi, tō kimi so ēh.”<verse eid="ACT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Pol mavap bah van hiy kēy qelegōh en, tō nilep nēbrēyt, tō mēvēwē Ḡod aē lengoy del, tō nitōq woy natvēlgi vitwag tō nigen. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ige del moyon̄teg nēwē aē, tō kēy qētēg gengen tagay se. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kemem del a labaklap en, kemem m̄eldēl vagyō son̄wul liviyō nanm̄e levete (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Kēy del megen toqsis qēt qele a kēy nemyōs en, tō nagayte gengen a mahag lap tō labaklap en, kēy musuwyeg qēt lenaw so ak momya nabaklap.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabaklap memwoywoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Mahē nimyen yow nen, tō ige labaklap etsas napnō. Kēy et ēglal te so nahan vōnō, ba kēy metsas nasle vitwag, a nēvēthiyle su aē. Tō kēy dēmdēm so valag tēy nabaklap hay lelo sele en, sowo tak vēh. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Tō kēy tēymat nabaklap so niplag. Kēy helm̄ēt nagayga ne vetlēg so nihag lap lenaw, tō kēy tēymat nowoh so lom tenenen nabaklap aē. Wa kēy yap kal nagban mey am̄ag, tō gam kal hay lēvēthiyle. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ba nabaklap moyow hag lēn̄ēlmet a yeh lapgetō den nēvēthiyle. Nan̄ye qētok moyow hag apwo n̄ēlmet a tit kalō lok vēhte. Wa nakye baklap nimwoywoy veg nanaw lililwo nimlamlat van aē.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ige bepgapgal nan vonm̄ēt nēdēmdēm vitwag so wuh qēt ige tog tō lēm̄ yētyēt a labaklap en, veg so kēy tiple geygey vivitwag tō valaplag qeleqlen̄. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ba veg net liwo Julias nemyōs so nivaēh Pol en, tō kē nigatgoy kēy. Ba kē mōlvayēg totogyeg so ige mey a tegey vēh en, kēy yow lenaw ba gey kal aslil. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Ba ige mey a et ēglal te geygey en, tō kēy tēy neyep wa natvētvēl yep so hal apwon, tō gey kal aslil. Tō ige del a labaklap en megey kal aslil en qeleanen.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pol lelo vōnō Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Mahē kemem mēdēn̄ galsi aslil en, tō kemem mēglal van so napnō gōh nahan Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Nasm̄al niqtēg sam̄al wa mahē nomomyiy, ba ige telepnō nan natamtam, veg kēy meben nep liwo tō lep vasgēt kemem del.<verse eid="ACT 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Tō Pol nivēlvēlsey me nēyēt lēt liwo, tō nim̄ōksey nēyēt lēt hag apwo ep. Mahē a nep mesew en, tō nam̄at n̄itn̄it nitesolō me, tō nin̄it maymay namnen Pol. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ige lepnō nen et van qelekē nam̄at n̄itn̄it dam tō lemnen Pol, tō kēy hohole mahgey so, “Net gōh, ikē net buwuwuh et! Ikē et mat te lenaw, ba ḡod bēvēvēg et buste so kē niēh.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ba Pol metetetn̄eg namnen ewo tō nam̄at nan nisisgoy n̄a lep. Ba Pol et metewot te. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ige sil mēdēmdēm so namnen Pol tēyēg, siso kē tisisgoy tō nimat. Tō kēy menyē tō metgoy kē van a nemsin, ba tateh hap niak Pol aē. Bastō kēy leh lok nēdēmdēm nonoy, tō vap so, “Akē ḡod vitwag agōh.”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ba mahē a kemem tog tō aē en et yeh te den nēvētan non mayanag telepnō anen, nahan Publius. Kē melep vasgēt kemem n̄a lepnō nonon, wa metgoy galsi kemem. Tō kemem motog tiwag mi kē bōqōn̄ vētēl. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Ba imam non Publius nogom liwo, nogom momyiy nak kē, wa natqan meplag. Tō Pol nivatēp kē, wa nim̄ōk namnen hag apwon net gom nan, nitatay goy kē, tō kē niwē lokse. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Lēklan me atgiy, ige gom del lepnō nen van se me hiy Pol en, tō kēy se mēwē. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Tō kēy mēdēmap kemem tō mēvēl me natapēva a nam̄adeg. Tō kemem motog tiwag mi kēy nōwōl vētēl. Mahē a kemem tēytēymat so van en, kēy mēvēl se me hiy kemem nahaphap aso biyin̄ kemem aē lemtehal.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mavan Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Nabaklap vitwag mahal lap tō lepnō gōh mahē nelen̄ namaymay. Nabaklap nan Taleksanria, tō ige labaklap meplakas nango qētok mi nototgal non ḡod vayam nonoy. Tō kemem gam yak lok mi nabaklap nan. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tō kemem mēdēn̄ lepnō liwo Sirakus, tō memtiy bōqōn̄ vētēl. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Tō kemem ēqyeg, tō gam walēg hiy Regium. Tō taval meyen Nelen̄ Hey nihatig. Tō taval meyen lokse kemem dēn̄ me Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Tō kemem metsas ige dēmtig yatkelgi van anen, tō kēy mēvēhge kemem so tog tiwag mi kēy niwik vitwag. Bahnentō kemem hatig den mahē nen tō vanvan hiy Rom.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Tō ige dēmtig n̄a Rom en moyon̄teg so kemem vanvan me ēgēn, tō kēy vanvan me wa vēyhēgēt mi kemem lemtehal. Ige gōh mavan me a yeh tewiwi, yatkel et mavan me den Apius Maket, wa yatkel et se den napnō a nahan Nabangalo Vētēl. Mahē a Pol metsas kēy en, nēhyēn mamaymay lok, tō kē mēvēwē Ḡod aē.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol lelo vōnō Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Bahnentō, kemem dēn̄ me Rom. Tō ige bepgapgal mukēg Pol so nitog mahgen tiwag mi net bepgapgal vitwag aso nietetgoy kē. <verse eid="ACT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Lēkle qōn̄ vētēl Pol nivētleg goy ige lililwo non ige Juw a van lepnō anen. Kēy mavan tiwag me en, tō kē nivap van hiy kēy so, “Yēhē yathithik, nok et ak te hap mey nehet te hiy ige sil nongēn siso lēvēnan ige yatqōtqōngēn. Ba kēy mētēy no n̄a Jerusalem tō mōm̄ōk no van lemnen ige Torom. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Tō ige Torom mēvēhge sosok so no mak nahan het, ba kēy et etsas hōn te het te aso no tamat vēh aē. Tō kēy nemyōs so ukēg wawah no den nēm̄ yētyēt, <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />ba ige Juw et buste. Bastō no mēvēhge mimiy ēwē so Sisa so nivēvēg no. Ba nok et vap te hap mey nehet te hiy ige sil mino. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Veg bege goh en, no mēvēhge so yōstiwag mi kimi aē. Kēy mēlēg no mi nējēn gōh veg no nēdēmtig navatvat a Ḡod melep tō van hiy ige Tisrael.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Tō ige Juw nen vulu goy kē van so, “Kemem et tēy te letes te siso noyoy veg nēk den Judea. Wa ige yathithimi mey a mal van tō me den Judea en, kēy et vasemlō te hap mey nehet te veg nēk, tateh. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ba kemem nemyōs so yon̄teg nēdēmdēm nōnōm. Veg gēn nēglal so ige sil a vel mahē geh nōk en, kēy hole visipteg tō nēvēwti nōnōm.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Tō Pol tiwag mi ige Juw nen etyak nōqōn̄ vitwag aso kēy so yōstiwag aē. Lōqōn̄ nen en, ige Juw m̄adeg woy mavan me tō met Pol a mahē a kē togtog aē en. Meqtēg lemtap, dēn̄ lemyēpyep en, kē mavap m̄ōleg nēdēmdēm ne meyeyen talge non Ḡod. Wa kē makak etgal so kēy dēmtig nēdēmdēm veg Tigsas. Mahē a kē nihohole qelegōh en, kē nihole gatay Nele non Mosis tiwag mi nayapyap namun ige lēgēlgēg.<verse eid="ACT 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Yatkel Juw mēdēmtig nohohole non Pol, ba yatkelgi et dēmtig te. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Tō ige Juw m̄ōlm̄ōl ba a mi nēvēy vavaleh vēlēs. Ba am̄ag den kēy m̄ōlm̄ōl en, Pol nihole nage vitwag van hiy kēy so, “Nohohole a Nuvu Yon̄ mohole heylō net lēgēlgēg Isaya van hiy ige tamatmayge nongēn hēyhēywē, so,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Nēk van ba vasem van hiy ige nōk so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">kimi toyon̄teg, toyon̄teg ba kimi tit yon̄teg vēglal vēhte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Kimi tet, tet, ba tit et vēglal vēhte.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Veg nēdēmdēm nonoy mal maymay qēt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">wa nēdēln̄ay mal wonwon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">wa kēy mal vatqep namtay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">So tateh tō en, togtō kēy tet mi namtay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">wa toyon̄teg mi nēdēln̄ay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">wun kēy tōm̄ōleg vēh lēdēmdēm nonoy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Tō kēy teleh vēh nēdēmdēm nonoy tō dēmtig no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">tō no tak wē lokse kēy.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 6:9-10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“Bastō nok vaplō van hiy kimi so Ḡod tēvētleg noyoy nonon bēh gayaq hiy ige mey a et Juw te, tō ikēy en, kēy toyon̄teg.”<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Kē mohole bah en, tō ige Juw m̄ōlm̄ōl ba a mi nēvēy vavaleh vēlēs.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nohohole leyte 29 nivan me den nayte 25, ba yatkel Baebol tam̄ag a lagatgat Tikrik mōm̄ōk nohohole gōh mahē gōh.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pol motog bēte wonwon vōyō lēm̄ a kē niwēlwēl. Tō ige mey a vanvan me so vatēp kē en, kē telep vasgēt kēy del. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kē nitoytoy bemyeyen talge non Ḡod, wa nivatvatne ige sil veg Welan Tigsas Kraēs, a tateh dēmdēm mētēgteg geh mi kē, wa tateh et nihigoy kē den nohohole.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>